<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Ombo Traduction</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Besako Belɔti be Yesu Kilisito <optbreak /> ŋango baandiki Luka.</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">WIINGELELO</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka koandeki linɛ libuku. Wiiki nde wiinngi, lonkinɛ phaiki Muyuda. Waandeki linɛ libuku aliko aasimele bale bapha Bayuda Besako Belɔti be nkakolama mbetela Yesu Kilisito. La ndako kaandeki libuku ja Bisima be Baeki. Luka nɛmɛlɛ koo mɛna Yesu, kinaki ochichi ike la mona besao aliko la Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka olende ataɛnya nte Yesu Kilisito kole Bɔna a Ɔnto aandi mona la nkakola banto ba limeli (Luka 19.10). Lonkinɛ ataɛnya nte Yesu wɛɛnɛli banto ŋandi banɛ baelolelami wɛɛnte: baola, bainto, la bana. Luka ɔmbɔlɔnda aliko la bolemo ba Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ wiingo biiki Yesu atakee.</para>
  <para style="ip">Libuku ja Luka nde liyalaka litale ike ndeka ma buku lalikuli ba lilaka ja kasende. Omanja linɛ libuku, Luka ɔmbɔlɔnda ike aliko la mbotama ya Yesu (Luka 1-2), ɔmbɔlɔnda lonkinɛ aliko la jooti ja Yesu (Luka 3.23-38). Lonkinɛ ɔmbɔlɔnda aliko la mbatisama ya Yesu (Luka 3.21), la nkekelama yande la Bosombo (Luka 4.1-13), la bolemo bande (Luka 4-21), la ntumbyama yande waalemba (Luka 22-23), la ntondwa yande (Luka 24). Pa ŋango Luka ɔmbɔlɔnda ŋango wiyɛnyisa Yesu lonkinɛ o baeki bande mala ike pa ntondwa yande. Aalɔngɔsɔli o bolemo ba mbekya Besako Belɔti waanto. Okantunda, Luka ɔlɔndi bolengo nke Kanamombe obuulisa Yesu e loola.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Otango be besao be Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Bokuchu Tɛɔfilɔ, kolende la banto bankinɛ ba kekeli mandika aliko la besao bengo bepaseli asamba iso. Aliko la nkekemya besao be Kanamombe. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Baandeki bengo besao wɛɛnte ŋango batosimeli bango baɛni manja katango la bango baɔyami bolemo ba mbekya bosao ba Kanamombe. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />La lemi, la chichi, la laeyi bɔlɔti nte bolemo ba Yesu, manja katango nende lɛlɔ. Ko bingo bimo ntoma lemi nkwandekele Bɔkɔta Theofilo. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Mbokuandekela aliko landalange weeye sɔlɔ e besao beekisa wɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilaka ja mbotama ja Yɔani oso mbatisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Eleko iiki Elɔde Bɔkɔta ba Yudeya, kwiki bonto ɔmɔɔ aelelamaki Sakaliya. Ɔnɛ Sakaliya, aiki ɔmɔɔ asamba boloi ba baeta atei* ba Abiya. Waajande aiki ataelelama Elisabeti, a jooti ja Aluni. Ɔnɛ Aluni wiiki nde weeta atei* otango asamba Isilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Sakaliya la Elisabeti bako baphee baiki solo otamboka ba Kanamombe. Baiki batalingita bɔlɔti Isaliya* lalikuli ya Bɔkɔta. Lankɛɛ ŋango batalɔndama kako. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Kinaki, bataika la bɔna. Aliko Elisabeti aiki nde ekomba. La bako aphee baiki bake bekongo.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Wiina ɔmɔɔ, Sakaliya aiki atakee bolemo bande ba weeta atei* e lulu la Kanamombe, aliko kwiki nde loso lande la nkamba o boloi baɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Ŋango o ningitana la Isaliya* ya Baeta atei*, Sakaliya kasɔnami ɔ nkɛɛ esiko, wɛɛnte ŋango baiki Isaliya* yaɔ, mingela e lulu la Kanamombe aliko la ntumba ichwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Mpasa 30.7-8</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Weengo eleko Sakaliya aiki atachumbe ichwa boloi bɔnɛnɛ baa Kilisito* baiki batalɔmbɛ anja ango achumbaki bako ichwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Pa, ephongo* ɛmɔɔ ɛ Bɔkɔta apaseli Sakaliya otema ba lulu la Kanamombe. Aemalaki o likasa ja loome ja Alɔtalɛ*, ango achumbaki bako ichwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Ango aɛni Sakaliya ephongo*, aitwe la ndawa ike. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Kinaki, ongo ephongo* aosimeli: «Sakaliya, kɔlawake, aliko Kanamombe ombooka malɔmbi baɛ. Waajabɛ Elisabeti akondo kootela bɔna ɔmɔɔ ɔnɛ aŋunyeya wɛɛ Yɔani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Akondo yala la libɛla linɛnɛ la banto ike bakondo wɛɛbɛya o mbotama yande. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Ongo bɔna akondo yala bonto bɔnɛnɛ otamboka ba Bɔkɔta. Phanywaki difai aɔ baana lalikuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Jaali 6.3.</char></note>. Akondo ojamaka Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ manja oloko o likundu ja nyɛŋɛnde.<verse eid="LUK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />«Akondo baucha ba Isilaeli ike ele Bɔkɔta Kanamombe abɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Malaki 2.6.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Akonoanda wɛɛnte bɔkwɛɛ ba Kanamombe. La mɛnyama la nkulu ya Lɔkɛngɛ wɛɛnte wɛɛni* Eliya. Akondo uŋanya baoti la bana baɔ. Akondo engola basolo ba bale phaaimeya Kanamombe*, aliko baba nkulu ya mbeya besao wɛɛnte banto bale balɔti otamboka ba Kanamombe. Ŋaanɛ akondo o kicheya Bɔkɔta banto ba mbɔwɛɛbɛya».<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Kinaki, Sakaliya aumboli ongo ephongo* nte: «Nkee ɛmɛnya nte, bengo bosao betalɔndɛ wɛɛ belende sɔlɔ? Aliko lemi la waajami tokende bekongo». <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />La ephongo* awuuchisa: «Lemi ko Gabilieli, lemi koemalaka otamboka ba Kanamombe. Omontoma kabɛ nte nkosimele bɛnɛ Besako Belɔti. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Kinaki, bɛnɛ besao bekokyamaki weeleko be kichisa Kanamombe. Anɛ aliko wɛɛ koo mimeya akondo yala eluma. Phɔlɔndaki lonkinɛ nende ango akokyamaki bengo besao».<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Weengo eleko, banto bakongaki Sakaliya ango anja ba sebalali aliko la nembela ike otema ba lulu la Kanamombe*. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Apasi Sakaliya anja, koo mbɔsɔna nɔnda. Ompita ntoo kaanjisa ndako nɔnda la banto aliko wiiki oke eluma. Ango bakanyaki nte ɔmbɔlala lilɔ otema ba lulu ba Kanamombe*.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Eleko esili Sakaliya biina bende be nkamba o lulu la Kanamombe, autoli kande. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Pa biina inchɛ, waajande Elisabɛti aɛmbi likundu. Ajiisisha otema ba lulu weeleko ɛ ŋɔndɔ itano. Wiiki oke atalɔndɛ nte: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Lenda nyo bilɔti bimonkeela Bɔkɔta! Omo mpasha nsɔni ya njala ekomba otamboka baanto lalikuli».<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ephongo Gabiliyeli ombo lɔnda aliko la mbotama ya Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Eleko ekokisa likundu ja Elisabeti ŋɔndɔ isamalo, Kanamombe atomi ephongo* Gabilieli nchwa ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Nasalɛti, o wooni ba Galilaya, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />ele bophoko ɔmɔɔ eliphe aelelamaki Maliya. Ɔnɛ bophoko aiki atalakema la bomponjo ɔmɔɔ aelelamaki Yɔsɛfu, aiki e jooti ja Bɔkɔta Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Ongo ephongo* aochweli la mboosimela: «Ɔmbwɛ Maliya! Wiisɛkɛyɛ aliko Bɔkɔta ɔmbɔ kɔya wɛɛsɛ ike, lonkinɛ olende kaama kamɔɔ labɛ».<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Aoki Maliya bengo besako aluani ike. Aanjisa mbwiumbola nte: «Inɛ mbɛbɛyama ya ephongo yatalange nɔnda nke»? <figure style="fig" alt="L' ange dit à Marie qu' elle va engendrer Jésus" file="DN00401b.tif" size="span" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="1.29">Ephongo asimeli Maliya nte akondoota Yesu </figure> <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Kinaki Ephongo* aosimeli nte: «Oka! Ko lawake Maliya, aliko Kanamombe ɔmbɔ kɔɔya wɛɛsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Akɔnɔɛmba likundu, akondo ota bɔna a mpame, la akondo oŋunyɛya lokombo lande Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Akondoyala waiyolo lonkinɛ akondo elelama Bɔna a Kanamombe ole eliko. Bɔkɔta Kanamombe nɛmɛlɛ akondo wɔɔya Bɔkɔta ba nkende Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Akondo lomba tiiti jooti ja Isilaeli, la Bɔkɔta bande phaatayale la kantunda».<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maliya aumboli ephongo* nte: «Onde bɛnɛ besao bɛɔsɔna nkɛɛma namuna nke la lemi ntaeye ba mpame»? <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Ephongo* lande aosimeli nte: «Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ lakondo kokitelela, la nkulu ya Kanamombe ole e loola yakondo kolipha wɛɛnte elenge lenge. Bingo nde bechika bɔna aotama akondo yala Lɔɛlɔ la mbelelama Bɔna a Kanamombe. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Oka! Aotwa labɛ Elisabeti olende la likundu ja ŋɔndɔ isamalo, ya bɔna a mpame, ɔnɛ ole bokongo lonkinɛ ekomba. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Aliko, koo ekambwa ele phekesane ele Kanamombe». <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Ango Maliya ɔlɔndi: «Lemi nende bokambi a Bɔkɔta, kokɛɛmɛ ŋango bɔmbɔ lɔnda wɛɛ». Pa ephongo* achwe lande.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliya ɔmbɔ kɛndɛla Elisabɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Pa biina inchɛ, Maliya achwe lɔango nende ɔɔsɛngɛ bɔmɔɔ ba bɛɔkɔ ba booni ba Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Aiye ndako engo, aingeli e lulu la Sakaliya aɛbɛisa Elisabɛti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Ango aoki Elisabɛti m'mbɛbɛyama ya Maliya, bɔna aiki e likundu jande oke ntɛka ntɛka. Elisabɛti aojami la Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Aokomi la nɔnda nte, omboba wɛɛsɛ ndeka bainto lalikuli, la bɔna aota wɛɛ ombo chwelama bochwako. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Lemi ko nani ɔnɛ a nkɛndɛla nyɛŋɛnde la Bɔkɔta? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Aliko, ango a m'mbɛbɛisa wɛɛ, bɔna ole o likundu jami ombotɛka ike la libɛla. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Alombele wɛɛ aliko wiimisa nte bingo bikosimeli Bɔkɔta bekondo kokyama too!<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɔkɛlwa ba Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />La ndako Maliya alɔndi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Lisolo jami jata kucha Bɔkɔta ike,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />lonkinɛ jata isɛkɛya la Kanamombe ike ole Bokakoli ami.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Aliko, o nendi lemi bokambi ande ole lapha ekambwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Kolende sɔlɔ, manja lɛlɔ banto lalikuli bakondo yala batambelelaka bonto a sɔlɔ,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />aliko, Kanamombe ɔmɛlɛ nkulu, ɔmɔ nkeela bikambwa binɛnɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Lokombo lande sɔlɔ lolende lɔɛlɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Eleko la likuli akondo yala atamɛnya bɔlɔti bande o bango bale mbookuchaka.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Mbetela likasa jande ɔmbɔkɛɛ bikambwa binɛnɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">Ombobalaŋanya banto lalikuli bale la basolo ba mbwiɛmba.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Baso nomba, ombwakicheya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">la baɔla ombo bauleya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Yɔbu 5.11; 12.19.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Banɛ baokaki botala ombo akɛɛ baso nombo kinaki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">baso nombo ombo baucha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">bakasa phololo.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Waandi mamola banto bande Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">la koo mbophela mbɔwɛɛnya bɔlɔti bande,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />wɛɛnte ŋango balakeli ndako Ibulaimu la jooti jande,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">bingo belɔndi ndako la nkɛnyo tiiti».<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maliya oyali ele Elisabɛti ilango ŋɔndɔ isato. Pa autoli kaɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbotama ya Yɔani oso mbatisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Aiye kako eleko e Elisabɛti mbota, aoti bɔna a mpame. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Ba mamani lande la baotwa lande, abae bako besako nte Bɔkɔta ɔmbɔ wɛɛnɛla ŋandi ike, ba isɛkisa kaama kamɔɔ la ndako.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Bɔna akokisa ndako biina ɛnaanɛi la mbotama bachwe mbowiila e weembe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Balawi 12. 3.</char></note>. Baoni mbooŋunyeya lokombo la isende, Sakaliya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Kinaki, nyɛŋɛnde la ɔna aasimeli nte: «Jɛ! Akondo ŋunyeyama lokombo la Yɔani». <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />La bako baosimeli nte: «O bolunga banyo koo bonto lalikuli aiki la lɔnɛ lokombo»!<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Wiingo, bawuumboli isɛnde la bɔna la mpita nte: «Lokombo nke lalanga wɛɛ toŋunyeya bɔna»? <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Sakaliya aalɔmbi iteni ya lobaɔ, aandeki aliko ya yako nte: «Lokombo la bɔna ko Yɔani». Bako lalikuli basebalali. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Kako nkango, lɔlemu la Sakaliya lalipholami lonkinɛ, aanjisa lonkinɛ nɔnda la nsakoya Kanamombe ike. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Bango bamamani lande lalikuli babaemi la wɔɔma. Bengo besako be balaŋani wɛɛsɛngɛ lalikuli biiki ɔ bɛɔkɔ be Yudɛya.<verse eid="LUK 1:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Banto lalikuli baoki bɛnɛ besako, baiki bataiyumbola waasolo baɔ batalɔndɛ: «Ɔnɛ bɔna ombootama a yala lɛlɔ a bolengo nke»? Sɔlɔ nkulu ya Bɔkɔta iiki kaama kamɔɔ lande.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɔkɛlwa ba wɛɛni Sakaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Sakaliya, isɛnde la bɔna, aojami la Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ, la manja nɔnda ŋaanɛ:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Akuchame Bɔkɔta Kanamombe ka Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">aliko, omwanda mamola banto bande la mbwakakola.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Ombo totomela bokakoli boso nkulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">ombo pasela asamba jooti ja bokambi ande Daudi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Ingo imbolingitana la bolengo ba lɔndaki ndako katango, mbetela baɛni* bande baɛlɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:70">nte:<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Akondototomela ongo atokakola mima waakasa be bitamba beso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">la ntopasha waakasa baanto bata tonine.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Wɛɛnyisa ŋandi ende waankɛso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">lonkinɛ koo mbophela lilaka* jande lɔɛlɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Okee ŋango, ningitana la ŋango, balapeli ndako nkɛso Ibulaimu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />nte akondo tokakola waakasa be bitamba beso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">aliko tookambele koo wɔɔma,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />ɔ lɔɛlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">la nkɛɛ bile sɔlɔ otamboka lande,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">biina lalikuli be luiko laso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.75 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Otango 22. 16-17.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Labɛ bɔna ami, bakondo yala bata koelela wɛɛni* a Kanamombe ole e loola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">aliko, wɛɛ akondo iya otamboka la Bɔkɔta mbiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">aliko ɔɔ lɔngɔsɔlɛlɛ mboka.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Lonkinɛ wɛɛ kasimela banto bande nte omoanda mbwakakola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">ombwasokolela njambi yaɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Ningitana la ŋango Kanamombe aso oyalaka la ŋandi ike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">Akondo totomela ekowa eliko wɛɛnte yaani ya mpendu inɛ ya tɔɛnya.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Akondo ɛnya baso njala e wiilima, la bale njala asamba elenge lenge e bojo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">aliko atoamole ningita mboka e bii».<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Ongo bɔna aoli, la amemeisa njala waiyolo. Achwe njala oosowe* nende luina la iɛnyisa ndako waanto ba Isilaɛli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Mbotama ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Luina longo, Bɔkɔta Ogisito Baalɔma, apasisha Isaliya nte nkombo yaanto lalikuli ya wooni ya konjami la Balɔma yaandekame. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Mandeka nkombo ya mala ntango ya bongo bolengo, ya kɛɛmi eleko eiki Kulɛnilɔ Bɔkɔta ba wooni ba Suliya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Banto lalikuli baandi mbwi andikisa, kila onto wɔɔsɛngɛ bande ba mbotama.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yɔsɛfu la ndako mimela Galilaya ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Nasalɛti. Achwe e Yudeya ɔɔsɛngɛ baotami Bɔkɔta Daudi, baelelamaki Bɛtɛlɛɛmu. Achwe engo aliko aiki o bolunga ba Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />O nchwa mbwi andikisa achwe la Maliya ko bophoko aiki ndako atalake aiki la likundu mɛ la mbota. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Eleko eiki bako engo Bɛtɛlɛɛmu, luina la mbota yande ya koki. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Aoti weembe ande, bɔna a mpame. Aɔlɔtisa bisenda be likɛnda, la mboolaja ɔ lɔphɛphɛ longo lalelaki nyama aliko koo mba kaama e lulu laaŋɛni.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ephongo asimeli bachungi besako be mbotama be Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Oongo wooni, kwiki la bachungi. Bango bachungi baiki batayale wiileme o nchunga nyama yaɔ la ocho. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Kako nkango ephongo* ɛ Bɔkɔta aapaseli, la ekowa e bokuchu ɛ Bɔkɔta kebaenyisa kaama lalikuli. Balawi ike. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Kinaki, ephongo* aasimeli: «Kɔlawake nyo, aliko mbo kwela nyo besako belɔti bɛnɛ belangya banto lalikuli ike. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Lɛlɔ, bokakoli anyo ombootama ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Daudi, ataelelama Kilisito* lonkinɛ Bɔkɔta anyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ɛnɛ ɛkwɛɛnya nyo nte ndako nkɛɛnɛ: akondotana nyo bɔna omboliphama bisenda be likɛnda, ombolajema ɔ lɔphɛphɛ loleelaka nyama». <figure style="fig" alt="Les Bergers reçoivent la nouvelle de la naissance de Jesus" file="WA03603b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="2.12">Bachungi bamboba besako be mbotama ya Yesu</figure><verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Kako nkango, ongo ephongo* aɛnamwe oke la boloi bɔnɛnɛ ba biphongo bankinɛ mima e loola batakucha Kanamombe nte:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Kanamombe a kuchame e loola la banto balangaka ndako e wooni babaa bii»!<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bachungi bambochwa mɛna bɔna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Pa biphongo* baaŋani la bachungi, la bautoli e loola. Ango bachungi baanjisa nsimelana nte: «Wiingo tochu e Bɛtɛlɛɛmu, aliko tɔɛni o besao bɛmbɔkɛɛma, bengo betosimeli Bɔkɔta».<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Bachwe engo loango batani Yɔsɛfu la Maliya la bɔna bɔkɛnyɛ ombolajema ɔ lɔphɛphɛ lolelaaka nyama. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Eleko esili bachungi mɛna bɔna, bachwe nsimeli banto besako bɛnɛ ephongo* aasimeli aliko la ongo bɔna. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Banto lalikuli baoki bengo besao, bɛlɔndi bachungi basebalali ike. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Kinaki, Maliya wiiki atakicha bengo besao lalikuli o lisolo jande la njala ataiyumbola aliko la beko ike. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />E kantunda bango bachungi bautoli, baiki batachu batakucha Kanamombe la mbo weembela aliko la besao lalikuli beoki bako la mɛna. Aliko batani besao lalikuli ŋango baasimeli ephongo.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo ŋunyeama lokombo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Akokisa bɔna biina ɛnaanɛi be mbotama, bawiili e weembe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Weembe Baayuda bomboesanya la weembe ba Baɔmbɔ batatɔlɛ batɛndɛ o jaa o mbaisha.</char></note>, pa mbilama e weembe baɔŋunyisa lokombo la Yesu, lɔnɛ laɛnyami ndako la ephongo* otamboka la Maliya mɛmba likundu.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɔmbɔ tɔlama e lulu la Kanamombe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Luina la mbɔkyama ya Yɔsɛfu la Maliya ya koki ningitana la Isaliya* ya Musa. Baoti ba Yesu bawɛɛmbi ɛ Yɛlusalɛma nte bawɛɛnya ɔmbɔweela ele Bɔkɔta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɔsɔmɛ Balawi 12. 2-6</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Bakɛɛ ŋango aliko, kaandekami ŋango wiisaliya* ya Bɔkɔta nte: «Kila weembe lalikuli a mpame akondo yala a Bɔkɔta». <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Lonkinɛ bapashisha mpato* ningitana la isaliya* ya Bɔkɔta ile nɔndaka nte: «bilenga biphee aɔ biasa biphee beelenga».<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛnyama ya Simo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛlusalɛma kaiki bonto ɔmɔɔ aelelamaki Simo. Ongo Simo wiiki nde bonto a sɔlɔ atamboka ba Kanamombe la boso mbo wiimeya. Wiiki atakonge nkakolama yaanto ba Isilaeli. Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ wiiki kaama kamɔɔ la ndako, <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />lonkinɛ wiiki ataɛnyama nte phaɔsɔna mbwa iya ataɛni Kilisito* atomama la Bɔkɔta*. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Simo wiiki ataɛnyama la Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ, aingeli e lulu la Kanamombe* baoti ba Yesu bawɛɛmbi otema nte baokokeye ŋango bɔlɔndaka Isaliya*. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simo aɛbisa bɔna Yesu waakasa bande, la nkucha Kanamombe, la nɔnda:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Bɔkɔta, ɔmbɔ kɛɛ bosao bɔnɛ bolaki wɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">anɛ aɔsɔna linsanjiya lemi bokambi abɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">m'mbwibweele lami o bii.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Aliko lemi nɛɛmɛlɛ mbwiɛnɛla bokakoli* ɔnɛ ombotoma wɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Ɔmbɔ ɔlɔngɔsɔla aliko ayale bokakoli* baanto lalikuli.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Ongo bokakoli ko ekowa ɛ ɛnya banto lalikuli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">lonkinɛ ndako ka ɔya banto baɛ bokuchu».<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Bengo besao belɔndi Simo aliko la Yesu, baoti bande ba sebalali. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Pa, Simo aachweli bochwako, aosimeli Maliya nyɛŋɛnde la bɔna nte: «Oka nyo: ɔnɛ bɔna ombootama aliko akwɛɛya banto e Isilaɛli la memaya ike asamba bako. Akondo yala imbali mima ele Kanamombe ɛnɛ ekila banto ike. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Laanɛ bamanya baanto ike bale bamboisama bakondoeyama. La wɛɛmɛlɛ akondoɛna tosoya wɛɛnte ongo ɔmbɔtɛmɔlama likɔnga o lisolo».<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana ombo sakoya Kanamombe aliko la Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Kaiki, la wɛɛni ɔmɔɔ a wainto bokongo aelelamaki Ana. Aiki bophoko a Fanuɛli, a jooti ja Asheli. Ɔnɛ Ana okee bilongi esambaele too be nsɔŋama, bome ande abwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Ochikali obwele nende eleko iiki ndako oke bokongo ba bilongi baomu ɛnaanɛi la inɛi. Wiiki ataseke e lulu la Kanamombe atakambela Kanamombe bocho la yaani. Atalɔmbɛ koo ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />La ndako wiiye weengo eleko e Simo, la aanjisa nsakoya Kanamombe. Wiiki atalɔndɛ besako be Yesu waanto lalikuli banɛ bakongaki ŋango bakakola Kanamombe banto ba Yɛlusalɛma o tosoya taɔ.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baoti ba Yesu bambo utola e Nasalɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Baoti ba Yesu basili nkɛɛ lalikuli bile Isaliya* ya Bɔkɔta yatalɔndɛ. Pa bautoli la ndako ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Nasalɛti e wooni ba Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Bɔna amemeisa mbola la mba nkulu. Wiiki omboola la lokani, la wɛɛsɛ ba Kanamombe wiiki lande.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɔna Yesu e lulu la Kanamombe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Kila ilongi, baoti ba Yesu baiki la bolengo ba nchwa e Yɛlusalɛma o libɛla ja Pasaka*. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Ango Yesu wiiki la bilongi joomu la iphee, ndako la baoti bande bauleli bako lalikuli nchwa o libɛla ja Pasaka* ŋango baiki bolengo Baayuda. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Ango asili libɛla ja Pasaka*, baoti ba Yesu bautoli kaɔ. Kinaki, Yesu achikali e Yɛlusalɛma, bako koo mbeya. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Bakanyaki nte Yesu olende asamba bolili ba baina labɔ ba lɔkɛndɔ. Bakɛndi wiina lalikuli, baanjisa mbowoona asamba baotwa landako la baeyana la ndako. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Kinaki, koo mboo wɛɛna. Wiingo bautoli lonkinɛ nende e Yɛlusalɛma o mbowoona.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Pa biina besato, baotani e lulu la Kanamombe*, atayale la Baekisi ba Isaliya* atabaoke la mboba umbola. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Banto lalikuli baokaki bengo besao, basebalali la lokani lande la mbucheya yande ya limanya. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ango awɛɛni baoti bande, basebalali. Ango nyɛngɛnde awuumboli nte: «Aeeh bɔna ami, aliko laanke embo tokɛɛla wɛɛ ŋaanɛ? Lemi la isɛɛ twiiki la nkangi ike o nkoona». <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />La Yesu abauchisa: «Aliko laanke etamone nyo? Phaeye nyo nte kasana njale e lulu la Isɛmi»? <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Kinaki, baoti bande koo mbeya aliko laanke embwasimela ndako ŋango.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />E kantunda, Yesu autoli la bako e Nasalɛti. Wiiki atakee ŋango baosimelaki baoti bande. Bengo besao lalikuli nyɛŋɛnde wiiki ataikicha o lisolo jande. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />La Yesu wiiki ataole la lokani la ntinda, lonkinɛ omemeisa nangya Kanamombe* la banto.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Mbekya ya Yɔani oso mbatisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mlk 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoa 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Kaiki nde wiilongi joomu la itano, weeleko e Bɔkɔta* Tibɛliyɔ, Poso Pilato aiki Bɔkɔta ba Yudeya. Elɔde aiki Bɔkɔta* ba Galilaya, la aotwa lande Filipi aiki Bɔkɔta* ba bɛsɛngɛ ba Ituleya la Talakoniti. La Lusaniya aiki Bɔkɔta ba Abilɛnɛ, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />la Anasi la Kayafa baiki Bɛkɔta be baeta atei*. Weengo eleko, ko besao be Kanamombe biiyeli Yɔani bɔna a Sakaliya engo woosowe. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Laango, Yɔani achwe wɛɛsɛngɛ lalikuli biiki mɛ la losi Yɔlɔdani. Aiki ataekya banto ba imeye la mbatisama aliko Kanamombe aba sokolele njambi yaɔ. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Kole ŋango baandekami kako e libuku ja wɛɛni Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Jooi ja onto ɔmɔɔ ja okami woosowe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‹Lɔngɔsɔlɛla nyo Bɔkɔta mboka ende;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">sembola nyo mboka yande.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Likilikili lalikuli jakondo ojama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">bɛɔkɔ la bekondi lalikuli bekondo sɛngɔlama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">bamuna lalikuli bakondo sembo lama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">mboka mbe yakondo lɔngɔsɔlama.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />La banto lalikuli bakondo ɛna nkakolama yaanda la Kanamombe›».<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Laango, Yɔani asimelaki banto ike ba iyaki nte aabatise: «Nyo jooti ja ndwa! Nani akuekisa nyo ndawa losingo la Kanamombe lataande»? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Yala nyo ataɛnya nte mimeya yanyo mbetela belengo benyo. Koanjake nyo mbwi lɔndɛla: «Isɛso ko Ibulaimu! Aliko, mbo kosimela nyo sɔlɔ, Kanamombe aɔsɔna mengola babwɛ banɛ bayale bana ba Ibulaimu. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />La liswa lilende tayali weejo beete; laango, bote lalikuli bole phaaote biuma bilɔti ba kondo tenama la mbokama wiiya».<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Boloi ba anto ba wuumboli: «Tokɛɛ ŋaande»? <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yesu abauchisa: «Ole la bisenda bi phee aɔya ɔnɛ ole apha la bisenda, ole la lilɛ akɛɛ ŋango akɔ».<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />La baso ngɛja kɔdi baandi la bako mbatisama, bawuumboli Yɔani: «Weekisi, tɔkɛɛ ŋaande»? <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />La ndako aasimeli: «Kopashake nyo ndeka ingo ipangemi».<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Bakɔlɔbɔi la bako bawuumboli: «La iso tɔkɛɛ ŋaande»? La ndako abauchisa: «Kɔɔsake ekambwa ele onto la nkulu aɔ nsitaka onto lalikuli weelimbo. Kinaki, Koka nyo la misaala benyo».<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Bako lalikuli baiki bata lendela ekambwa ɛmɔɔ: laango baanjisa mbwiumbola waa solo baɔ aliko la Yɔani, iya ndako kole Kilisito*. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Laango Yɔani aasimeli bako la lalikuli: «Lemi, mbo kobatisa nyo wiiloko, kinaki, ɔnɛ ataande olende la nkulu lindeka lemi. Ole lemi phalaɔsɔna koonga nɛmɔla nkɔli ya toposo tande. Ndako akondo ko batisa nyo la Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ la wiiya. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Ndako kole la Lwɛli o likasa jande la mphophola aliko la maŋanya mpapha la tomuka. Akondo saŋanya tomuka e lokala, la ntumba mpapha wiiya ile phayalimaki jɛ».<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Ŋango ko Yɔani abaekyaki banto Besako Belɔti.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛlɔdɛ ombooka Yoani ɛ munyɔlɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Bɔkɔta* Elɔdɛ, aliko aiki ɔmbɔɔsa Elɔdiya waaja a aotwa lande oke waajande. La lonkinɛ aliko la bobe lalikuli baiki ndako atakee. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Laango, Elɔdɛ akokiisa bobe ande ombo wiila Yɔani ɛ munyɔlɔlɔ.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbatisama ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mlk 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Asili banto lalikuli mbatisama, Yesu la ndako ba obatisi. Aiki ndako atalɔmbɛ loola la liphwe. <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />La Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ la okiteleli wɛɛnte elenga. La jooi ja okami mima e loola: «Wɛɛ kole Bɔna ami, alanga lemi; ombo nangya».<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jooti ja Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Ango Yesu aanjisa bolemo ande, aiki la bilongi ilango baomu asato. Banto bakanyaki nte olende bɔna a Yɔsɛfu, aiki bɔna a Eli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Eli aiki bɔna a Matati, aiki bɔna a Lawi, bɔna a Meleki bɔna a Yanaye, bɔna a Yɔsɛfu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />aiki bɔna a Matatiya bɔna a Amosi, bɔna a Naumu, bɔna a Hesli, bɔna a Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />aiki bɔna a Maathi, bɔna a Matatiya, bɔna a Shemeni, bɔna a Yɔsɛki, bɔna a Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />aiki bɔna a Yɔhanani, bɔna a Lɛsa, bɔna a Solubabeli, bɔna a Shealitieli, bɔna a Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />bɔna a Meleki, bɔna a Adi, bɔna a Kɔsamu, aiki bɔna a Elemadamu, bɔna a Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />aiki bɔna a Yɔsuwa, bɔna a Elieseli, bɔna a Yɔlimu, bɔna a Mathati, bɔna a Lawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />aiki bɔna a Simiyɔni, bɔna a Yuda, bɔna a Yɔsefu, bɔna a Yɔnamu, bɔna a Eliyakimu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />aiki bɔna a Meleya, bɔna a Mena, bɔna a Matata, bɔna a Natani, bɔna a Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />aiki bɔna a Yɛsɛ, bɔna a Ɔbɛdi, bɔna a Bɔasi, bɔna a Salɔmɔni, bɔna a Nashɔni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />aiki bɔna a Aminadabu, bɔna a Adimini, bɔna a Alini, bɔna a Esilɔni, bɔna a Pɛlɛsi, bɔna a Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />aiki bɔna a Yakɔbɔ, bɔna a Isaka, bɔna a Ibulaimu, bɔna a Tɛla, bɔna a Naɔli, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />aiki bɔna a Selugi, bɔna a Leu, bɔna a Pɛlɛgi, bɔna a Ebeli, bɔna a Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />aiki bɔna a Kainamu, bɔna a Alufakisadi, bɔna a Shɛmu, bɔna a Nɔwa, bɔna a Lamɛki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />aiki bɔna a Metusɛla, bɔna a Ɛnɔki, bɔna a Yaledi, bɔna a Mahalaleli, bɔna a Kainamu, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />aiki bɔna a Henɔshi, bɔna a Seti, bɔna a Adamu, aiki a Kanamombe.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Bosombo ombo kekela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mlk 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Pa Yesu mbatisama apasi e losi Yɔlɔdani, omboola la Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ. Ongo Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ awɛɛnyisa nende woosowe. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Engo a kekelami la Bosombo weeleko ba biina ba omu banɛi. Weengo eleko lalikuli koo ndɛɛ ekambwa, la pa bengo biina aoki botala. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Ango Bosombo aosimeli: «Iya sɔlɔ wɛɛ olende Bɔna a Kanamombe*, lɔnda la linɛ libwɛ litulwe kitumbula». <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu awuuchisa nte: «Komo andekama ɔ Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ nte: ‹Bonto phaɔsɔna njala o luiko aliko la kitumbula ketoo›».<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Lonkinɛ, Bosombo aosakoli Yesu kaama kaliko. Awɛɛnyisa kako nkango ekeleka lalikuli e wooni. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Aosimeli nte: «Lakondo kɔya nkulu lalikuli la nombo ya ɛnɛ ekeleka, la nombo ya engo ekeleka, aliko ingo lalikuli ya mpiisa bako lemi, la lemi laɔsɔna mbɔ wɔɔya ɔnɛ alanga lemi. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Binɛ lalikuli bekondo yala besanga bɛbɛ iya ɔnkɔmɛlake balwe.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu awuuchisa nte: Lɔɔsi lɔmbɔ lɔnda ŋaanɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">«Yala atakucha <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɔsɔmɛ Nkanya 6. 13-14.</char></note>Bɔkɔta* Kanamombe abɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">la mbookambela ndako nɛmɛlɛ otoo».<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Pa, Bosombo aɔtɔli Yesu nende ɛ Yɛlusalɛma, la mbo wuuleya eliko la lulu la Kanamombe la aosimela nte: Iya wɛɛ olende sɔlɔ Bɔna a Kanamombe wiyoke anyɔi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Aliko, Lɔɔsi lɔmbɔ lɔnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">Kanamombe akondotoma biphongo bende bako kombelele.<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />La lonkinɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">Bakondo kɔɔsa waakasa baɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">kwaandake mbwitakana lokolo laɛ o libwɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu awuuchisa nte: «Lɔɔsi lɔmbɔ lɔnda nte: Koyalake atakekela Bɔkɔta Kanamombe abɛ».<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɔsɔmɛ Nkanya 6. 16.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Bosombo pa nsila nkekela Yesu e mboka lalikuli, aochiki obi.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu omoanja bolemo ande e Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mlk 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu autoli e wooni ba Galilaya ole fua la nkulu ya Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ. La besako bende bekoki weengo bɛsɛngɛ lalikuli la bɛsɛngɛ bɛ mɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Aiki ataekya banto Waasaŋanelo* baɔ, la banto lalikuli baiki bataokange.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banto ba Nasalɛti bambo kila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mlk 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu achwe e bɔsɛngɛ ba Nasalɛti, kaama kaoli ndako. La eleko eiye luina la Sabato*, aingeli e Basaŋanelo* ŋango baiki nsao ende. Aemali nte asɔmɛ Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />La, abaɔyisa bɔɔmbɔ ba libuku ja wɛɛni Isaya. Akɛlɛmɔli la atani kaama kaandeki bako nte:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«Lɔkɛngɛ la Bɔkɔta* lole aliko lami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Asɔni aliko la mbekya Besako Belɔti o beola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">ontomi mbobaekya balɛmami nkakolama yaɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">la betongo baɛni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">ontomi nkakole banɛ bataɛnɛlama,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />la mbwasimela banto nte ilongi e wɛɛsɛ ya Bɔkɔta waanto kembo iya».<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Pa nsɔma, Yesu amuni libuku, la auchisa ele bokambi Baasaŋanelo*, ayali. Banto lalikuli baiki waango Basaŋanelo* baolendi ike. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Laango, Yesu aanjisa mbwasimela: «Lɔɔsi lɔnɛ laokaki nyo lombokoka lɛlɔ ele nyo batamboke». <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bako lalikuli ba pholotami la ndako, la basebalali la besao belɔti be lɔndaki ndako. Balɔndi: «Onde! Ɔnɛ apha bɔna a Yɔsɛfu»?<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu aasimeli: Mbweeya bɔlɔti akondo simela nyo bomanu bɔnɛ: «Wiingi, wiyiinge wɛɛmɛlɛ». Lonkinɛ akondo lɔnda nyo: «Tooki bingo lalikuli bikee wɛɛ e Kapɛlɛnaumu, wiikee beko lalikuli anɛ, ɔɔsɛngɛ abɛ». <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Lonkinɛ alɔndi nte: Sɔlɔ, mbokosimela nyo nte, wɛɛni ɔnɛ wɛɛbɛyamaka la bokuchu wɔɔsɛngɛ baɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Kinaki oka nyo! Sɔlɔ kaiki nde be bwele ike e wooni ba Isilaɛli weeleko e Eliya. Weengo eleko kotalwaka mbula wiilongi bisato la eteni; kaiki nde la botala ike wooni lalikuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ 1Bɛkɔta 17.1</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Koonga ŋango, Eliya koo ntomama ele obwele lalikuli, kinaki, ele obwele a Selefati ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Sidoni.<verse eid="LUK 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Lonkinɛ, o wooni ba Isilaɛli weeleko ba Elisa, kaiki nde la baso nsuli ike. Koonga ŋango kotaika bonto lalikuli aɔkyami, kinaki, Namani boso Siliya.<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Banto lalikuli baiki waasaŋanelo* aoki bako bingo, baomali nkɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Baemali la mboo pasha anja la ɔsɛngɛ abɔ baiki bombo phikama aliko la bɔɔkɔ. La baɔtɔli e likengo ja bɔɔkɔ nte bawooke anyɔi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Kinaki Yesu aeti asamba bako la nchwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwita basombo babe ele onto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mlk 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Pa, Yesu achwe nende ɛ Kapɛlɛnaumu wɔɔsɛngɛ ba Galilaya, aiki ataekya banto wiina lalikuli ba Sabato*. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Banto basebalali aliko la nkulu yaiki ndako la yako e mbekya yande.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />La otema Baasaŋanelo* kaiki la bonto a luani la basombo babe. Aiki ata okoma la nkulu: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />«Nke etaone wɛɛ kaso! Wɛɛ Yesu a Nasalɛti? Omwanda ntokaka? Lakoeya wɛɛ ole nani. Wɛɛ kole Lɔɛlɔ latomami la Kanamombe»!<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu aophangweli ongo Bosombo la nɔnda: «Kɔwa wɛɛ la pasa ele ɔnɛ onto»! Ongo Bosombo awooki anyɔi otamboka baanto lalikuli, la apasi ele ndako koo mboo tumbya.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Banto lalikuli ba sebalali, balɔnjani asamba bako: «Bɔnɛ bolende bosao ba nsebalala, aliko o nkulu yande, ombo luusiya Basombo babe bapase, la bako bambo pasa»! <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />La besako be Yesu be balaŋani kaama lalikuli woongo ɔɔsɛngɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya bakɔnu ike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mlk 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Laango Yesu apasi waango Basaŋanelo*, achwe e lulu la Simo. Wainto ɔmɔɔ bokilo ande la Simo, aiki la empoma yoolo, baosimeli a wiikya. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />La Yesu aandi, aemali sukɛlɛ lande, aphangweli engo empoma la engo empoma keotiki. Kako nkango, ongo wainto aemali la mbwakambela.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Aiki likɔlɔ, banto lalikuli baiki la bakɔnu baɔ, babaelisa kande, lande aaphisa bakasa ande aliko la bakɔnu la mboba ikya lalikuli. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Basombo babe baapasi bakɔnu ike la bachwe bataokoma la nɔnda: Wɛɛ olende Bɔna a Kanamombe*! Kinaki, Yesu aaphangweli, la koo mbɔba ɔya luusa la nɔnda, aliko baeyi nte ndako kole Kilisito*.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ataekya e Basaŋanelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mlk 1.35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Loi ende mpendu, Yesu apasi la nchwa kaama ka nɛmɛlɛ. Boloi bɔmɔɔ baanto baiki bake bata woone. Ango, bango banto baiye kaama kaiki ndako, baoni mbookenga aliko atapasake kaɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Kinaki, Yesu aasimeli: «Lasana mbekya besako belɔti be ekeleka be Kanamombe* wɛɛnkinɛ bɛsɛngɛ ŋango akɔ. Aliko, latomami nde aliko la bingo». <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />La, aiki oke ataekya e Basaŋanelo* ba Yudɛya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ɔmbɔ sɔna Baeki batango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mlk 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Kaiki luina lɔmɔɔ, Yesu aiki ataemala ɔɔkɔngɛ ba wango ba Gɛnɛsalɛti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bongo wago ba Genesaleti baelelaka lonkinɛ wango ba Galilaya.Banto ike baanjisa mboophika, aliko baiki batalange mboka bosao ba Kanamombe.</char></note>, la banto ike baanjisa mboo phika, aliko baonaki mboka besao be Kanamombe*. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Aɛni biɔmbɔ biphee ɔɔkɔngɛ ba wango. Balɔwi baiki batapase otema baiki bata ɔkya bɛtɛi bɛɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu auleli ɔ kɛmɔɔ kiiki ango. Kengo kyɔmbɔ kiiki ke Simo. Yesu aosimeli nte asɛmɛya e wango, bɔɔ inchɛ la ɔkɔngɛ. Ayali o kengo kyɔmbɔ la njala ataekya banto.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Ango asili ndako mbekya, asimeli Simo nte: «Sɛmeya kyɔmbɔ ele iloko, linjanyo bɛtɛi bɛnyo wiiloko, aliko o jake nyo nse». <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simo auchisa: «Bɔkɔta, tombo lɔwa lɛlɔ bocho lalikuli koo mba ekambwa. Kinaki, ŋaanɛ wɛɛ kɔmbɔ lɔnda lakondo oka lonkinɛ bɔtɛi e losi». <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Pa nsila mboka bɔtɛi e losi, ba jaki nsee ike, nende ango aiki bɛtɛi bɛɔ beke betaate. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Baeleli baina labɔ baiki e kenkinɛ kyɔmbɔ, baande mbo baamola. Baandi baojisa biɔmbɔ beko biphee la nse ilango biɔmbɔ bilinde. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simo Pɛtɛlɛ aɛni ndako ŋango, akɔmeli Yesu balwe la nɔnda nte: «Pasa otamboka lami, ee Bɔkɔta aliko lemi nende boso njambi»! <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Kwiki ŋaanɛ, aliko Simo la baina lande, basebalali ike la mɛna nse ya jaki bako. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Ŋango ako, Yakɔbɔ la Yɔani bana ba Sebedayɔ baiki baina lande basɔkɔli ba nse. Yesu asimeli Simo: «Kolawake; manja lɛlɔ akondo yala bɔsɔkɔli baanto». <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Baɛlisa kyɔmbɔ wɔɔ kɔngɛ, bachiki bikambwa lalikuli la ningita Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya oso nsuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mlk 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Laango, Yesu aiki ɔɔsɛngɛ ɔmɔɔ, bonto ɔmɔɔ boso nsuli bionge lalikuli awɛɛni, la ongo onto akwɛɛ ba nkukuku la alɔmbi ele Yesu: «Bɔkɔta, iya olangake aɔsɔna limbɔkya».<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu aosemboleli likasa, aokooli la nɔnda: «Mbolanga! Ɔkyama»! Kako nkango, engo nsuli kepasi ele ongo onto. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />La Yesu aɔsimeli: «Kosimelake onto koonga ɔmɔɔ. Kinaki, chwaka loko iyɛnya ele weeta atei* lonkinɛ opasha mpato aliko la mbokyama yabɛ ŋango balɔndi Musa omɛnya nte ombwika».<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Kinaki, jaamba ja Yesu ja balaŋani kaama lalikuli. Boloi baanto bosaŋani aliko la mbo wooka la mbikyama ya bakɔnu baɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Kinaki, Yesu achwe kaama kaiki ndako nɛmɛlɛ opholi o nɔmba engo.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya bonto ɔmɔɔ oso nɛngɛla</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mlk 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Wiina ɔmɔɔ, Yesu aiki ataekya, Mafalisayɔ la Baekisi ba Isaliya baiki bataime wɛɛsɛngɛ be Galilaya, Yudɛya la Yɛlusalɛma, bayalaki ango. Nkulu ya Bɔkɔta yaiki lande aliko la mbikya bakɔnu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />La banto baandi bata ɛmbɛ bonto ɔmɔɔ oso nɛngɛla, baonaki bolengo ba mbo wiila otema ba lulu la mbo kicheya otamboka la Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Kinaki, aliko la wiike ba anto koo mbɔsɔna mingela otema. Laango, bauleli eliko la nsambe <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Monter sur le toi</char></note> la ntɛmɔla nsambe mbelama laango aiki Yesu. La baokichisa la likenge jande, asamba boloi otamboka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Devant quelqu'un</char></note> la Yesu. <figure style="fig" alt="Watu wabashusha mugonjwa kutoka juu ya nyumba" file="WA03824b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="5.19">Banto bambokicheya bɔkɔni mima eliko la nsambe</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Ango Yesu aɛni ndako lokani laɔ, alɔndi la bɔkɔnu: «Keseka njambi yabɛ imbɔ sokolama». <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Baekisi ba Isaliya* la Bafalisayɔ baanjisa mbwiumbola la nɔnda: «Ɔnɛ onto ole nani atatole Kanamombe*? Koo onto aɔsɔna nsokolela bonto njambi. Ila nɛmɛlɛ kanamombe*». <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu aei bakani baɔ la aasimeli: Nke etakanya nyo waasolo anyo? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Nke ele kɔɔlu nɔnda mbo kosokolela njambi aɔ nɔnda emala wɛɛ la nkɛnda? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Kinaki, mbo langa nte weeye nyo: Bɔna a Onto ole nde la nkulu ya nsokolela banto njambi e wooni. Laango asimeli oso nɛngɛla:<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paralityque</char></note>Emala wɛɛ, kemela likenge jabɛ, La chwaka e lulu labɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />La, kako nkango, oso nɛngɛla aemali otamboka laako lalikuli, okemeli likenge jande ja lalelaki ndako, la achwe e lulu lande la atakucha kanamombe*. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Bako lalilkuli ba sebalali la nkucha kanamombe* baoli fua la wɔɔma la nɔnda, tomwɛna lɛlɔ ɛntɔmpɔ!<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo elela Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mlk 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Pa bingo, Yesu apasi anja aɛni oso ngɛja kɔdi, aelelamaki Lawi, atayale kaama ka ngɛja kɔdi. Yesu aosimeli nte: «Oningite»! <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />La ndako aemali, la ntika lalikuli la aolingiti. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Lonkinɛ, Lawi a lɔngɔsɔlɛli Yesu lilɛ ike e lulu lande. La boloi bɔnɛnɛ ba baso ngɛja kɔdi, la bankinɛ banto baiki batale kaama kamɔɔ la bako. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Mafalisayɔ la Baekisi ba Isaliya* baiki batalɔndɛ baeki ba Yesu: «Aliko laanke etale nyo la nywa kaama kamɔɔ la baso ngɛja kɔdi la baso njambi»? <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu abauchisa nte: «Baso luiko bapha la mposa e wiingi ila bakɔnu nde bale la mposa e wiingi. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Lemi phamandi mbelela bango bale solo, kinaki baso njambi baande mimeya».<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbwiumbola aliko la nfunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mlk 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Bafalisayɔ basimeli Yesu ntes: «Baeki* ba Yɔani oso mbatisa la bango baso bataliphe kila eleko la bata lɔmbɛ, kinaki, baeki* baɛ batale la nywa». <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu abauchisa nte: «Bango baelelami o libɛla baɔsɔna nkila lilɛ la Bɔkɔta ba libɛla ole la bako? Jɛ phakasane! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Kinaki, eleko eiyaki ango asakolamaki Bɔkɔta Yesu asamba bako, weengo biina kekilaki bako lilɛ».<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu aasimeli lonkinɛ bongo bomanu: «Koo onto aɔsɔna mbata yaati ya esenda e kasende aliko la nɔngɔsɔla esenda e esasa, iya ŋango engo esenda ekasende kekondo ata la yaati ya esenda e kasende pheke sɔnama la esenda e esasa. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />La koo onto a ila difai lilɔti otema ba esasa e mpɔmbɔ, iya ŋango, difai ja kasende jakondo ata mpɔmbɔ la mbulanga, la difai jakondo sua la mpɔmbɔ kekondo futana. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Difai ja kasende bailaka nde ɔ mpɔmbɔ e kasende. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Koo onto alanga nywa difai ja kasende pa nywa lokange. Aliko, longo lokange lolende lɔlɔti ndeka la kasende».<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kole Bɔkɔta ba Sabato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mlk 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />25 Kaiki luina lɔmɔɔ la Sabato*, Yesu aiki ataete weebeli e Nganɔ. Baeki* bande baanjisa mbuka mɛjɛmbɛ be ingo Nganɔ, baanjisa mpolola<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bonto aetake weebeli ole la botala, wiiki ataɔyama loosa la mbuka aɔ ndɛ lile limbosila ntunda. Nkɛɛ ŋango kotaika mbiya. Ɔsɔmɛ Nkanya 23. 26</char></note> la ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Bafalisayɔ bamɔɔ ba baumboli nte: «Aliko laanke ɔmbɔ kɛɛ nyo ile Isaliya* yaso phaya imeya nkɛɛ luina la Sabato*»? <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu abauchisa nte: «Onde, koo nsɔma nyo bolengo baiki Daudi la banto baiki ndako la bako eleko eiki bako la botala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Aingeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obiina be Bɔkɔta Daudi, lulu la Kanamombe lɔnɛnɛ laiki lota phikama ɛ Yɛlusalɛma. </char></note> e lulu la Kanamombe*, aɔsi bitunbula bɛnɛ bepashaki banto ele Kanamombe*. Aele, la aɔyisa baina lande baiki ndako la bako. La balɛɛki bingo ko baeta atei atoo baiki la luusa la ndɛ bingo bitumbula be bongo bolengo»! <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yesu aasimeli lonkinɛ nte: «Lemi Bɔna a Onto kole Bɔkɔta ba Sabato*».<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ambwikya bonto luina la Sabato*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mlk 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Wiina onkinɛ ba Sabato*, Yesu aingeli otema Baasaŋanelo Baayuda*, aanjisa mbekya banto. Engo otema baango Basaŋanelo kaiki bonto ɔmɔɔ aiki ombo lɛngɛla loambo la loome. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Baekisi ba Isaliya* la Mafalisayɔ* balendaki Yesu ike nte baɛni iya aikya ongo onto luina la Sabato. Bakɛɛ ŋango, nte babaa bosao ba memalela omboo sitaka. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Kinaki, Yesu wiiki ombosila mbeya bamanya baɔ. Asimeli ongo bonto alɛngɛli loambo nte: «Emala la waande otamboka baanto lalikuli». Ongo onto aemali la achwe otamboka baanto.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Pa Yesu aasimeli bango Mafalisayɔ* la Baekisi ba Isaliya* nte: «Mbo kuumbola nyo: Nke ile Isaliya yaso ilangaka toyale tatakee luina la Sabato*? Nkɛɛ bɔlɔti aɔ bobe? Mbikya bonto aɔ mboo jaka»?<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yesu aalendi bako lalikuli, ango, asimeli ongo onto nte: «Sembola loambo labɛ». Alosemboli, kako nkango longo loambo laiki. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Kinaki bango, Mafalisayɔ* la Baekisi ba Isaliya* baomali ike. Baanjisa mumbolana asamba bako nte bakeele Yesu nke.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɔmbɔ sɔna Baeki joomu la aphee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mlk 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Luina lɔmɔɔ, Yesu auleli nɔmba Kanamombe ɛ bɔɔkɔ. Akɛsisa luina la likuli atalɔmbɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Loi ende mpendu, aeleli baeki* bande, la asamba bako, asɔni joomu la aphee banɛ baeleli ndako «Bakɛndi*». <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />La Simo ɔnɛ aŋunyisa Yesu Pɛtɛlɛ la Andele aotwa lande, Yakɔbɔ la Yɔani la Filipi la Batɔlɔmayɔ, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />la Matayɔ, la Tɔmasi, la Yakɔbɔ bɔna a Alufayɔ la Simo aelelamaki Sɛlɔtɛ, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yuda bɔna a Yakɔbɔ la Yuda Isikaliyɔtɛ ɔnɛ a phaki Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu omboekya banto la mbikya bakɔnu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu nkitela mima ɛ bɔɔkɔ la bakɛndi* bande. Aiye ndako kaama ka sanjabala, aemali. Atani boloi bɔnɛnɛ ba baeki bande la banto bankinɛ ike baimi o beoni lalikuli be Yudeya, la boleka ba bɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛlusalɛma, la boleka ba bɛsɛngɛ bɛ Tilɔ la Sidoni biiki ɔɔkɔngɛ ba wango. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Bango banto baandaki nte ba oke Yesu, la baikyame beale bɛɔ. La bango baiki la basombo babe baikyame. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Banto lalikuli balangaki mbookoola, aliko nkulu ya pasaki kande ya baikisa bako lalikuli.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bochwako la bɔkɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Pa Yesu alendi baeki* bande, aasimeli nte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Alombele nyo baola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">aliko ekeleka e Kanamombe* kelende kenyo.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Alombele nyo bata oke botala nkaanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">aliko akɔndɔlɛ nyo nende e jiimbi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Alombele nyo bata lele nkaanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">aliko akondo ɔla nyo la libɛla».<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Alombele nyo eleko ekonina banto la mbwiambalala lanyo, la nkotola nyo la ntata nkombo yanyo bobe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">Aliko lami Bɔna a Onto.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Eleko engo ekwiyela nyo bengo besako, yala nyo ataisɛkɛya la nkɛnya, aliko ombo kicheyama nyo mpato nɛnɛ e loola. Ŋango ko bankɛɔ bata tumbya Baɛni*.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Kinaki, ŋandi ele nyo baso nombo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">aliko, ombo sila nyo mba bolombe bɔlɔti.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Ŋandi kanyo baso jiimbi nkaanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">aliko, eleko inchɛ akondo oka nyo botala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Ŋandi ele nyo bataɔlɛ la libɛla nkaanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">aliko, eleko inchɛ akondo lela nyo.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Ŋandi ele nyo batakoseke nyo banto lalikuli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:26">aliko, ŋango ko bankɛɔ baiki bataseke Baɛni* ba belimbo.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nanga bitamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7.12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Yesu amemeisa nɔnda nte: Kinaki nyo baso limboka: binɛ nde bitalange lemi nkosimela nyo: Langa nyo bitamba benyo, yala nyo ataakɛɛla bilɔti. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Bango bale kɔkɔmɛlaka nyo, yala nyo ataalɔmbɛla ele Kanamombe nte aachweele bochwako. La bango batakotumbya nyo, yala nyo ataa lɔmbɛla ele Kanamombe. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Iya bonto akophomake losola o litama limɔɔ, tulolela ndako lingo linkinɛ litama. La iya bonto akokumolake likɔti jaɛ, tikela ndako la simisi ɛbɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Bonto akolɔmbake ekambwa lalikuli koo limake keko, aɔ akokumolake ekambwa ɛbɛ, kɔɔ lɔmbake lonkinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Ŋango alanga wɛɛ bako keele, keela bankinɛ ŋango akɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Iya oyalake atalange nyo too, banɛ bako langaka nyo, ekambwa nke ɛɔsɔna nyo mba? Aliko, koonga baso njambi la bako balangaka baso mbwaalanga! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />La iya okeelake nyo too bɔlɔti bango bakokeela nyo bilɔti, esakoya nke eba nyo? Koonga baso njambi la bako bakɛɛka ŋango akɔ! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />La iya, o sɔmbyake nyo to ele bango bata kicheya nyo lokani la kɔngɛla nyo, onde! Aba nyo esakoya nkee? Koonga baso njambi la bako basɔmbyaka to bango baɔsɔna mbwangɛla!<verse eid="LUK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />«Kinaki nyo, yala nyo atalange bitamba benyo. Lonkinɛ yala nyo atasɔmbya jɛ nkicha lokani la ngɛlama. O ŋango akondoba nyo esakoya ɛnɛnɛ, lonkinɛ akondoyala nyo sɔlɔ bana ba Kanamombe ole aliko lalikuli. Aliko ndako okɛɛka bilɔti nende ele bango bale bapha la esakoya la baso njambi. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Yala nyo ataɛnɛlana nyo ŋandi wɛɛnte bole isɛ nyo atakɔɛnɛla nyo ŋandi.»<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Koyalake nyo atatumbya bankinɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Yesu alɔndi lonkinɛ: «Koyala nyo atatumbya bankinɛ, la Kanamombe phakotumbya nyo ŋango akɔ. Koyalake nyo atakɔmɛla bankinɛ, aliko la nyo Kanamombe atakɔkɔmɛlake nyo ŋango akɔ. Kinaki yala nyo ata sokolela bankinɛ, aliko Kanamombe akondo kasokolela la nyo ŋango akɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Yala nyo ataɔya bankinɛ, aliko Kanamombe* akondo kɔya lanyo. La ingo yaɔyama nyo yakondo yala yatapimama bɔlɔti, la nkɔkɔmyama la mbojama fua. Ŋango bo pimelaka nyo bankinɛ ko Kanamombe landako akondo kopimela nyo».<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu abaɔyisa lonkinɛ bomanu bɔnɛ: «Bontongo aɔsɔna mɛnya bontongo wiina lande mboka? Jɛ! Akɛɛkɛ ŋango bako baphee bakondo kwaa e liphuku». <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Koo weeki ole waiyolo ele weekisi ande. Kinaki, weeki aekyamake bɔlɔti, akondo yala solo la weekisi.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Aliko laanke, ataɛni ephumbu o lisɔ ja aotwa labɛ, kinaki phailende la bote bole o lisɔ jabɛ? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Aliko laanke ɛɔsɔna wɛɛ nsimela aotwa labɛ nte: «Aotwa lami, konga nkopasha ephumbu ele o lisɔ jabɛ. La e lisɔ jabɛ kole la bote? Wɛɛ, ole apha phololo! Pasha obi bote bole o lisɔ jabɛ, pa akɔnɔɛna bɔlɔti o mpasha ephumbu ele o lisɔ ja aotwa labɛ»!<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bote boeyamaka nde o biuma bende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Yesu ɔlɔndi lonkinɛ nte: «Bote bɔlɔti phaotaka biuma bibe, la bote bobe phaɔsɔna mbota biuma bilɔti. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Bote lalikuli boeyamaka nde o biuma bende. Banto phaɔsɔna mbuka bɔnkɔmu aɔ mpachu oote ba weeŋenge. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Ko ŋango, bonto bɔlɔti ɔlɔndaka nde bilɔti bipasaka otema ba lisolo jande. Kinaki bonto bobe, bibe bilɔndaka ndako, bipashaka to oobe boolaka otema ba lisolo jande. Aliko, bonywa ba onto bɔlɔndaka too besao beolaka otema ba lisolo jande».<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Belengo bephee beaphiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Yesu amemeisa nɔnda nte: «Aliko laanke etambelela nyo: ‹Bɔkɔta, Bɔkɔta›, lanyo phakokeya nyo binɛ bitakosimela nyo lemi? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Landalange nkɔɛnya nyo bolengo ba onto ataningita, la mboka besao bemi, la nkokya bolengo batalɔndɛ lemi, ɔmbɔɛlama: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />la onto ataphike lulu lande. O, chimi obi ike mbiya waabwɛ. O lingo libwɛ, o kichi kako bɔnsɛsɛ bɔnɛ bophiki ndako lulu lande. Eleko ɛlwɛ mbula nɛnɛ, losi looli, la ingo iloko ya mbula, yaakani o longo lulu, koo ntɛka. Aliko, lophikami bɔlɔti. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Kinaki, bonto ole atakɛɛ besao bele bepha phololo be mboka besao bemi, la phakɛɛ ŋango batalɔndama, andaelama la bonto ophiki lulu lande aliko la lɔmɔ́tu koo bɔnsɛsɛ. Eleko engo eakanyisa iloko ya mpela o longo lulu, kako nkango lɔkwɛɛ la nphutana lalikuli».<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya bokambi ɔmɔɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Asili Yesu nɔnda binɛ lalikuli asamba banto baolangaki, achwe ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Kapɛlɛnaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Woongo ɔsɛngɛ, kaiki waiyolo ɔmɔɔ baakɔlɔbɔi, aiki la bokambi ande alangaki ndako ike. Ɔnɛ bokambi aiki nkɔna mɛ la mbwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Ɔnɛ waiyolo aakɔlɔbɔi aoki ndako besako be Yesu, aotomeli bekongo bɛmɔɔ Beayuda, bachu mbooseya aande mbikya bokambi ande. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Bengo bekongo aiye bako ele Yesu, ba ɔsɛi ike la nɔnda: Ɔnɛ waiyolo aakɔlɔbɔi asana mamolama, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />aliko ndako olangaka wooni baso, lonkinɛ ndako katophikeli Basaŋanelo* baso. <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesu achwe bolili laako. Ango aiki bako sukɛlɛ la mbiya e lulu la ongo waiyolo aakɔlɔbɔi, ongo waiyolo aakɔlɔbɔi, atomi biseka bende basimele Yesu nte: Simela nyo ndako nte ataijake wiina manda kami, aliko lemi phalasane ndako aingele e lulu lami. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Aliko laingo, mbwiyɛna nte lemi phalasane manda kande. Kinaki alɔndɛ too bosao bɔmɔɔ, la bokambi ami akondo ika. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Aliko lemi ŋango akɔ nende entina la baiyolo bami, la lemi njalaka la bakɔlɔbɔi entina lami; n'nɔndake la ɔmɔɔ: «Chwaka»! La ndako ochaaka, la iya n'nɔndake la ɔnkinɛ! «Aka»! La ndako akonoanda. La iya n'similake bokambi ami nte: «Kɛɛ ɛnɛ! La ndako ɔkɛɛka». <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Ango aoki Yesu bingo, asebalali ike aliko la ongo waiyolo aakɔlɔbɔi. Ango atulwe la nɔnda la boloi baanto baolingitaki, aasimeli: Mbokosimela nyo nte koonga asamba wooni lalikuli ba Isilaɛli, ntaɛni bonto boso limanya linɛnɛ ja ŋaanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Bango banto batomami la ongo waiyolo baakɔlɔbɔi autoli bako e lulu, batani ongo bokambi ombosila mbika.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo tondola bɔna a obwele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Pa Yesu aingeli ɔɔsɛngɛ baelelamaki Naini. Baeki* bande la banto bankinɛ ike bachwe la ndako. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Asukameli ndako lɔkukɛ la likula ja ɔsɛngɛ, asaŋani la banto baiki batachu nkuja bojo ba boponjo ɔmɔɔ. Ɔnɛ bomponjo aiki bɔna etike e obwele ɔmɔɔ. Banto ike ba ongo ɔsɛngɛ baiki batatindeya ongo obwele. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Awɛɛni Bɔkɔta, awookeli ŋandi ike aosimela nte: «Lele kolelake»! <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Yesu asɛmɛli sukɛlɛ la Jɛnɛsa e ojo la nke koola. Banto baiki bataɛmbɛ baemali. Yesu alɔndi nte: «Bompojo, mbɔlɔnda: Emwa»! <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Ongo ompojo abwe kako nkango aemwe, oyali osongosongo, la manja nɔnda. Yesu awuuchisa ele nyɛŋɛnde.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Banto lalikuli ba baɛmi la wɔɔma, baanjisa nkucha Kanamombe* la nɔnda nte: «Wɛɛni ɔnɛnɛ ombo pasela asamba iso»! Lonkinɛ ɔlɔndi: «Kanamombe* omwanda nkakola banto bande»! <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Besao bɛnɛ bɛ kee Yesu be balaŋani o wooni lalikuli ba Yudeya la beoni lalikuli bemamani.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɔani oso mbatisa ombotoma baeki bande ele Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Bengo besao lalikuli be kee Yesu, baeki* ba Yɔani oso mbatisa baosimeli. Aliko la ingo, Yɔani aeleli baphee asamba bako. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Aatomi bachu mumbola Bɔkɔta nte: «Wɛɛ ko ongo Masiya* ataande? Aɔ tokonge ɔnkinɛ»? <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Bango baeki baiye eiki Yesu baosimeli nte: «Yɔani oso mbatisa kombo totoma kaɛ tokuumbole iya wɛɛ ko Masiya ɔnɛ ataande aɔ tokonge onkinɛ»?<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Weengo eleko Yesu aikisa banto ike, la baiki batatumbyama la beale la bitumbe la mbita basombo ba babe la bentongo ike baɛni. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Ekantunda Yesu abauchisa bango baeki ba Yɔani nte: «Chwaka nyo lokosimele Yɔani bingo bimwɛna nyo la mboka. Bentongo bamwanja m'mɛna, la bitumbe bamwanja n'kɛnda, la baso nsuli bambo ika, bimpokolo bamwanja mboka, la babwe bambo tondwa la beola bake baekyama Besako Bɛlɔti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɔsɔmɛ Isaya 35. 5-6, 61. 1</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Alombele ongo bonto ole phalimeyaki limanya jande kami»!<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Bango baeki* ba Yɔani bautoli. Yesu aanjisa nsimela boloi baanto besao aliko la Yɔani nɔnda: Achwe nyo nenda ekambwa nke engo woosowe*? Onde, achwe nyo mɛna litɛtɛ ja tɛkyamaki la lɔphɛphɔ? Jɛ! <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Iya jɛ, ochwe nyo mɛna nke? Bonto alɔti bisenda bilɔti? Jɛ! Kinaki, baso ndɔta bisenda be nombo bayalaka la luiko lɔlɔti, bayalaka nde o lulu la Bɔkɔta. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Laango, onsimele nyo, achwe nyo nenda nke? Mɛna wɛɛni*? Ole! Mbokosimela nyo nte aiki wɛɛni*, lonkinɛ aiki omboleka wɛɛni. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ongo Yɔani ko Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ lɔmbɔlɔnda aliko lande nte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">Oka nyo! Lemi mbotoma bokambi ami akotangolele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Malaki 3. 1.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">aliko akɔlɔngɔsɔlɛlɛ mboka.<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />«Mbokosimela nyo nte, asamba banto lalikuli ba bɔnɛ wooni, koo ɔnɛ aeta Yɔani oso mbatisa. Kinaki koonga ŋaanɛ, ole mpɔu weekeleka e Kanamombe* ko waiyolo mbeta Yɔani». <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />«Banto lalikuli la bangɛjisi ba kɔdi baoki besao be Yɔani, baeyi nte Kanamombe* olende bɔlɔti, nende eimisa bako mbatisiwa la Yɔani. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Kinaki, Bafalisayɔ* la Baekisi ba Isaliya*, baikileli isaliya ya Kanamombe* yaiki ndako la yako. Wiingo bakili mbatisama la Yɔani».<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu alɔndi lonkinɛ nte: Nani aɔsɔna lemi mbɛɛlamya la banto ba jooti ja lɛlɔ? La bambo elama la nani? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Balende bambo elama la bana bata yale bata elolelana boloi bɔmɔɔ la bonkinɛ nte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Tombo kophomela nyo ŋɔma, kinaki koo kɛnya nyo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Lɔnkinɛ tombo koembela nyo bɛkɛlwa be lotoko, kinaki koo ndela nyo!<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />«Aliko eleko eandi Yɔani oso mbatisa, ataika atale kitumbula la nywa difai, la nyo aiki nyo atalɔndɛ nte: ‹Olende la bosombo› <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Eleko lemi Bɔna a Onto mbwiiya ndɛ la nywa, la nyo andalɔndɛ nyo nte: ‹Lenda nyo! Ɔnɛ onto olende bolei lonkinɛ bolɛwi, lɔnkinɛ keseka ke baso ngɛja kɔdi, la boso njambi›! <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Kinaki, limanya ja Kanamombe* jataeyama njala sɔlɔ o bango lalikuli bata wiimeya».<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombotikela wainto ɔmɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mufalisayɔ* ɔmɔɔ, aeleli Yesu nte aande ndɛ lilɛ e lulu lande. Yesu aingeli e lulu la ongo Mufalisayɔ*, ayali ndɛ lilɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />La woongo, ɔɔsɛngɛ kwiki la wainto ɔmɔɔ oso njambi. Ongo wainto aoki ndako nte Yesu olende e lulu la ongo Mufalisayɔ*, aingeli engo, ole la lintupa ja bauta ba limbala ja lisombi joolo. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Aemali sukɛlɛ la bekolo be Yesu ɔɔkɔngɔ atalele. Biinsɔli bende beanjisa ntɔcha bekolo be Yesu. Pa aanjisa nimola la libo jande.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ele Bayuda, iya bonto alangake mɛnya onkinɛ nte ombookucha aiki nde ombo onsumpa weekolo</char></note> <figure style="fig" alt="La femme prostituée essuie les pieds de Jésus avec ses larmes" file="WA03839b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="7.38">Wainto a loseka o limoli bekolo be Yesu la biinsɔli bende</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Eleko engo Mufalisayɔ aeleli Yesu awɛɛni, akanyisa o lisolo jande nte: «Iya onto ɔnɛ otoyala sɔlɔ wɛɛni*, otoeya nte ɔnɛ wainto ole a bolengo nke, otoeya nte olende boso njambi».<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Ango Yesu aosimeli ongo Mufalisayɔ nte: «Simo, nende la bosao bankosimela». La Simo awuuchisa: «Sɔlɔ Weekisi, lɔnda». <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu alɔndi: «Kwiiki banto ba phee baiki la ningo e onto ɔmɔɔ. Ɔmɔɔ wiiki la ningo e dinali miya itano, onkinɛ dinali baomu atano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinali iiki nde falanga. La dinali ɛmɔɔ iiki etangɛlama ele onto akamba wiina ɔmɔɔ.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Bango baphee, aɛni bako bapha la obaelo ba ngɛla engo ningo ɛbɔ, ongo aasɔmbisa aachikeli bako lalikuli baphee. Asamba bako baphee, nani alanga ike ongo onto aasɔmbisa ningo»? <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simo auchisa: «Lakanya nte ongo achikelami ningo nɛnɛ». Yesu aosimeli: «Ombuucha bɔlɔti».<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Pa, Yesu achwe ele ongo wainto la nsimela Simo: «Ɔmwɛna ɔnɛ wainto? Aingeli lemi e lulu labɛ, koo limpa iloko ya mbɔkya bekolo bemi. Kinaki, ɔnɛ wainto ndako ɔmɔ mbɔkya bekolo bemi la bampɔpɔ ba biinsɔli bende, la linimola la libo jande. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Wɛɛ koo linsumpa o limbɛbɛya, kinaki, ɔnɛ wainto, manja aingeli lemi anɛ anda memeya nsumpa bekolo bemi. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Wɛɛ koo linkucha la linkila bauta wɔɔtɛ, kinaki, ndako omonkila bauta ba limbala weekolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ele Bayuda, bɔŋɛni aiyake baiki batawɛɛbɛya ɔmbɔ wɔya iloko ya mbɔkya bekolo, la mboosumpa la mbookila bauta ba limbala.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Wiingo mbokosimela ŋaanɛ koonga njambi ya ɔnɛ wainto iiki ike, lalikuli imbochikelama. Ingo nde imbotoma mɛnya nte omboolanga ike. Kinaki, bonto ombochikelama inchɛ olangaka inchɛ».<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Pa Yesu asimeli ongo wainto nte: «Njambi yabɛ imbo sokolelama».<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Banto lalikuli baiki batale la Yesu baanjisa mumbolana: «Bonto a bolengo nke ɔnɛ ata sokolela banto njambi»? <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Kinaki, Yesu asimeli ongo wainto nte: «Lokani labɛ lombo kokakola. Chwaka bɔlɔti».<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Bainto ba tindeyaki Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ɔkɔngɔ laango, Yesu alɛngi wɛɛsɛngɛ bɛnɛnɛ bɛnɛnɛ la besali, ataekya banto besako belɔti be ekeleka e Kanamombe*. Bakɛndi* bande joomu la aphee baotindisa. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Lonkinɛ wiiki la bainto banɛ ba pasisha ndako Basombo babe la bankinɛ abaikisa biale. Asaamba banɛ bainto kwiiki: Malia, ɔnɛ aelelamaki Malia Anamagadala. Ɔnɛ Malia, Yesu aopasisha basombo babe esambaele. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />La Yɔana, waaja a Kusa. Ɔnɛ Kusa kaemalelaki besanga bɛ Elɔde. Kwiki ŋango akɔ Susana, la bankinɛ bainto ike. Banɛ bainto, bako nde bapashaki besanga bɛɔ aliko la mamola Yesu la baeki bande.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba Wooni ba bimuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mlk 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Banto ike baiki bataime o kila ɔsɛngɛ la mbwisaŋanya kaama kaiki Yesu. Yesu aapasisha bomanu bɔnɛ nte: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Wooni ɔmɔɔ achwe mona boopho weebeli ende. Ango aiki ndako ataone boopho bande, bimuka bimɔɔ bɛkwɛɛ mpamba la mboka. Banto bainyeki la mpulu bailee. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Inkinɛ ya kwɛɛ waabwɛ. Amɛni yako, yaomi aliko ya pheki iloko ɔ lɔmɔtu. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Inkinɛ ya kwɛɛli asamba baumba. Bango baumba bamɛni kaama kamɔɔ la yako, yaiphiki. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Kinaki binkinɛ bimuka bɛkwɛɛli ɛ lɔmɔtu lɔlɔti. Ya mɛni la mbota bimuka miya miya». Yesu asili ndako nɔnda bingo, alɔndi nte: «Boso batoi ba mboka aoke»!<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aliko laanke Yesu aekyaki weemanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mlk 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Baeki* ba Yesu ba wuumboli maana ba bongo bomanu. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Lande abauchisa: Nyo, ɔmbɔɔyama nyo wɛɛsɛ ba mbeya besao biisami weekeleka e Kanamombe*. Kinaki bankinɛ baɔ basana njala lataasimela weemanu, aliko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">Bayale batalende, kinaki phaaɛni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">Bayale bataoke, kinaki bata eyake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Isaya 6. 9.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu omwindola bomanu ba wooni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-20">Mat 13.18-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mlk 4.13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Lonkinɛ Yesu alɔndi nte maana ba bongo bomanu ko bɔnɛ: Bimuka ko besao ba Kanamombe*. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Bimuka bɛkwɛɛ e mboka, bi mbwɛɛlama la banto banɛ baokaka besao be Kanamombe*. Pa bosombo o mbwiiya mpasha waasolo baɔ, aliko bataimeyake la nkakolama. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />La bimuka binɛ bikwɛɛ waabwɛ, bimbɔɛlama la banto banɛ balembokaka besao be Kanamombe* la mimeya la libɛla. Kinaki bongo bosao phaabaka bejo waasolo baɔ. Bayalaka bataimeya weeleko too, la eleko e kekelama bako, bambosanjiya longo lakani laɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />La binkinɛ bimuka bikwɛɛ o baumba, bimboɛlama la banto baokaka besao be Kanamombe*. Kinaki liphikamaka waasolo baɔ aliko la besao ntipha la ntipha, la nombo la nanga besao be wooni. O ŋaanɛ phayaote bimuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />La bimuka binɛ bikwɛɛ ɔ lɔmɔtu lɔlɔti, beko bitaɛlama la banto baokaka besao be Kanamombe* la lisolo lilɔti la ja tayali. Bako bachikalaka baimei la mbota bimuka.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba litala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mlk 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Lonkinɛ Yesu a lɔndi nte: Koo bonto o toolaka litala la nkukumya la ephaka aɔ aliko la likicha entina la likenge. Kinaki, olikichaka ɔ lɔkɔphɔ, aliko kila onto aingela otema aɛni ekowa. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Lalikuli eisami, kekondo isolama phololo. La lalikuli ɛ kɛɛma e yuungu yakondo eyama phololo.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Aliko la ingo, ayeka nyo la besao betaoke nyo! Aliko ongo ole la ekambwa, kɔɔyamaka enkinɛ. Kinaki, ongo ole apha la ekambwa ko kumolamaka koonga engo ketakanya ndako nte ole la keko.<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lele la baotwa la Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mlk 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Luina lɔmɔɔ, lele la baotwa la Yesu baɔkɛndɛli. Kinaki koo mbɔsɔna mboosukamela aliko la wiike baanto. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Baosimeli Yesu bengo besako nte: «Nyɛŋɛbɛ la baotwa labɛ balende aanja, bandalange nkɔɛna». <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Kinaki Yesu asimeli banto nte: «Nyɛŋɛmi la baotwa lami ko bango baokaka bosao ba Kanamombe la nkemela».<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo simba ɛtɛmbɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mlk 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Luina lɔmɔɔ, Yesu auleli ɛ Kyɔmbɔ la baeki bande, aasimeli nte: «Tosaphwe wango nende boleka bonkinɛ». La bachwe.<verse eid="LUK 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Aiki bako batakɛndɛ, Yesu aoki ilɔ, alali. Kako nkango Ɛtɛmbɔ eolo keanjisa ndupha iloko la wango. Iloko yaanjisa mingela ɔ Kyɔmbɔ, baiki o libweelo. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Baeki* bachwe memola Yesu, la mboosimela: «Weekisi! Weekisi! Tombobwa»!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesu aemwe, la mpangwela ike longo lɔphɛphɔ la ɛtɛmbɔ, la bɛkɔwi la kaiki bii nɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Pa Yesu aumboli baeki bande nte: «Lokani lanyo lole ende»? Kinaki bako ba sebalali la ndawa la nsimelana: «Ɔnɛ ole nani, nende lɔphɛphɔ la ɛtɛmbɔ lota wooke»?<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwita bosombo bobe ele onto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mlk 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Ɔkɔngɔ laango, Yesu la baeki bande basaphwe wango, baemali o wooni ba Wagelasi boleka bɔnkinɛ ba wooni ba Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesu aiki atakitela ɔ kyɔmbɔ, bonto ɔmɔɔ a ongo ɔsɛngɛ aandi sukɛlɛ la ndako. Ɔnɛ onto wiiki la basombo babe. Biina ike, ongo koo ndɔtaka lonkinɛ bisenda, kinaki ayalaki too o baombo. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Aɛni ndako Yesu, aiyoki anyɔi otamboka lande alɔndi la joi linɛnɛ: «Wɛɛ, Yesu Bɔna a Kanamombe* ole eliko lalikuli, atamone laanke? Mbokoseya ko ntumbyake»! <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Ɔlɔndi ŋango aliko Yesu wiiki atasimela ongo bosombo bobe aopase. Ongo bosombo bobe wiiki etaokemela ɔnɛ onto biina lalikuli. Lonkinɛ koonga banto baɔlɛmi bekolo la bakasa la minyɔlɔlɔ o mboochunga, kinaki wiiki ataitena tena too. Lonkinɛ ongo bosombo bobe wiiki atawɛɛmbɛ eiki koo anto.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />La Yesu awuumboli: «Lokombo labɛ nani»? Aliko wiiki ombokemelama la basombo babe ike. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Bango basombo basɛi Yesu ataatɔlake e liphuku litale.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Kaama kango kaiki la boloi bɔnɛnɛ ba nsombo yaiki yatale weekondi. Bango basombo babe baosɛi ike Yesu abaɔya luusa la mingela wiingo nsombo. La Yesu abaɔyisa luusa. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Aliko la ingo, bango basombo babe bapasi ele ongo onto, la baingeli wiingo nsombo. La bakiteli e wango la nkilimwa la ninda.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Bango bachungi baɛni bingo lalikuli be paseli. Balawi wɛɛsɛngɛ la tɔsɛngɛ tɔnchɛ nsimela banto bengo besako. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Banto baandi mɛna bepaseli. La bako baiye kaama kaiki Yesu, batani ongo onto apashemi basombo babe, atayale weekolo be Yesu, ole ɔmbɔlɔta bisenda la ole la limanya. Bango banto balawi. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Bango banto baiyɛnɛli, basuudisa bingo bipaseli, ango basimeli bankinɛ bolengo baiki ongo anto akemelami la basombo babe wiikyami ndako. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Banto ba wooni ba Gelasi ba baemi la wɔɔma. Aliko la ingo ba lɔmbi Yesu aapasele o wooni baɔ. Yesu auleli ɔ kyɔmbɔ aliko, achu lande. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Ongo apashemi basombo babe, asɛi Yesu achu lande. Kinaki, Yesu koo nanga, ila aosimeli nte: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Utola e lulu ɔlɔndɛ lalikuli bimbo ko keela Kanamombe*».</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Ongo onto aingeli ɔɔsɛngɛ atasimela banto lalikuli beokeeli Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo tondola Bophoko a Yailo la mbikya Wainto ɔmɔɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-23">Mlk 5.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Eleko eutoli Yesu boleka onkinɛ ba wango, boloi baanto bo wɛɛbisa, aliko bako lalikuli baiki nde bataokonge. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Ango kwiiki waiyolo ɔmɔɔ Baasaŋanelo aelelamaki Yailo. Aiye la nkɔma balwe otamboka ba bekolo be Yesu. Asɛi Yesu ike nte aingele kande. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Aliko bophoko ande wiiki nkɔna ike. Wiiki bɔna ɔmɔɔ, oso bilongi joomu la biphee.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Eleko Yesu aiki atachu ka Yailo, banto baiki bata ophike beleka lalikuli. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />La woongo oloi kwiiki wainto ɔmɔɔ aiki la waale ba mpasa bekila ilango bilongi joomu laiphee. Wiiki ombo nsusha besanga bende lalikuli o baingi, kinaki koo ɔnɛ awiikisa. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Ɔnɛ wainto wiiki atalingita Yesu ɔɔkɔngɔ, akooli nsɔli e esenda e Yesu. Kako nkango waale bande ba mpasa bekila bosili. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu aumbɔli: «Nani omonkoola»? Banto lalikuli batati. Ango Pɛtɛlɛ awuumboli: «Bɔkɔta, phaɛni bɔnɛ wiike baanto bambo kolɛnga la nkophika»? <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Kinaki Yesu ɔlɔndi: «Kolende la onto onkooli, aliko mbooka nkulu yami imbopasa». <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Ongo wainto aɛni ndako nte omboeyama, achwe eiki Yesu atasɔkɛ la wɔɔma. Akɔmi balwe otamboka bande. Alɔndi otamboka baanto lalikuli ɛnɛ ɛɔtomi aokoole Yesu la bolengo nke mbwiki ndako kako nkango. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu aosimeli: «Bophoko ami, lokani labɛ lombo koikya. Chwaka bii».<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Ango aiki Yesu oloko atalɔndɛ, kwiiye bonto ɔmɔɔ aime ele wiyolo Yailo. Aosimeli: «Waiyolo, bophoko abɛ ombobwa! Ko ɛnyake lonkinɛ weekisi»! <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Aoki Yesu bingo, asimeli Yailo: «Kolawake; imeya too, bophoko abɛ landako akondo ika».<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Yesu aiye ndako o lulu la Yailo, koo mimeya bonto aingele kaama kamɔɔ lande, ila Pɛtɛlɛ la Yɔani la Yakɔbɔ la baoti ba ongo bophoko. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Banto lalikuli baiki e lotoko la batalele aliko la ongo bɔna. Kinaki Yesu aasimeli: «Kolelake nyo, aliko bɔna atabu, kinaki andalale too»! <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />La bako ba wɔɔli aliko baeyi nte ongo bɔna ombosila mbwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Kinaki Yesu akemeli ongo bophoko o likasa alɔndi: «Bɔna, emwa»! <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />La kako nkango weemwe la aemali. Yesu aasimeli ba wɔɔya bɔna lilɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Baoti bande basebalali ike. Kinaki Yesu aasimeli batasimelake bonto besao lalikuli bingo bi kɛɛmi.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ombotoma bakɛndi bande e bolemo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mlk 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Luina lɔmɔɔ Yesu aeleli bakɛndi bande joomu laaphee. Abaɔyisa nkulu ya mbikya bakɔnu la mbita basombo babe. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Aatomi bachu mbekya besao be ekeleka e Kanamombe* la mbikya bakɔnu. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Aasimeli nte: «Ɔlɔkɛndɔ lanyo Kɔɛmbake nyo ekambwa lalikuli: kɔɛmbake nyo bephapho aɔ lophata aɔ lilɛ aɔ besanga koonga lonkinɛ bisenda biphee. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Kila lulu lalikuli laingela nyo bakɔɛbɛya nyo, yala nyo ango nende ango apasa nyo woongo ɔsɛngɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Iya banto bakilake nkɔɛbɛya nyo ɔɔsɛngɛ ɔmɔɔ, wiipasele nyo ango. Ango apasa nyo kokola nyo juutu ja bekolo benyo. Ingo yakondo ɛnya kaɔ nte bakee bobe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkokola juutu mima weekolo: Ko nɔnda nte bonto atomami achiki lonkinɛ la ningo yaanto banɛ atomami ndako kaɔ iya bakilake besako be baelisa ndako. </char></note>». <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Bango bakɛndi*, baanjisa lɔkɛndɔ mbeta bɔsɛngɛ kaɔsɛngɛ bataekya Besako Bɛlɔti la mbikya bakonu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekalali e Bɔkɔta Elɔde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mlk 6.14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Eleko, Bɔkɔta Elɔde awooni ba Galilaya aoki ndako besako be bikambwa lalikuli be kɛɛmi, aiki la ekalali o ŋango balɔndaki bako: «Yɔani ombo tondwa mima waabwe»! <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Bankinɛ baiki batalɔndɛ nte olende wɛɛni Eliya kombopasela, la bankinɛ balɔndaki nte ɔmɔɔ a baɛni batango ombotondwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Kinaki, Elɔde ɔlɔndi: «Ɔnɛ Yɔani, mbɔ lemi kotenisa bɔtɛ bande. Anɛ nani ɔnɛ ataoke lemi besako bende»? Aliko la ingo Elɔde wiiki la mposa ɛmɛna Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombolesha banto ɛlɛfu itano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoa 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Eleko eutoli bango baeki*, basimeli yesu besao lalikuli bekee bako. Pa Yesu aatɔli, bɔɔ la banto boleka ba bɔsɛngɛ ba Betesaida.<verse eid="LUK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Kinaki banto baei echwe ndako, baolingiti. Yesu abaɛbisa aasimeli aliko la ekeleka e Kanamombe*, aekisa bango baiki la lokani la mbikyama.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Aiki kako likɔlɔ, bango bakɛndi* joomu laaphee baochweli, baosimeli: «Bɔkɔta anɛ tolende bɔɔ la banto. Wiingo simela banto bachu wɛɛsɛngɛ la tɔsɛngɛ ta sukɛlɛ, baibaele lilɛ la kaama ka ndala». <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Kinaki Yesu aasimeli: «Nyo ɔya nyo bako lilɛ». La bako bawuuchisa: «Tapha la lilɛ ila too bitumbula bitano la nsee iphee. Andalange tochu mbwasombela banɛ banto lalikuli lilɛ»? <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />[Ango baiki ba mpame, ilango 5,000.]</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Laango, Yesu asimeli baeki bande: «Simela nyo banto bayale o beloi beanto baomu atano atano». <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Baeki bakee wɛɛnte ŋango Yesu aasimeli, baakichisa banto lalikuli. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Pa Yesu aɔsi bingo bitumbula bitano la ingo nsee iphee, aulisa baiso eliko, achweli bochwako, abikeloli aɔyisa baeki bande aliko baphakele banto. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Banto lalikuli bale nende o jiimbi. Baeki bakɔngi bingo bichikalaki, baojisa biphaka joomu la iphee.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɛtɛlɛ ombo kekemeya nte Yesu olende Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mlk 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Luina lɔmɔɔ Yesu aiki atalɔmbɛ ndako nɛmɛlɛ, la baeki* bande baiki sukɛlɛ la ndako. Laango, abaumboli: «Banto batalɔndɛ nte lemi nde nani»? <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />La bako bawuuchisa: «Bamɔɔ batalɔndɛ nte wɛɛ olende Yɔani oso mbatisa la bankinɛ olende Eliya, bankinɛ olende ɔmɔɔ a baɛni batango ɔnɛ ombotondwa». <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Laango Yesu abaumboli: «Lanyo atalɔndɛ nyo nte lemi nde nani»? Pɛtɛlɛ auchisa: «Wɛɛ ko Kilisito Bɔna a Kanamombe*».<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɔmbɔ lɔnda aliko la libweelo jande</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16.20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30">Mlk 8.30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Ango Yesu asimeli baeki* bande bata simelake onto besako bɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Lonkinɛ aasimeli: kasana lemi Bɔna a Onto m'mbaa toakola ike la nkilama la bekongo la Bɛkɔta be baeta atei*, la Baekisi ba Isalia*. Lakondo njakema, kinaki luina la isato lakondo tondwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Pa aasimeli lalikuli nte: «Bonto lalikuli alangake njala weeki ami, asanjiya nkanya aliko la ndako nɛmɛlɛ, aɛmbɛ balemba bande kila luina, la aningite. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Aliko, bonto alangake nkakola luiko lande, akondo lolimeya. Kinaki, ongo alimeya luiko lande aliko lami, akondo ikakola. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Lonkinɛ kole la bekulukulu nke bonto mba besanga lalikuli e wooni, kinaki o mbwilimeya aɔ mbwi tumbya nɛmɛlɛ? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Iya bonto amɛnɛlake lemi nsɔni la mɛnɛla nsɔni besao bemi, la lemi Bɔna a Onto ŋango akɔ lakondo wɛɛnɛla bonto ɔnɛ nsɔni eleko eanda lemi asamba bokuchu bande la ba isɛndɛ la ba biphongo* bɛɛlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Mbokosimela nyo sɔlɔ: kolende la bankinɛ anɛ phaabu otamboka iya bataɛni ekeleka e Kanamombe».<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo tulola iima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mlk 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />O biina ɛnaanɛi pa Yesu nɔnda bengo besao, okemeli Pɛtɛlɛ la Yɔani la Yakɔbɔ auleli la bako ɛ bɔɔkɔ nɔmba Kanamombe*. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Wiiki atalɔmbɛ, iima ende etulwe, la esenda eandi ɛɛlɔ la mbɛla pɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30-31" />Weengo ekowa, kopaseli ba mpame ba phee baoli la bokuchu, Musa la Eliya. Bango ba mpame baiki bata ɔmbɔla la Yesu aliko la libwelo jande jaanda anɛ kasende engo Yɛlusalɛma.<verse eid="LUK 9:30-31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Eleko engo, Pɛtɛlɛ la baina lande baiki bambo ɔsɔnama la ilɔ nende ango aemwe bako. Baɛni bokuchu ba Yesu, ba baɛni la bango baphee baiki bamoemala kaama kamɔɔ lande. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Laango banɛ ba mpame ba phee, baaŋani la Yesu, Pɛtɛlɛ asimeli Yesu: «Bɔkɔta, kolende bɔlɔti iso njala anɛ. Tophike balɔmbɛ basato: kɛmɔɔ kɛbɛ, kɛnkinɛ ke Musa la kɛnkinɛ ke Eliya». Kinaki Pɛtɛlɛ koombeya ɛnɛ ɛ lɔndaki ndako.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Eleko iiki Pɛtɛlɛ oloko atalɔndɛ, mala ɛmɔɔ loonge lokiteli la mbwaalipha. Bango baeki baɛni longo loonge lomboalipha baɛni wɔɔma ike. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Jooi ja okami mima otema ba longo loonge: «Ɔnɛ ko bɔna ami asɔni lemi, oka nyo ndako».<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Pa lingo jooi mbokama, baeki* baɛni Yesu ombochikala nɛmɛlɛ opholi. Bakɔwi bii aliko la bingo bipaseli. La engo eleko, koo nsimela bonto lalikuli besao bɛɛni bako.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwita basombo babe ele bɔna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mlk 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Loi ende Yesu la baeki* basato, bakiteli bɔɔkɔ. Boloi bɔnɛnɛ baanto basaŋani la ndako. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />O bongo boloi, bonto ɔmɔɔ aokomi la joi linɛnɛ, la nɔnda: «Weekisi! Mbokoseya o nendele ɔnɛ bɔna ami ɔmɔɔ! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Basombo babe balende, bataokemela, kako nkango batawookomya, bataɔtɛkya la mbɔɔkwɛya biunkunya la mboopasha lɔfulɔ woonywa. Bango basombo babe phaosanjiya loango la mboo tumbya ike. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />N'nɔmbi baeki baɛ baopasha bako, kinaki koo mbɔsɔna».<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Laango Yesu alɔndi: «Nyo banto ba bɛnɛ biina apha nyo la lokani, lonkinɛ olende nyo babe ike. Njalaki lanyo la nkooka nyo nende luina nke»? Pa aosimeli ongo onto: «Ombela ongo bɔna abɛ anɛ».<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Eleko iiki ongo bɔna atachu ele Yesu, kako nkango bango basombo babe baɔkwɛisa anyɔi la mbɔɔsɔkya. Kinaki, Yesu aphangweli ongo bosombo bobe la ndako aopasi aiki. Yesu auchisa ongo bɔna la mbɔwɔya isɛnde. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Banto lalikuli ba sebalali ike ɔ mɛna nkulu nɛnɛ ya Kanamombe*.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu ɔmbɔ lɔnda lonkinɛ aliko la libweelo jande</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mlk 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Eleko bango banto lalikuli baiki baloko batasebalala aliko la bikambwa lalikuli biiki Yesu atakee, asimeli baeki bande nte: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Oka nyo bɔlɔti besao bɛnɛ betaone lemi nkosimela nyo: Lemi Bɔna a Onto lakondophakema waakasa baanto». <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Kinaki, bengo besao beasimelaki Yesu bako koo mbeya maana ba lingo jooi. Iiki itaisama kaɔ nte bataeyake. La bako ba lawi mbowuumbola maana ba bongo bosao.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nani ole waiyolo?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mlk 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Baeki* ba Yesu baiki bataamoyana asamba bako aliko la mbeya nani ole waiyolo asamba bako. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu wiiki pa mbeya limanya jaɔ. Aliko la ingo ɔɔsi bɔna a likɛnda la mbookicha sukɛlɛ lande. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Aasimeli nte: «Bonto lalikuli aɛbɛya bɔna ampɔu o lokombo lami, nte lemi komboɛbɛya ndako; la bonto lalikuli ambɛbɛya lemi, ko ongo antomi komboɛbɛya ndako. Aliko, ɔnɛ ole mpɔu asamba nyo, ndako kole waiyolo».<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔnɛ ole phajakani lanyo olende boleka banyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mlk 9.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Laango weeki Yɔani alɔndi nte: «Bɔkɔta, tɔmwɛna bonto ɔmɔɔ atapasha basombo babe o lokombo labɛ. Laiso tooni mboosimba, aliko ndako apha ɔmɔɔ aso». <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Kinaki Yesu aosimeli: «Koosimbake nyo, aliko ongo ole apha etamba eso olende boleka baso».<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basamaliya bamɔɔ bambokila mbɛbɛya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Eleko e Yesu nsakolama e loola eiye, ndako kapasisha yuungu ya nchwa ɛ Yɛlusalɛma. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Laango otomi banto baotangolele. Bango banto bachwe baingeli ɔɔsɛngɛ bɔmɔɔ ba Samaliya, aliko ba ɔɔlɔngɔsɔlɛlɛ kaama. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Kinaki baso ɔsɛngɛ koo nanga mbo wɛɛbɛya, aliko wiiki ɛlɔkɛndɔ lanchwa ɛ Yɛlusalɛma. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Laango, baeki* bande, Yakɔbɔ la Yɔani aɛni bako bingo balɔndi: «Bɔkɔta, alanga tɔlɔmbɛ iya mima e loola yaa sile». <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Kinaki Yesu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kole la mabuku bankinɛ beandekami katango, binɛ bitakokya besao bɛnkinɛ weengo betango nte: lonkinɛ Yesu ɔlɔndi: Nyo phaeye nyo nte oyalaka nyo ba Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ a Kanamombe? Eya nyo nte lemi Bɔna a Onto, phamandi nkamya banto, kinaki mandi nde mbwa kakola.</char></note>aatulweli la mbwaphangwela. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Ba pasi, bachwe bɔsɛngɛ bɔnkinɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banɛ basana njala Baeki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Aiki Yesu la baeki bande e mboka, bonto ɔmɔɔ aosimeli nte: «Lakondo yala latakolingita kaama lalikuli e chwa wɛɛ». <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu aosimeli: «Bɔkɛngɛ oyalaka la Bokolo la mpulu bayalaka la bilumba. Kinaki lemi Bɔna a Onto phalayalaka la kaama ka ndala».<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesu asimeli bonto onkinɛ ŋaanɛ: «Oningite». Kinaki ongo onto alɔndi: «Bɔkɔta, ompaa obi luusa nchu nkunja isɛmi».<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu awuuchisa: «Sanjiya babwe bakunja babwe baɔ, kinaki wɛɛ chwaka loko ekya banto besao be ekeleka e Kanamombe*».<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />La onto onkinɛ asimeli Yesu: «Bɔkɔta lakondoyala latakolingita, kinaki, ompaa obi luusa langochwa ndaka bolunga bami». <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu aosimeli: «Bonto lalikuli akemela liyɛmbɛ aliko la mona, kinaki iya alendake ɔkɔngɔ, phasane mbekya besako beekeleka e Kanamombe*».<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ombotoma baeki baomu esambaele laaphee o bolemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Pa ingo, Bɔkɔta ɔ sɔni bankinɛ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kole la mabuku bankinɛ binɛ bimbɔlɔnda baomu esambaele.</char></note>baeki baomu esambaele laaphee. Aatomi ba phee ba phee, batangole otamboka lande kila ɔsɛngɛ la kaama lalikuli elangi ndako nɛmɛlɛ nchwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Aasimeli: «Lilɛ lilende ike, kinaki bauki balende basali. Aliko la ingo, simela nyo ɔmɛlɛ ebeli atome bauki bankinɛ weebeli ende. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Nkaanɛ chwaka nyo! Eya nyo nte, mbokotoma nyo wɛɛnte bana baɛkɔkɔ batachu asamba nkɔi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Kɔɛmbake nyo besanga aɔ mpata aɔ tomposo; la kɔɛbɛyake nyo bonto lalikuli e mboka.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />«La kila lulu layala nyo ataingela, otamboka ɛbɛya nyo bako ŋaanɛ: Bii keyale o lulu lanyo! <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Iya koyalake bonto o longo lulu atalange bii, bii enyo kekondoyala lande. Iya jɛ, engo bii enyo kekondo kuutolela nyo. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Yala nyo e longo lulu atale nyo la nywa lalikuli bɛkɔya nyo bako, aliko bokambi osanaka mbɔyama musaala bande. Kochwake nyo ole nyo ɔlɔnɛ lulu la lonkinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Iya wiiyake nyo ɔɔsɛngɛ bɔmɔɔ, la banto bakɔɛbɛyake nyo, lɛɛ nyo lalikuli bɛkɔya nyo bako. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Ikya nyo bakɔnu bayala ongo, simela nyo banto: ‹Ekeleka e Kanamombe* kembosukama kanyo›. <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Kinaki wiingelake nyo ɔɔsɛngɛ lalikuli, iya banto phaakɔɛbisa nyo, pasa nyo, eta nyo o mboka yaɔ la nɔnda: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‹Tombo ko kokolela nyo juutu ja bɔsɛngɛ banyo botokemeli weekolo beso. Kinaki koonga ŋaanɛ eya nyo nte ekeleka e Kanamombe* kembosukama kanyo›. <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Sɔlɔ mbokosimela nyo nte, eleko luina la ntumbyama luiyaki, banto ba bɔsɛngɛ bakondoba tosoya mbeta tongo ta Sodomo.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŋandi wɛɛsɛngɛ bele koo mimeya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />«Ŋandi ele wɛɛ bɔsɛngɛ ba Kolasini! Ŋandi ele wɛɛ bɔsɛngɛ ba Betesaida! Aliko, iya bintɔmpɔ bikiisa lemi kanyo bitɔkɛɛma ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Tilo la Sidoni, banto ba bengo bɛsɛngɛ batondo yala anyɔi la ndɔta makunia la mbwikila betoko aliko baɛnya nte bambotulola belengo bɛɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Koonga ŋango, luina la ntumbyama, banto ba Tilo la Sidona bakondo tumbyama inchɛ nkoleka nyo. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />La wɛɛ bɔsɛngɛ ba Kapelenaumu, onde, akondo isakola nende e loola? Jɛ! Akondo kicheyama nende e liphuku».<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Lonkinɛ Yesu aasimeli baeki bande nte: «Ɔnɛ akooka nyo, nte lemi komomboka ndako, kinaki ɔnɛ akila nkɔɛbɛya nyo, nte lemi kombokila ndako limbɛbɛya. La bonto lalikuli akila limbɛbɛya lemi, nte ongo antomi lemi kombokila ndako».<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bango baeki* baomu esambaele la baphee bambo utola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Pa, bango baeki baomu esambaele laaphe bautoli ba mboola la libɛla linɛnɛ, balɔndi: «Bɔkɔta, koonga basombo baiki bata tooke eleko eiki iso tata baite o lokombo labɛ». <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Laango Yesu aasimeli: «Mbiki lataɛni bosombo ŋango baiki ndako atakitela wɛɛnte ibalibali mima e loola. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Oka nyo, mbɔkɔya nyo nkulu ya ndeka bosombo. Akondo yala nyo atanyɛkɛ ndwa la nkoto, la nkulu aliko la nkulu lalikuli ya ongo etamba, koo ekambwa lalikuli ɛɔsɔna nyo nko kɛɛ bobe. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Koonga ŋango, kuisɛkɛyake nyo, aliko la basombo batakooke nyo, ila, wiisɛkɛyɛ nyo, aliko nkombo yanyo imwandekama e loola».<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libɛla ja Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Weengo eleko, Yesu aisɛkisa ike mbetela nkulu ya Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ, alɔndi: Mbo kosakoya wɛɛ phapha, Bɔkɔta a loola la wooni. Aliko wiisisha baso lokani la limanya besao bɛnɛ, ombwiisolela bana. Sɔlɔ, phapha, ŋango nde kolangi wɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Pa, Yesu ɔlɔndi: «Isɛmi ɔmɔmpaa bikambwa lalikuli. Koo onto ambeya lemi bɔna ila isɛmi. La koo ɔnɛ aeya phapha ila lemi bɔna, la banto balanga lemi ba weeye».<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />O kantunda, Yesu laango achwe ele baeki bande alɔndi: «Alombele banɛ bamwɛna binɛ bimwɛna nyo! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Sɔlɔ, mbokosimela nyo nte:Baɛni la Bɛkɔta ike balangi mɛna binɛ bimwɛna nyo, kinaki koo mbo biɛna. Lonkinɛ balangi mboka binɛ bimbooka nyo kinaki koo mbo bioka».<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba Musamaliya Bɔlɔti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Pa bingo, weekisi ɔmɔɔ aisalia aemali, aumboli Yesu o mbowaambela lilonga: «Weekisi, nke ŋaande nte m'mba luiko la tiiti»? <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu awuuchisa nte: «Koandekamaka ŋaande otema ba isalia*? La ookaka ŋaande ango asɔmaka wɛɛ»? <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Ongo weekisi aisaliya auchisa nte: «Yala atalange Bɔkɔta Kanamombe abɛ, o lisolo jabɛ lalikuli, o onto baɛ lalikuli, o nkulu yabɛ lalikuli, la limanya jabɛ lalikuli. La, yala atalange a mamana labɛ wɛɛnte wiilangaka wɛɛmɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Nkanya 6. 5; Walawi 19. 18.</char></note>». <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />E kantunda Yesu aosimeli: «Ombuucha bɔlɔti! Bingo nde biyala wɛɛ atakee, aliko obaa luiko».<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Kinaki ongo weekisi a Isaliya* olangi mbwiɛnya njala boso sɔlɔ, aumboli Yesu:«La amamana lami ko nani»? <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu awuuchisa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:30">«Bonto ɔmɔɔ wiiki atakitela mima ɛ Yɛlusalɛma nchwa e Yeliko. Aiki ndako e mboka, okwɛɛ waakasa ba bakumoli. Bango baokumoli bikambwa bende la mboophoma, baochiki ombolala mɛ la mbwa».<verse eid="LUK 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Kopaseli Weeta atei ɔmɔɔ aetaki weengo mboka, awɛɛni, aeti boleka bonkinɛ, achwe lande. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Mulawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mulawi: Balawi baiki banto ba bolunga ba lɔsɔmwa ba Isilaɛli banɛ baiki bataamola baiyolo ba baeta atei nkɛɛ bolemo o lulu la Kanamombe. Ɔsɔmɛ Isabu 3. 1-13.</char></note> ɔmɔɔ lande aiye ango. Awɛɛni ndako onngo onto, lande aeti boleka bonkinɛ, achwe lande.<verse eid="LUK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />«Pa kopaseli Musamaliya ɔmɔɔ aiki ɔlɔkɛndɔ. Aiye ndako ango aiki ongo onto, la ndako awɛɛni ongo onto, la awɛɛnɛli ŋandi».<verse eid="LUK 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Aosukameli, awiingi ingo mpota yande la mbowiila difai la bauta la mbwiilɛma. Awuulisa aliko la mpunda ende, la aɔtɔli e lulu laaŋɛni nte aiŋame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Musamaliya bɔlɔti ɔmbɔlɛma mpota ya ongo aphomami |alt = src = WA03863b. Tif''size = ''span'' copy''Graham Wad''ref'' 10.34''</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Lɔi ende, opasisha dinali iphee yaakuti, ɔɔyisa ongo ɔmɛlɛ lulu laaŋɛni, aosimeli: Inga ɔnɛ onto bɔlɔti, la ango autola lemi, bakuti bapasha wɛɛ ya liko lakondo kɔngɛla o mbutola.<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Ango Yesu aumboli ongo weekisi a Isaliya* nte: «Asamba banɛ basato, nani ɔmwɛnamwa njala amamana la ɔnɛ akwɛɛ waakasa baakumoli»? <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Ongo weekisi a Isalia* auchisa Yesu nte: «Ongo awɛɛnɛli ŋandi».</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu aosimeli nte: «Chwaka, labɛ oyale atakɛɛ ŋango».<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu e lulu la Malata la Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Eleko Yesu la baeki bande baiki ɛ lɔkɛndɔ, baingeli wiisɛngɛ imɔɔ. Wiingo isɛngɛ kaiki la wainto ɔmɔɔ aelelami Malata, atɔli Yesu e lulu lande. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Ongo Malata aiki la waankunɛ ande aelelamaki Maliya. Ɔnɛ aiki atayale mpamba la bekolo be Yesu, ata oke beiki Yesu ataekya. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Kinaki, Malata ndako wiiki ataaŋanga la bikambwa ike. Laango achwɛli Yesu, aosimeli: «Bɔkɔta, wɛɛ phaeye nte waankunɛ ami omonchika lataaŋanga lɛɛmɛlɛ opholi, ingo phayakosimela ekambwa? Simela ndako, amamole».<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Kinaki Bɔkɔta Yesu awuuchisa: «Malata, Malata! Wɛɛ omoaŋanga la mena la bikambwa ike. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Kinaki kolende la ekambwa ɛmɔɔ ɛnɛ ele la bekulukulu. Maliya ndako ɔmbɔ sɔna ekambwa ɛlɔti ndeka ele koo ɔnɛ onto aɔsɔna mbookumola».<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo ekya baeki bande nɔmba Kanamombe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Luina lɔmɔɔ Yesu wiiki kaama kamɔɔ atalɔmbɛ Kanamombe*. Asili ndako nɔmba ɔmɔɔ a baeki bande aosimeli: «Bɔkɔta, otoekya nɔmba ŋango Yɔani oso mbatisa weekisa baeki bande».<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu aasimeli: Ɔ nɔmba yanyo yala nyo atalɔndɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Phapha!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Lokombo labɛ lokuchame!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Bokuchu babɛ boande!<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Oyale atatɔya lilɛ jaso ja kila luina.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Oyale atatosokolele njambi yaso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">aliko la iso tosokolelaka lalikuli batokeeli bobe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">la koyalake atatochike tuingele asamba mayalibu. <verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Lonkinɛ Yesu aasimeli baeki bande nte: «Tɔlɔndɛ obi: Iya ɔmɔɔ anyo ole la keseka kende, achwe kande atiya ya ocho, la mbosimela: ‹Keseka, ɔnsɔmbya bitumbula bisato, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />aliko keseka kɛmi ɔmɔɔ omombiela kami ole ɔlɔkɛndɔ la lemi lapha la ekambwa ɛ mbɔwɔya›. <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Iya ongo, ole otema ba lulu awuucheyake nte: ‹Ko maŋangyake! Mbosila ndipha lɔkukɛ. Lemi la bana ami tombosila ndala. Phalaɔsɔna memwa la nkɔɔya bitumbula›! <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Sɔlɔ mbokosimela nyo nte: Koonga phaemwe mbɔwɔya aliko ndako ole keseka kende, kinaki, akondo emwa mbɔwɔya lalikuli e langa ndako, aliko la ongo onto membeleya mbɔɔlɔmba.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />«La lemi mbokosimela nyo: Yalanyo atalɔmbɛ aliko ɔɔyame nyo; yala nyo ataphome ɛ lɔkukɛ aliko olipholame nyo. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Aliko bonto lalikuli ɔlɔmbaka ndako kɔɔyamaka, la ɔnɛ oonaka ndako ko baaka, la ɔnɛ ophomaka ɛ lɔkukɛ ndako ko lipholamaka. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Nani asamba nyo ole bɔna ande aɔlɔmbake nse, awɔɔya ndwa? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />La iya bɔna aɔlɔmbake bokele, akondo wɔɔya nkoto? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Nyo banto babe, ataeye nyo mbɔya bana banyo bikambwa bilɔti, la isɛnyo ole e loola akondo kɔɔya nyo Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ bango bataɔlɔmbɛ».<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la Belisebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mlk 3.20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Luina lɔmɔɔ Yesu wiiki ataite bosombo bobe iiki itaokicha bonto ɔmɔɔ eluma. Eleko eopasi ongo osombo, kako nkango aanjisa nɔnda. La boloi baanto baiki ango ba sebalali. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Kinaki bamɔɔ asamba bango banto baanjisa nɔnda: «Olende ataite basombo o nkulu ya Belisebuli, waiyolo aasombo». <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bankinɛ, bawuuchisa, baɔlɔmbi aakeele ɛntɔmpɔ ɛmɔɔ ɔ mɛnya nte wiimi ele Kanamombe*.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Kinaki Yesu, weeyi limanya jaɔ, aasimeli: «Ekeleka lalikuli etajakana banto bamɔɔ la bankinɛ phekeɔsɔna nseka. La banto ba bolunga bɔmɔɔ baso njala la bolupho asamba bako, kantunda ba balaŋane. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Anɛ iya bosombo lande aiphakake o njakanya ekeleka ende keemala ŋaande? Mbokosimela nyo ingo aliko nyo ɔlɔndi nyo nte landaite basombo o nkulu ya Belisebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Iya lataite basombo o nkulu ya Belisebuli, bana banyo bale bataite o nkulu ya nani? Aliko la ingo, bako nde baɛnya nte apha nyo la isaliya. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Kinaki lemi, iya o nkulu ya Kanamombe* yataite lemi basombo, aliko la ingo eya nyo nte ekeleka e Kanamombe* kembo sila mbiya kanyo.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />«Bonto boso nkulu ayalake la lulu ya beta okombelelaka lulu lande, la besanga bende betayale bii. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Kinaki, iya boso nkulu mbooleka aandake mboo jakanya la aolekake, akondo okumola mbolo yande lalikuli bekicheaki ndako lokani la mphaka bikambwa lalikuli beokumoli ndako.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />«Bonto lalikuli ole apha boleka bami, olende etamba emi. La ongo ole phamamolaka nsaŋanya, ko nɔnda obalaŋanyaka».<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbutola ya Basombo babe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Yesu amemeisa nɔnda nte: «Bosombo bobe a pasake ele onto, ochwaka atalɛnga lɛnga kaama kale kapha laanto o momoya. Iya phabae wiilɔndɛlaka nɛmɛlɛ: ‹Lakondo utola o lulu lami eimi lemi›. <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Autolake, akondotana longo lulu lɔmbɔɔmama la nɔngɔsɔlama bɔlɔti. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Laango, akondochwa mbɔsa basombo bankinɛ esambaele babe mbooleka ndako. Bako lalikuli bakondo chwa mingela o longo lulu la mbwiyalela kako. Ango, bolengo ba ongo onto bakondo yala bobe ndeka otamboka».<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libɛla ja sɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu aiki ndako atalɔndɛ bengo besao, wainto ɔmɔɔ asamba bongo boloi ba anto, ookomi la nkulu ɔlɔndi: «Alombele wainto ɔnɛ akooti la nkɔlɔmya»! <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Kinaki Yesu awuuchisa: «Baso wɛɛsɛ ko bango bataoke bosao ba Kanamombe la nkemela».<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banto batalange imbali ya ɛntɔmpɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Boloi baanto bophaphi nkokyama, Yesu aasimeli: «Jooti linɛ, lilende libe. Kendalange ɛntɔmpɔ, kinaki, pheke ɔyama ɛntɔmpɔ lalikuli aliko la engo ɛntɔmpɔ ɛ wɛɛni Yɔna. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Ŋango wiiki Yɔna ɛntɔmpɔ o waanto ba Ninawe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Yɔna 3. 3-5.</char></note>. La ŋango akɔ lemi Bɔna a Onto lakondo yala ɛntɔmpɔ o linɛ jooti».<verse eid="LUK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Wiina ba toakola, Bɔkɔta a wainto mima ɔɔkɔngɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ 1Bɛkɔta 10. 1-10.</char></note> ba wiina, otondwaki eleko ɛmɔɔ lanyo o nkositaka nyo. Aliko ndako apaseli bɔɔ ike onchwa nanga besao be limanya Bɛɔkɔta Sɔlɔmɔnɔ. Anɛ, ɔnɛ ole anɛ olende waiyolo ndeka Sɔlɔmɔnɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Eleko engo luina la tosoya luiyaki banto ba Ninawe la bako batondwaki kaama kamɔɔ la banto ba wiina ba lɛlɔ o mbwasitaka. Aliko bako eleko eoki bako mbekya ya wɛɛni Yɔna, baimeisa. La ɛna nde lɛlɔ kole la waiyolo ndeka Yɔna!<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekowa e bionge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Yesu ɔlɔndi lonkinɛ: «Koonto aɔsɔna ntoola litala la mbisha aɔ nkukumya la ephaka. Kinaki, okichaka aliko la lɔkɔphɔ, aliko banto baingelake otema baɛni ekowa. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Baisɔ ko litala ja bionge bɛbɛ; iya baiso baɛ phaakɔni bionge bɛbɛ lalikuli bekondo yala weekowa. Kinaki iya baisɔ babɛ bayalake nkɔna, la bionge bɛbɛ ŋango akɔ bekondo yala e wiilima. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Wiingo ayeka aliko ekowa ele otema baɛ, keta tulwake njala wiilima. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Anɛ iya bionge bɛbɛ lalikuli biyalake weekowa, koo kaama kamɔɔ kayala o wiilima. Bionge bɛbɛ bekondo yala weekowa e sɔlɔ. Wɛɛnte ŋango bokɔɛnyaka litala mbetela ekowa ende».<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo ɛja Bafalisayɔ* la Baekisi ba Isaliya*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu asili ndako nɔnda, Mufalisayɔ* ɔmɔɔ aweeleli nchwa ndɛ lilɛ kande, landako achwe, ayali la ndɛ lilɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Ongo Mufalisayɔ* asebalali mɛna Yesu atale lilɛ koo mbɔkya bakasa.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Bɔkɔta Yesu aosimeli nte: «Nyo Bafalisayɔ* ɔɔkyaka nyo bekoyo la mphɛphɛ anja. Kinaki otema baasolo banyo komboola nanga la bobe. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Nyo balee! Ɔnɛ alɔngɔsɔli anja mbɔ ndako ka lɔngɔsɔli otema ŋango akɔ? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Yala nyo ataɔya baola bikambwa bile otema ba bingo bekoyo aɔ otema ba ingo m'mphɛphɛ. Aliko bikambwa lalikuli biyale bilɔti kanyo.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />«Kinaki ŋandi ele nyo Bafalisayɔ*! Aliko opashaka nyo mpato ya balilo wɛɛnte ŋango: Binjɛlɛ la tololo la balilo bankinɛ ba ndɛ. Kinaki oophelaka nyo isaliya la lolango la Kanamombe. Ingo nde ya sana nyo nkɛɛ koo mbophela m'pasha mpato ya bingo binkinɛ lalikuli.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />«Ŋandi ele nyo Bafalisayɔ*, aliko olangaka nyo njala kaama ka otamboka o Basaŋanelo. Lonkinɛ mbɛbɛyama la bokuchu ka banto ike. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Ŋandi ele nyo! Aliko oyalaka nyo wɛɛnte baombo bataisama, la banto batakɛndɛ aliko la bako phaaeye».<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Ɔmɔɔ a baekisi ba isalia* aosimeli Yesu ŋaanɛ: «Weekisi, besao bɛbɛ bembo totola laso ŋango akɔ». <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu awuuchisa: «Lanyo baekisi ba isalia, ŋandi ele nyo; aliko ɔmɔɛmbya nyo banto belito bele phee amolama, ɛnɛ nyoamɛlɛ phasembola nyo koonga lophita o mbo waamola. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Ŋandi ele nyo, aliko ombophika nyo baombo ba baɛni bango bajaki bekongo benyo. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Wiingo ombo kekemeya nyo la mimeyana la belengo be bekongo benyo; aliko bako bajaki bango baɛni, lanyo ombophika nyo baombo baɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Wiingo, limanya ja Kanamombe limbɔlɔnda ŋaanɛ: ‹Lakondo tɔla baɛni la baeki, kinaki bakondo ajaka bamɔɔ asamba bako, la ntumbya bankinɛ›. <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Bopaselo bande, ko jooti linɛ jakondo tumbyama aliko la bekila be baɛni lalikuli besui manja katango ka wooni; <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />manja nsua ya bekila be Abeli nende bengo be Sakaliya ajaki bako atiya ba alɔtale la kaama kaɛlɔ. Sɔlɔ, jooti linɛ jakondo tumbyama aliko la bengo belengo.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />«Ŋandi ele nyo baekisi ba isaliya, aliko ombwisha nyo ingo nfungola ya lɔkukɛ ya limanya; nyo amɛlɛ phuingeli nyo la ombo kenga nyo banɛ bamingela bataingelake».<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Apasi ndako ango, bango Bafalisayɔ la Baekisi ba Isalia baanjisa mbo jakyanya la nkulu, mboophika la besao ike: <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Aliko baokemele weesao bende.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yuungu aliko la bonto ole apha phololo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Weengo eleko banto basaŋani weeloi be maɛlɛfu baiki batanyɛkana. Yesu asimeli obi baeki* bande: «Ayeka nyo la besao be Mafalisayɔ*, ko nɔnda banto bale bapha phololo. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Ekambwa lalikuli eisisha bako kekondo isolama, la ekambwa lalikuli eisami kekondo iswa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Aliko la ingo, ekambwa lalikuli kɛ lɔndami e wiilima banto bakondo oka asamba yaani. La ekambwa lalikuli ɛlɔnda nyo waaniŋina otema ba kyumba lataliphama, yakondo lɔndama la jooi linɛnɛ aliko la nsambe».<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔnɛ asana ndawama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Yesu a memeisa nɔnda: «Mbokosimela nyo biseka bemi nte: ko yalake nyo atalawa banto bajakaka bionge, kinaki ɔkɔngɔ la njaka phaɔsɔna lonkinɛ nkɛɛ ekambwa enkinɛ aliko la ingo. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Latalange nkɔɛnya nyo ongo aɔsɔna nyo njala ata olawa nyo: yala nyo atalawa Kanamombe* ɔnɛ aɔsɔna nkumola luiko la onto la pa nkumola olende la nkulu ya mboka onto wiiya. Sɔlɔ mbokosimela nyo, ɔnɛ ko onto asana nyo ndawa.<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />«Kombo eyama nte binsɔlɛ itano bisombamaka nde la bakuti baphee atoo. Kinaki Kanamombe phaophelaka koonga ɛnsɔlɛ ɛmɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />La, koonga libo ja bɛtɛ benyo, beajemaka. Kanamombe aeya isabu ya ingo lalikuli. Wiingo kolawake nyo, aliko nyo olende nyo la bokuchu ike ndeka binsɔlɛ ike».<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mimeya Yesu aɔ mbookila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Yesu ɔlɔndi lɔnkinɛ: «Mbokosimela nyo nte bonto lalikuli amimeya lemi otamboka baanto nte olende weeki ami, la lemi Bɔna a Onto lakondo wiimeya otamboka ba biphongo be Kanamombe*. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Kinaki, bonto lalikuli a ntata otamboka baanto, la lemi Bɔna a Onto lakondo otata otamboka ba biphongo be Kanamombe*.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />«Bonto lalikuli alɔnda bobe aliko lami Bɔna a Onto akondo sokolelama. Kinaki ongo atola Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ ndako phasokolelama koonga inchɛ.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />«Eleko eyala bako batakɔtɔlɛ nyo nte osambe nyo otema Baasaŋanelo* aɔ otamboka ba baiyolo aɔ otamboka ba Bɛkɔta, koyalake nyo la wɔɔma aliko la be samba nyo aɔ bɛ lɔnda nyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Aliko Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ akondo koekya nyo bingo besamba nyo aɔ nɔnda».<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba boso nombo bolee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Bonto ɔmɔɔ asamba bongo boloi baanto aosimeli Yesu: «Weekisi, onsimelele aotwa lami anphakele yami eteni entiko etochikeli isɛso». <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu awuuchisa nte: «Keseka kemi, nani ankichisa lemi njale waamoli asamba nyo, aɔ bophaki a besanga benyo»?<verse eid="LUK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Laango Yesu aasimeli banto lalikuli nte: «Ayeka nyo la nanga besanga be ntipha la ntipha. Aliko, luiko la onto phalaɛlamya la wiike ba besanga bende, koonga ole la besanga ike».<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Lonkinɛ Yesu aasimeli bomanu bɔnɛ: «Kaiki la boso nombo ɔmɔɔ aiki la bibeli bende bepashaki lilɛ ike. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Ɔnɛ boso nombo aanjisa mbwiumbola o lisolo jande: ‹Latakɛɛ ŋaande lemi anɛ lapha la kaama ka nkicha lilɛ jami›? <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Laango alɔndi: ‹La kondo kɛɛ ŋaanɛ: lakondo phanjola bokombe bami la lakondo phika bankinɛ banɛnɛ anɛnɛ. La waango kakicha lemi otema bande lilɛ jami lalikuli la bɛnkinɛ besanga bemi. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Lami lakondo isimela lɛɛmɛlɛ: ‹Lemi nkende la bikambwa ike bɛkɛɛ lemi biina ike. Anɛ laɔsɔna momoya n'ndɛ n'nywa la mbwisɛkɛya›!<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />«Kinaki Kanamombe* aosimeli: ‹Bolee wɛɛ, bocho ba lɛlɔ lakondo ɔsa lisolo jabɛ. La bingo bikanbwa lalikuli biiki wɛɛ ataikicheya bekondo, beyala be nani?›»<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu alɔndi lɔnkinɛ: «Ŋaanɛ boyalaka ele onto wiikicheyaka besanga aliko lande nɛmɛlɛ. Kinaki phakayalaka boso nombo ele Kanamombe*».<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkicha lokani ele Kanamombe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Pa Yesu asimeli baeki* bande: «Ingo nde ya chiki lemi nkosimele nyo nte, koyalake nyo la ekalali aliko la luiko lanyo la bionge benyo nte alɛ nyo nke, aɔ alɔta nyo nke. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Aliko luiko lanyo nde lole la bakuchu ike ndeka lilɛ, la bionge benyo nde bile la bokuchu ike ndeka bisenda. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Lenda nyo bomanu ba mpulu: phaonaka aɔ phaukaka la bapha la okombe. Kinaki Kanamombe* oaleshaka. La nyo mbɔ olende nyo la bokuchu ike ndeka mpulu! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Nani asamba nyo mbetela ndela yande aɔsɔna nkokeya inchɛ botale ba luiko lande? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Laango, iya phaɔsɔna nyo nkɛɛ bikambwa inchɛ wɛɛnte bingo, aliko laanke etalelalela nyo aliko la bikambwa binkinɛ?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />«Lenda nyo ŋango bata tɔngɔla bolowa. Phayakɛɛka ekambwa aɔ mbwisɔnɛla esenda. Kinaki mbokosimela nyo, koonga Bɔkɔta Sɔlɔmɔnɔ, o nomba yande lalikuli koo ndɔtaka esenda ndɔti wɛɛnte bolowa bɔmɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Balilo baebeli baɛnamwaka lɛlɔ la loi bambookama wiiya. Kinaki Kanamombe* wiilɔchaka bɔlɔti. Bolengo nke ele ndako phakɔlɔcha nyo bɔlɔti ike, eeh nyo baso lokani inchɛ»?<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Koyalake nyo ataiyaŋangya o mona ɛlɛɛ nyo aɔ ɛ nywa nyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Aliko banto ba ɔnɛ wooni, banɛ bale phaaeye Kanamombe, ko baonaka bingo bikambwa lalikuli jɛ mena. Kinaki nyo, Isɛnyo weeyaka nte olangaka nyo bingo bikambwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Wiingo, nyo yala nyo obi ataone ekeleka e Kanamombe*, la ndako akondo kɔya nyo binkinɛ lalikuli. <verse eid="LUK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Koyalake nyo atalawa, nyo boloi inchɛ! Aliko isɛnyo olangi nkɔya nyo ekeleka ende.<verse eid="LUK 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nombo e loola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Yesu ɔlɔndi lonkinɛ, sombya nyo bikambwa benyo lalikuli, la bango bakuti ɔya nyo baola. Wiikeele nyo mefuko bele pheekongolaki. Lonkinɛ wiikicheya nyo besanga e loola ele pheelimela. Engo baiyi phaaiye aɔ bɔtɛlɛli phayafute. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Aliko ango ale besanga bɛbɛ, kako kayala lisolo jabɛ.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakambi bale baiso phololo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Yesu alɔndi lonkinɛ: «Yala nyo solo, ombwilɛma nkɔli o baombo banyo la batala banyo bayale batatowa. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Yalaka nyo wɛɛnte bakambi* batakonge Bɔkɔta abɔ autole mima e libɛla ja nsɔŋana. Aliko baolipholele kako nkango eleko eakanya ndako e lɔkukɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Alombele bakambi* bango bale o mbutola ya Bɔkɔta abɔ, akondo atana baiso phololo! Mbokosimela nyo sɔlɔ, ɔnɛ alɛma bɔkɔta nkɔli e joombo, akondo akicha ɔ mɛsa la mbɔ baɔya lilɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Alombele bango bakambi bale iya Bɔkɔta abɔ ombuutola asamba ilumo, aɔ mpendu la mbwatana baloko baiso phololo!<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />«Eya nyo nte, ɔmɛlɛ lulu otoeya eleko yaanda wiiyi, phatochika lulu lande loolame. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Lanyo ŋango akɔ, yala nyo tayali, aliko lemi Bɔna a Onto lakonoanda weeleko ele nyo phaeye».<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bokambi oso lokani la ole apha la lokani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Laango Pɛtɛlɛ aumboli Yesu nte: «Bɔkɔta, bomanu bɔnɛ bolende aliko la iso atoo, aɔ aliko la banto lalikuli»? <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Landako Bɔkɔta auchisa: «Nani ole bokambi a lokani lonkinɛ bokambi a limanya? Ko ongo ole bɔkɔta ande akondo okicha nkenga lulu, aliko ayale ataɔya baina lande bakambi lilɛ eleko esana. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Alombele ongo bokambi ɔnɛ ole bɔkɔta ande autolake akondo otana oloko atakɛɛ ŋango. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Sɔlɔ ongo Bɔkɔta ande akondo okicha njala waiyolo aliko la besanga bende lalikuli.<verse eid="LUK 12:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />«Kinaki, iya ongo bokambi aanjake nɔnda otema ba lisolo jande nte: ‹Bɔkɔta ami ombo lembela o mbutola›; Pa ŋango aanjake mpoma baina lande bakambi, ba mpame la bainto, la ndɛ, la nywa, la ndɛwa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Bɔkɔta ande autolake luina la eleko ele ndako phaeye; akondo ophoma ike ongo bokambi bobe la mbookicha boloi bɔmɔɔ la bango bakambi babe.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />«Bokambi ɔnɛ aeya ŋango balanga bɔkɔta ande, kinaki phaikicha solo la nkɛɛ ŋango balanga ongo Bɔkɔta, akondo phomama ike. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Kinaki ongo akɛɛ bingo besana tumbyama koo mbeya belanga bɔkɔta ande, akondo phomama inchɛ. Ongo aɔyama ike, akondo ochama ike; la ongo aɔyama ike ndeka, akondo ochama ike ndeka».<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kole aliko la maŋana ya banto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Yesu alɔndi lonkinɛ: «Mandi ntoola iya e wooni, la ntolanga iyale nte imbosila ntowa! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Laɔsɔna mba ubatiso. La lalanga bongo ubatiso bo kekemale! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Atakanya nyo nte mandi mbela bii e wooni? Kapha ŋango! Kolende maŋana. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Manja anɛ, bolunga baanto batano bakondo phakana; basato boleka baɔ la baphee boleka baɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Phapha akondo yala etamba ele bɔna ande, la bɔna etamba ele isɛnde, lele etamba ele bophoko ande, bophoko etamba ele nyɛŋɛnde, bokilo a wainto akondo yala etamba ele walisɔngwa ande, la ɔnɛ etamba ele bokilo ande a wainto».<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbeya eleko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu asimeli lonkinɛ beloi beanto: «Eleko ɛɛnake nyo loola lataulela mima boleka ba likɔlɔ, ango alɔnda nyo nte: ‹Mbula kɛkɔndɔlwa› La sɔlɔ kɛlwaka. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />La eleko ɛɛnake nyo lɔphɛphɔ lataime ɔɔkɔngɔ latalombe, akondo lɔnda nyo nte: ‹Kakondo yala la yoomombe› La sɔlɔ koyalaka ŋango. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Nyo banto bale apha nyo phololo! Weeya nyo mbekya imbali ya lɔphɛphɔ o nenda bolengo ba wooni la loola. Aliko laanke, phaɔsɔna nyo mbeya besao bɛnɛ betakɛɛma wɛɛnɛ eleko»?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okana la etamba ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Yesu ɔlɔndi lonkinɛ: «Aliko laanke phaɔsɔna nyo mbwiyamolela bosao bɔlɔti ya nyo nkɛɛ? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Iya ɔnɛ ole lande bosao, akɔtɔlake o masitaki, kotoyala bɔlɔti kaɛ mbokana lande oloko nyo e mboka. Aliko atakɔtɔlake otamboka ya waamoli. Landako waamoli akondo kɔtɔla ele mesase, la bako bakondo koaka ɔ munyɔlɔlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Sɔlɔ mbokosimela nyo nte: phaɔsɔna mpasa iya otasile ngɛla likuti ja kantunda».<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Faida e nsokola njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Weengo eleko banto bamɔɔ baandi, ele Yesu la mboosimela aliko la banto ba Galilaya bango bajakisa Pilato. Aajakisa weeleko iiki bako batachinja nyama yaɔ o mpasha mpato ele Kanamombe. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Pa, Yesu abaumboli nte: «Atakanya nyo nte bango ba Galilaya banɛ bajakemi ŋango, baiki la njambi ike ndeka bankinɛ Bagalatiya lalikuli? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Jɛ! Kinaki mbokosimela nyo nte iya la nyo phaɔsɔna nyo nsokola njambi yanyo, nyo lalikuli akondo bwa nyo ŋango bobwe bako. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />La ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Silɔwamu, lulu lɔnɛnɛ la kwɛɛli banto joomu la ɛnaanɛi la babwe. Anɛ, nyo atakanya nyo nte bako atoo nde banto baiki la njambi ndeka bankinɛ banto lalikuli ba Yɛlusalɛma? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Jɛ! Kinaki mbokosimela nyo nte, iya lanyo phosokoli nyo njambi yanyo, nyo lalikuli akondo tumbyama nyo wɛɛnte bako».<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba bote bole koo mbota biuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Pa, Yesu aasimeli bomanu bonkinɛ nte: «Bonto ɔmɔɔ aoni bote ba''Tini'' weebeli ende e Misabibu*. Luina lɔmɔɔ, achwe auke biuma kako, kinaki koo mba ekambwa kako. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Ango, asimeli bokambi* ande a engo ebeli nte: ‹Ndaka! Kokende bilongi bisato bile bongo bote bombosila nkɛɛ, kinaki phalabaaka kako ekambwa. Kɔta bako! Aliko bandafute lɔmɔtu bulɛ›. <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Kinaki ongo bokambi* aosimeli nte: ‹Bɔkɔta, oochike lonkinɛ ɛnɛ elongi; lakondo memeya mboolingela lɔmɔtu la mboowiilela liŋɛna. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Kamɔti akondoota biuma weelongi etaande. Kinaki iya jɛ, ango aɔsɔna mbɔɔkɔta›».<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya wainto ɔmɔɔ luina la Sabato*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Luina lɔmɔɔ la Sabato*, Yesu aiki ataekya banto Waasaŋanelo* Baayuda. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Waango Basaŋanelo* kaiki la wainto ɔmɔɔ aiki nkɔna. Ongo wainto aiki ɔmbɔ kɛɛ bilongi joomu la ɛnaanɛi atatumbyama la Bosombo bobe. Ongo Bosombo wiiki ombosila mboomuna bɔkɔngɔ, nende eiki ndako phaɔsɔna lonkinɛ nsembwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Eleko ɛwɛɛni Yesu, aweeleli, la mboosimela nte: «Lele! Ombwikyama waale baɛ». <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Yesu aaphisa bakasa aliko lande. Kako nkango ongo wainto asembwe, la aanjisa nkucha Kanamombe.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Kinaki, waiyolo abango Basaŋanelo* Baayuda aomali ike, aliko Yesu aikisa bonto luina la Sabato*. Laango asimeli banto baiki otema nte: «Koyalaka too biina besamalo be nkamba bolemo. Anɛ, weengo biina nde kasana nyo mbiya mbikyama, kinaki kapha luina la Sabato*».<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Kinaki Bɔkɔta awuuchisa nte: «Nyo olende banto bapha phololo! Aliko laanke luina la Sabato* kila ɔmɔɔ asamba nyo ɔ lɛmɔlaka ŋɔmbɛ ende aɔ mpunda ende mima e bokoto, la nchwa nywɛɛsha iloko! <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Ɔnɛ wainto olende a jooti ja Ibulaimu ɔnɛ Bosombo aɔlɛmi wiilongi joomu la ɛnaanɛi. Anɛ, phakatosana alɛmɔlame luina la Sabato*»?<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Asili Yesu nɔnda bingo, bitamba bende ba tɔti la nsɔni. Kinaki bankinɛ banto lalikuli, bako baiki bataisɛkɛya la besao lalikuli bɛɛntɔmpɔ bɛnɛ beiki ndako atakɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba tuuma tɔnchɛ ba aladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-33">Mat 13.31-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mlk 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Pa Yesu alɔndi lonkinɛ nte: «Ekeleka e Kanamombe* kɛtaɛlamya laanke? La taɔsɔna mbɛlamya laanke? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Engo ekeleka kɛtaɛlamya la yuuma inchɛ ya aladali, inɛ bonto ɔmɔɔ aoni weebeli ende. Ingo yuuma ya mɛni la yaandi bote. Mpulu ba phiki bilumba bɛɔ aliko la bitaphe<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu alɔndi lonkinɛ nte: «Ekeleka e Kanamombe kɛɔsɔna mbɛlamya laanke? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Ɛnɛ ekeleka ketaɛlamya la bosunga bɔnɛ wainto ɔmɔɔ akemeli a luanyisa la buunga ike, nende ango bongo bosunga* baulangisa bongo bunga lalikuli».<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lɔkukɛ losali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7.13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">7.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu amemeisa la lɔkɛndɔ lande nchwa ɛ Yɛlusalɛma. Aiki atachu ataekya banto wɛɛsɛngɛ bɛnɛnɛ la besali. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Bonto ɔmɔɔ awuumboli nte: «Bɔkɔta, banto inchɛ too nde bakakolamaka loi»? Yesu abuuchisa nte: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Kekemala nyo o mingela ɔ lɔkukɛ losali. Aliko, mbokosimela nyo sɔlɔ nte banto ike bakondolangaka mingela otema, kinaki phaataɔsɔna.<verse eid="LUK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />«Eleko ɛnɛ eemalaki ɔmɛlɛ lulu la ndipha lɔkukɛ, nyo oyalaki nyo ataemala anja. Akonoanja nyo mbakanya lɔkukɛ la nɔnda nte: ‹Bɔkɔta, otolipholele›! Ndako akondo kuucheyaka nyo nte: ‹Phalaeye emwima nyo›! <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Ango akonoanja nyo nɔnda nte: ‹Iso ko bango balɛɛki la nywa kaama kamɔɔ labɛ. Lonkinɛ weekyaki o mboka ya bɛɛsɛngɛ bɛso.› <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Kinaki ndako okondo asimelaka nte: ‹Nyo phalakoeye nyo, pasa nyo bɔɔ lami, nyo lalikuli baso nkɛɛ njambi›!<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />«Ango akonɔɛna nyo Ibulaimu, la Isaka la Yakɔbɔ la Baɛni* lalikuli bale weekeleka e Kanamombe. Kinaki nyo, akondo phupholama nyo anja! Engo, akondo lela nyo la nkɛkɛta bainyo. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Banto baimaki oopaselo ba yaani la wiingelelo ba yaani, la otamboka la ɔkɔngɔ. Bango banto bakondoyala batale lilɛ weekeleka e Kanamombe*. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Oka nyo! Banto bamɔɔ banɛ bale ba kantunda, bakondo yalaka batango. La bango bale batango, bakondo yalaka ba kantunda».<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombolelela banto ba Yɛlusalɛma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Weengo eleko, Bafalisayɔ* bamɔɔ bachweli Yesu la mboosimela nte: «Pasa anɛ wiichwoele kaama kankinɛ, aliko Helɔde ataone nko jaka». <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu aasimeli nte: «Chwaka lokoosimele nyo ongo bɔlɛndɛ nte lɛlɔ la loi lakondo ita basombo babe la mbikya bakɔnu. La loi ende lakondo yala mbosila bolemo bami. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Kinaki, kasana m'membeleya la lɔkɛndɔ lami lɛlɔ, la loi la laiphee. Aliko phakasane wɛɛni* ajakeme woonkinɛ ɔsɛngɛ anja la Yɛlusalɛma».<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />«Haa nyo banto ba Yɛlusalɛma! Ojakaka nyo bɛɛni*. La banto banɛ Kanamombe akotomeli nyo, ataajake nyo o mbobaokela babwɛ. Mala ike laiki latalange nkosaŋanya nyo wɛɛnte ŋango bosaŋanyaka nkɔkɔ biasa bende waaphaphu. Kinaki nyo koo mimeya! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Anɛ okanyo! Lulu lanyo lakondo chikala phololo. Mbokosimela nyo sɔlɔ nte phomɛnaki nyo lonkinɛ, mbiya nende eleko ɛlɔnda nyo nte: ‹Achwelame bochwako ongo ataande e lokombo la Bɔkɔta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Sabuli 118. 26.</char></note>›».<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya bɔkɔnu luina la Sabato*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Luina lɔmɔɔ la Sabato*, Yesu achwe ndɛ lilɛ e lulu la waiyolo ɔmɔɔ a Bafalisayɔ*. La banto baiki o longo lulu baolendaki ike nte baɛni nke ɛkɛɛ ndako. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Otamboka lande Yesu, kaiki bonto ɔmɔɔ aiki la waale ba mbulanga bionge. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu abaumboli Baekisi ba Isaliya* la Bafalisayɔ* nte: «Isaliya* yaso iluusiyaka aɔ isimbaka mbikya bonto luina la Sabato*». <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Kinaki, baikɔwɛli bii. Yesu akooli ongo bɔkɔnu, awiikisa, la aosimeli achu lande. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Pa, Yesu abaumboli nte: «Nani asamba nyo ole bɔna ande aɔ ŋɔmbɛ ende kekwake o lifuku ja iloko luina la Sabato* apheke nchwa luango nkepasha otema koonga lole luina la Sabato*». <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Kinaki bako koombɔsɔna mbowuucheya.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbwiiuleya aɔ mbwikicheya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu aɛni ŋango banto baelelami bataisɔnɛla kaama ka otamboka. Laango abaɔyisa linɛ lilako: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Iya bonto ɔmɔɔ akoelelake o libɛla, koonake njala kaama ka otamboka. Aliko kaɔsɔna manda bonto ɔnkinɛ aelelami a bokuchu nkoleka. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />La ɔnɛ akoleka aiyake, ongo akoeleli nyo aphee aɔsɔna nkosimela nte: ‹Chikela ɔnɛ onto kaama›. Ango akondooka nsɔni ya nchwa njala weeje ɛ ɔkɔngɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Kinaki weelelamake, chwaka lokoyale weeje ɛ ɔkɔngɔ. Ango, ongo akoeleli aiyake aɔsɔna nkosimela nte: ‹Keseka kɛmi, aka lokoyale otamboka›. Ango, akondoba bokuchu otamboka baanto lalikuli batale wɛɛ labako. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Aliko, lalikuli aiyuleaka, akondo kicheyamaka. Kinaki bonto lalikuli wiikicheyaka akondo uleyamaka».<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Pa Yesu asimeli ongo awɛɛleli nte: «Eleko ɛ ɔyana wɛɛ lilɛ ja libɛla liyale ja yaani aɔ ja likɔlɔ, koyalake ataelela too biseka bɛbɛ, aɔ baotwa labɛ aɔ baoti baɛ aɔ ba mamani labɛ baso nombo. Aliko atakɛɛ wɛɛ ŋango, bako ŋango akɔ bakondo koelela ndɛ kaɔ ɔ ngɛla bingo biakeeli wɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Kinaki, ɔkɛɛkɛ libɛla, yala ataelela beola, baso nɛngɛla, la bitumbe la bentongo. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Ango, akondo chweelama bochwako, aliko bango banto bapha la ekuucheya bako. Kinaki Kanamombe* akando kɔngɛla eleko etondwaki baso nkɛɛ bɔlɔti».<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba libɛla linɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Bonto ɔmɔɔ asamba bango balɛɛki kaama kamɔɔ la Yesu aoki ndako bingo aosimeli nte: «Alombele ongo alɛɛ lilɛ weekeleka e Kanamombe*»!<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu awuuchisa mbetela bongo bomanu nte: «Bonto ɔmɔɔ akee libɛla linɛnɛ, la aeleli banto ike. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Akoki kako eleko ɛ ndɛ, atomi bokambi ande asimele baelelami nte: ‹Aka nyo anɛ, aliko bikambwa lalikuli bikende solo›. <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Kinaki, bako lalikuli kila ɔmɔɔ aanjisa nɔnda bomongo boosimbaki ataiyake. Otango aosimeli nte: ‹Mbosomba ebeli emi, la kasana nchu n'nenda; mbɔanɛ kasana nchu nkombelela. Mbokoseya ɔmɛnɛlɛ ŋandi.› <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Onkinɛ alɔndi: ‹Mbosomba ŋɔmbɛ joomu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ele Bayuda, baso ncha, baiki batakambya ŋɔmbɛ iphee iphee o mpolota liyɛmbɛ. </char></note>ya ncha bibeli. Anɛ mbochwa mbwakekela m'mɛni iya yaɔsɔna nkamba. Mbokoseya ɔmɛnɛlɛ ŋandi›. <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />La onkinɛ lande nte: ‹Mbɔsɔnga anɛ kasende too. Wiingo, phalaɔsɔna mbiya›.<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />«Ongo bokambi autoli ele Bɔkɔta ande. Aosimeli bengo besao lalikuli. Ongo Bɔkɔta ande aoki ndako bingo, aomali nkɛlɛ ike. Ango aosimeli ongo bokambi ande nte: ‹Chwaka loango e mboka nɛnɛ la nsali ya ɔsɛngɛ. Weela anɛ baola, la baso nɛngɛla, la bentongo la bitumbe›. <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Pa ongo bokambi autoli la nɔnda nte: ‹Bɔkɔta, bingo binsimeli wɛɛ nkee, mbɔ kɛɛ. Kinaki koonga ŋango koloko nde la kaama›. <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Ongo Bɔkɔta ande ango aosimeli nte: ‹Chwaka loknkinɛ e mboka lalikuli ya bɛsɛngɛ la ya bibeli. Banto lalikuli banɛ baɛna wɛɛ, obaembeleya nte baingele kami, aliko lulu lami loole la banto. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Sɔlɔ mbokosimela nyo nte, koo nende ɔmɔɔ asamba bango baelelami alɛɛ o lilɛ jami›».<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nchika lalikuli aliko la ningita Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Luina lɔmɔɔ, banto ike baiki batalingita Yesu. Atulwe la aasimeli nte: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />Ɔnɛ alanga liningita, anange ndeka isɛnde la nyɛŋɛnde la waajande la bana ande la baotwa lande, la betamba bende. Lonkinɛ anange lemi ndeka luiko lande nɛmɛlɛ. Iya jɛ phaɔsɔna njala weeki* ami. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Bonto ole phaɔsɔna memba balemba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɛmba balemba: ko mimeya ntumgyama aliko la Yesu Kilisito*..</char></note> bande, la linanga lemi, phaɔsɔna njala weeki* ami.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Eleko, ɔmɔɔ anyo atalange mpika lulu lɔnɛnɛ, kasana ayale obi, aɛni iya aɔsɔna mba besanga bɛɔsɔna ndako nkambya o nsila bongo bolemo. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Kinaki, iya aɔsɔnake mpika bɔnsɛnsɛ, pa aphekake nsila longo lulu, banto lalikuli bayala batalɔɛni, bakondo yala batawɔɔlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />La n'nɔnda nte: Ɔnɛ onto aanjisa mpika lulu, kinaki komboopheka nsila.<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />«Eleko, Bɔkɔta ɔmɔɔ atalange njakana la Bɔkɔta onkinɛ, kasana ayale obi, aɛni iya mbetela nkulu ya bakɔlɔbɔi bande ɛlɛfu joomu bale lande, aɔsɔna ndeka ongo wiina lande ole la ɛlɛfu baomu aphee. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Aɛnake nte phaɔsɔna, aɔsɔna mbootomela besako oloko bɔɔ, nte awuumbole bolengo nke baɔsɔna ndako nkɛɛ, aliko ba baa bii asamba bako. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Lanyo kolende ŋaanɛ! Koo onto asamba nyo aɔsɔna njala weeki ami iya atachiki ekambwa lalikuli bile lande».<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lɛɛphɔ lole koo faida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mlk 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Yesu ɔlɔndi lonkinɛ nte: «Lɛɛphɔ loyalaka nde ekambwa ɛlɔti. Kinaki lolimeyake lɔɛja lande<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lɛɛfɔ Laayuda laiki nde bɔɔbɔɔ la lɛɛphɔ la lɛlɔ. Aliko laiki nde wɛɛnte libwɛ ja kichamaki o lilɛ pa nkemela ɔ lilɛ jaiki jatakombelelama lonkinɛ. Losilake lɔɛja landelaiki nde lataphupholama. </char></note>, ekambwa nke esana mbila otema nte luutole njala lɔɛja? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Longo lɛɛphɔ, lotaika la faida lalikuli, loyale ɛ lɔmɔtu koonga ɛ liŋɛna. Balookaka anja. Boso batoi ba mboka aoke»!<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba bɔkɔkɔ ba limeli la baɛnamwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Luina lɔmɔɔ, Bangɛjisi ba kɔdi la baso njambi bankinɛ basukameli Yesu nte bawooke. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Bafalisayɔ* la Baekisi ba Isaliya* aɛni bako ŋango, baanjisa nɔnda bobe nte: «Ɔnɛ bonto ole ataɛbɛya banto babe la njala atale la bako»!<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Ango Yesu abaokeli bomanu bɔnɛ nte: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Bonto ɔmɔɔ asamba nyo ayalake la bɛkɔkɔ miya ɛmɔɔ, ɔmɔɔ asamba beko bolimelake, aɔsɔna nkɛɛ nkee? Mbɔ akondo chika beni baomu libwa la libwa kaama ka lilɛ jaɔ, la nchwa mona ongo alimeli, nende eba ndako! <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Iya awɛɛnake, akondo wɛɛmba waapheka, akondo yala ataisɛkɛya. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Aiyake kande, akondoelela biseka bende la ba mamani lande la mbwasimela nte: ‹Isɛkɛya nyo kaama kamɔɔ lami! Aliko mbooba bongo bɔkɔkɔ bami balimeli›. <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Sɔlɔ mbokosimela nyo nte, ko ŋango Kanamombe oyalaka la libɛla ike, eleko boso njambi ɔmɔɔ asokolake njambi yande. Lingo libɛla jande liyalaka linɛnɛ ndeka banto baomu libwa la libwa banɛ bale phaaone lonkinɛ mimeya».<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lofalanga la Kichɛlɛ la limeli la mɛnamwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Yesu amemeisa nɔnda nte: «Oka nyo lonkinɛ: Onde, iya wainto ɔmɔɔ ole la falanga ya kichɛlɛ joomu, lofalanga lɔmɔɔ lolimelake, akɛɛ ŋaande? Mbɔ aɔsɔna ntoola litala, la mɔmba lulu, la mona ike nende elobaa ndako! <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Iya alobaake, akondoelela biseka bende la bamamani lande la nɔnda nte: ‹Isɛkɛya nyo kaama kamɔɔ lami, aliko mbooba lofalanga lami lalimeli›. <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Mbokosimela nyo nte, ko ŋango biphongo* be Kanamombe* baisɛkɛyaka eleko bonto ɔmɔɔ otoo a njambi a sanjiake njambi yande».<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bomponjo alimeli la mɛnamwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu ɔlɔndi lonkinɛ nte: Kaiki bonto ɔmɔɔ aiki la bana bande baphee baampame. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Ongo ampɔu asimeli isɛnde nte: Phapha, ompaa yami eteni ya ntikɔ weesanga bɛɛ. Isɛnde aaphakeli bako lalikuli baphee besanga bende.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Ɔkɔngɔ la biina inchɛ, ongo ampɔu asɔmbisa engo ntikɔ ende lalikuli, la achwe la falanga yande o wooni ba bɔɔ. Aiye ndako engo, asili besanga bende e mboka mbe. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Asili ndako nfuta besanga bende lalikuli, botala bɔnɛnɛ bapaseli woongo wooni. Aiye nende o mpeka lilɛ ja ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Wiingo, achwe nkambela bonto ɔmɔɔ a wongo wooni. Ongo onto aɔtɔmi wiibeli nte akombelele nsombo yande. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Ongo bomponjo wiiki atalange ale koonga o lilɛ jaiki nsombo yatale, kinaki kotaika bonto abɔɔyaki.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Wiingo, aanjisa mbwi lɔndɛla o lisolo jande nte: Ndaka! Bakambi ba Isɛmi lalikuli bandakanya la lilɛ, kinaki lemi latabu ɛnɛ la botala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Lakondo utola ele isɛmi la lakondoosimela nte: «Phapha, mbɔkɛɛ njambi otamboka ba Kanamombe la otamboka baɛɛ ŋango akɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Phalasane mbelelama lonkinɛ bɔna abɛ. Onkee anɛ wɛɛntɛ ɔmɔɔ a bakambi baɛ!<verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />«Laango, ongo bomponjo aanjisa lɔkɛndɔ la mbutola ele isɛnde. Aiki ndako oloko bɔɔ ichɛɛ la lulu, isɛnde awɛɛni la mbowɛɛnɛla ŋandi ike. Achwe loango nchwa mbɔwɛɛbɛya la mbɔ wɔɔmba bakango.<figure style="fig" alt="Le fils prodigue est accuei par son père" file="WA03876b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="15.20">Bomponjo a limeli ɔmbɔɛbɛyama la Isɛnde</figure> <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Ongo bomponjo ande aosimeli nte: ‹Phapha, mbɔkɛɛ njambi otamboka ba Kanamombe, la otamboka baɛ ŋango akɔ. Wiingo, phalasane mbelelama lonkinɛ bɔna abɛ›. <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Kinaki isɛnde asimeli bakambi bande nte: ‹Loango! Ela nyo bisenda bilɔti ɔɔlɔchɛ nyo beko. Lɔcha nyo ndako lonkinɛ lɔpɛtɛ o lophita, la tomposo weekolo. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Elanyo la chinja nyo bɔnkɛta ba ŋɔmbɛ ɛntama; tole o libɛla la tuisɛkɛya! <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Aliko ɔnɛ bɔna ami, wiiki nde pa mbwa, kinaki ombotondwa. Wiiki nde ombosila nimela, kinaki anɛ ɔmwɛnamwa lonkinɛ.› Baanjisa libɛla.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />«Weengo eleko ongo booloande la ongo bomponjo aiki nde oloko weebeli. Autoli ndako, mbiya sukɛlɛ la bopaselo ba lulu, aoki bɛkɛlwa la ŋɔma. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Aeleli ɔmɔɔ a bakambi, awuumboli nte: ‹Kole nkee engo wɔɔsɛngɛ›? <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Ongo bokambi awuuchisa nte: ‹Waankunɛ abɛ kombuutola, la Isɛbɛ ombo ochinjela bɔnkɛta ba ŋɔmbɛ entama, aliko bɔna ande ombwiya ole e luiko›.<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />«Ongo bɔna a weembe, kako nkango aoli la nkɛlɛ, nende ekili ndako mingela e lulu. Isɛnde apasi aanja la mbooseya aingele. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Kinaki ndako awuuchisa Isɛnde nte: ‹Oka! Bilongi ike binɛ bimbo kokambela lemi, ntakilaka nkɛɛ lalikuli bilɔndaka wɛɛ. Kinaki, koonga ŋaanɛ otampaaka koonga yana ya mboli nte n'ndɛ libɛla la biseka bemi. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Kinaki, ŋaanɛ bɔna abɛ asili besanga bɛbɛ lalikuli weesao bebe ombwiiya, ombo ochinjela bɔnkɛta ba ŋɔmbɛ entama!›<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />«Isɛnde lande awuuchisa nte: ‹Haa bɔna ami! Wɛɛ koyalaka lami biina lalikuli anɛ, la lalikuli bile lemi la beko bilende ɛbɛ too. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Mbɔ kosani tole libɛla la twisɛkɛyɛ! Aliko ɔnɛ waankunɛ abɛ wiikinde pa mbwa, kinaki ombotondwa. Wiiki nde ombolimela, kinaki ɔmwɛnamwa›».<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba bochungi boso limanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu aokeli baeki* bande bɔnɛ bomanu nte: Kaiki boso nombo ɔmɔɔ aiki la bochungi a besanga bende. Banto basitaki ongo bochungi ele Bɔkɔta ande nte olende atakambya basenga bende bobe. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Ongo boso nombo aweeleli, aosimeli nte: Banto batalɔndɛ nke aliko labɛ? Ŋaanɛ onkeele isabu ya besanga bɛmi, aliko phata byemalela lonkinɛ.<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />«Ongo bochungi aiyumboli nte: ‹Bɔkɔta ataone limbita o bolemo, nkɛɛ ŋaande? Ncha phalataɔsɔna, la nɔmba nɔmba ŋango akɔ kakondo mbela nsɔni. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ole, laeya bɛkɛɛ lemi, aliko eleko embita bako wɔɔnɛ bolemo, banto bayale batambɛbɛya o mbulu yabɔ.› <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Ango, aelelaki baso ningo ya Bɔkɔta ami, ɔmɔɔ ɔmɔɔ. Aumboli ongo otango nte: ‹Ole la ningo ŋaande ya Bɔkɔta ami›? <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Ndako abuuchisa nte: ‹Nende la ningo ya ŋongolo miya ɛmɔɔ ya bauta›. Ongo bochungi aosimeli nte: ‹Yala anɛ loango, ɔsa kalatasi la oandike ŋongolo baomu batano›. <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Pa aumboli onkinɛ nte: ‹Labɛ ole la ningo e ŋaande›? Ndako abuuchisa: ‹N'nende la ningo ya mefuko miya ɛmɔɔ ya buunga ba ngano›. Ongo bochungi aosimeli nte: ‹Ɔsa kalatasi, andeka baomu ɛnaanɛi›». <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />«Laango, ongo boso besanga akangi ongo bochungi abaanya aliko la limanya jande. Aliko banto ba ɔnɛ wooni bakɛɛka besao bɛɔ asamba bako la limanya ndeka banto ba ekowa».<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Landako Yesu aasimeli nte: «Lami mbokosimela nyo yala nyo ataikeela biseka la besanga be lolimbo be bɔnɛ wooni! Aliko weeleko pheketayale lonkinɛ, Kanamombe akondo baɛbɛya e loola. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Bonto atakicheyama lokani wiikambwa ichɛ, ko ambookicheya lokani ŋango akɔ wiikambwa binɛnɛ. La ole la baanya wiikambwa inchɛ, mbɔ olende too baanya wiikambwa binɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Anɛ, iya nyo apha nyo banto ba n'kicheyama lokani o nchunga besanga be lolimbo ba bɔnɛ wooni, nani aɔsɔna nkokiicheya nyo lokani o nchungabesanga be sɔlɔ? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />La iya nyo phaɔsɔni nyo mɛnamwa baimisi o besanga beankinɛ, nani aɔsɔna nkɔya nyo besanga bele bepha benyo?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />«Koo bokambi aɔsɔna nkambela Bɛkɔta bephee. Aliko kasana anine ɔmɔɔ la nanga onkinɛ. Aɔ akondo yala wiimisi ele ɔmɔɔ la mbekola onkinɛ. Phaɔsɔna nyo nkambela Kanamombe la nkambela besanga mala ɛmɔɔ».<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo ucheya Bafalisayo*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mlk 10.11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Eleko eoki Bafalisayo* ingo lalikuli, baanjisa mbɔla Yesu, aliko baiki batalange bakuti. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Ango Yesu aasimeli nte: «Nyo olangaka mbwikɛɛ bɔlɔti waanto. Kinaki Kanamombe weeyaka bingo bile waasolo banyo. Aliko bikambwa binɛ biɛnaka banto njala bilɔti ike, Kanamombe wiininaka ike. <verse eid="LUK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Isaliya* ya Musa la Lɔɔsi la baɛni*, ko binɛ biiki banto batalingita mbiya nende o biina be Yɔani oso mbatisa. Mima bengo biina, ko Besako Belɔti beekeleka be Kanamombe* bele betaekyama too. La kila onto atakee nkulu yande lalikuli nte aingeli weengo ekeleka. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Kinaki koonga ŋaanɛ, loola la wooni bekondoeta koo tosoya. Kinaki, Isaliya* ya Kanamombe* phayatapashema koonga isili imɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />«Bonto lalikuli ɔnɛ aita waajande la nsɔnga onkinɛ, aeye nte ombokɛɛ litola. La bonto lalikuli a sɔnga wainto ɔnɛ aitami la bome ande, la ndako ombokɛɛ litola».<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba boso nombo la Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Yesu aoki lonkinɛ bɔnɛ bomanu nte: «Kaiki la bonto ɔmɔɔ boso nombo. Ɔnɛ boso nombo aiki atalɔtɛ bisenda bilɔti ike lonkinɛ be lisɔmbi joolo. Lonkinɛ aiki atakee libɛla kila luina. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Otamboka ba lulu la ongo boso nombo, kaiki katayale boola ɔmɔɔ aelelamaki Lasalo. Ongo Lasalo aiki omboola la mpota bionge lalikuli. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Aiki ataone ndɛ tompusi takwaaki mima ɛ mɛsa ɛ ongo boso nombo. La mbwa ŋango akɔ yaiki ya taande nɔmɔta mpota yande!<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />«Luina lɔmɔɔ, Lasalo abwe, biphongo baɔtɔli sukɛlɛ la Ibulaimu. Pa bingo, boso nombo landako abwe, la baokunja. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Engo waabwe atumbyami ike wiiya. Aulisa baiso, aɛni Ibulaimu bɔɔ; la aɛni Lasalo ole sukɛlɛ lande. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Ongo boso nombo alɔndi nte: ‹Haa phapha Ibulaimu, ɔmɛnɛlɛ ŋandi! Otome Lasalo aile nsɔli e lophita lande wiiloko, ankwɛɛya limpɔmpɔ limɔɔ ja iloko aɔja lolemu lami, aliko mɔɛna tosoya ike wiinɛ iya›.<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />«Kinaki, Ibulaimu abuuchisa nte: ‹Bɔna ami! Kanya wiiki la libɛla ike o luiko labɛ. Kinaki Lasalo abae twakola. Anɛ lɛlɔ olende asamba libɛla, labɛ atatumbyama. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Lonkinɛ, asamba iso lanyo kolende liphuku linɛnɛ ike. Wiingo, bango bale ɛnɛ ele iso, phaaɔsɔna nchwa engo ele nyo. Lonkinɛ bango bale engo ele nyo phaɔsɔna manda ɛnɛ ele iso.› <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Ongo boso nombo alɔndi nte: ‹Phapha, mbɔkɔlɔmba ootome achu e bolunga baso, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />aliko nende la baotwa lami batano, achu mbwalaka lilako nte bataandake ntumbyama ɛnɛ ele tosoya.› <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Kinaki Ibulaimu aosimeli nte: ‹Baotwa labɛ balende la Lɔɔsi la Musa la Baɛni*. Bayale batabaoke bolengo batalɔndama kako›! <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Kinaki ongo boso nombo alɔndi nte: ‹Kapha ŋango phapha Ibulaimu bingo pheekoke. Ila iya bonto atondwake mima waabwe la mbwaachweela, baɔsɔna mimeya›. <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Kinaki Ibulaimu ɔlɔndi nte: ‹Iya bango baotwa labɛ phaɔsɔni mboka ŋango Lɔɔsi la Musa la labaɛni* latalɔndɛ, phaɔsɔna mboka koongo bonto otondwa mima waabwe›».<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu omboekya aliko la nkɛɛ njambi la nsokola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18.6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">18.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mlk 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Pa, Yesu aasimeli baeki bande nte: «Besao be mbila banto o njambi bekondo memeyaka too. Kinaki, ŋandi ele ongo aela beko waanto. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Kotoyala bɔlɔti ele ongo onto alɛmame libwɛ linɛnɛ o nkingo la aokame e wango, kuliko ndako nkɔɛya ɔmɔɔ asamba banɛ basali o njambi».<verse eid="LUK 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />«Ayeka nyo! Iya aotwa labɛ akɔkɛɛlake bobe, laka ndako lilako. La aimeyake, oosokolele. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />La iya akɔkɛɛlake obe mala esambaele o wiina ɔmɔɔ, la aandake kaɛɛ nɔmba oosokolele mala esambaele, sokolela ndako».<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu omboekya banto aliko la Lokani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Pa ango Bakɛndi* baosimeli Bɔkɔta nte: «Haa Bɔkɔta, otokokeya lokani». <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Ndako ŋango akɔ nte: «Iya lokani lanyo lotoyala inchɛ wɛɛnte yuuma ya aladali, ɔtɔɔsɔna nsimela bɔnɛ bote nte wiiphikole la ochu mbwiyoka e wango, la bako botokooka nyo».<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bolemo ba bokambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Yesu ɔlɔndi lonkinɛ nte: «Bonto ɔmɔɔ asamba nyo aɔsɔna njala la bokambi ande ataochaela ebeli aɔ mbookombelela bokonja bande. Onɛ bokambi autolake weebeli, onde, Bɔkɔta ande aɔsɔna mboosimela nte ayale la, manja ndɛ? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Jɛ! Aɔsɔna mboosimela nte: ‹Onambele obi lilɛ, pa weengole esenda aliko ompakolele lilɛ. Ɔkɔngɔ labɛ akondɔlɛ la nywa›. <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Onde, atakanya nyo nte Bɔkɔta aongo bokambi aɔsɔna mboosakoya aliko ombo kokya lalikuli biosimeli wɛɛ? Jɛ! <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Lanyo ŋango akɔ too. Eleko ɛkɛɛnyo ele Kanamombe* ombokolaka nyo nkɛɛ, yala nyo atalɔndɛ nte: ‹Iso tolende bakambi bale koo faida too. Tombo kɛɛ bolemo bɔnɛ basana iso nkɛɛ›».<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya baso nsuli joomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu aiki ndako ɛ lɔkɛndɔ nchwa ɛ Yɛlusalɛma, aeteli weelelo be wooni ba Samaliya la ba Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Aingeli ndako ɔɔsɛngɛ bɔmɔɔ, baso nsuli joomu baandi nsaŋani lande. Baemali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ningitana la bolengo ba Isaliya ya Musa* iyalaka yatalɔndɛ, bonto ole la nsuli phatosana nsukama sukɛlɛ laanto bankinɛ. Ɔsɔmɛ Walawi 13. 46.</char></note> bɔɔ lande, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />la manja mbokoma nte: «Haa Weekisi, Yesu, ɔtɔɛnɛlɛ ŋandi»!<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Eleko ɛbaɛni Yesu aasimeli nte: «Chwaka nyo lokoiyɛnya nyo ele Baeta atei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Walawi 2. 3.</char></note>*». Aiki bako batachu engo baiki baloko e mboka, baiki.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Ango ɔmɔɔ asamba bako aɛni nte ombwika, autoli ɔkɔngɔ atakucha Kanamombe* la jooi linɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Aiyoki anyɔi otamboka la bekolo be Yesu, la elongi ende eiye nende ɛ lɔmɔtu, aosakoisa. Ongo onto aiki nde Musamaliya*. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Ango Yesu alɔndi nte: «Onde, mbɔ baso nsuli joomu ko baikisami! Bango bankinɛ libwa bale ende? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Koo mɛnamwa onkinɛ asamba bako autoli nkucha Kanamombe*, ila too ɔnɛ ole ataika Muyuda»? <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Pa aɔsimeli ɔnɛ Musamaliya nte: «Emala, wiichwele la bii. Lokani labɛ lombo kuikya».<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manda ya ekeleka e Kanamombe*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">24.37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Pa Bafalisayo* baumboli Yesu nte: «Ekeleka e Kanamombe* keanda eleko nke»? Yesu abauchisa nte: «Ekeleka e Kanamombe* pheketaande wɛɛnte ekambwa etaenamwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Banto phaalɔndaki nte: ‹Ena nyo n'kɛɛnɛ ele anɛ›! Aɔ ‹Nkengo ele ango›! Oka nyo! Engo ekeleka kelende tayali asamba nyo».<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Pa, Yesu asimeli baeki* bande nte: «Wiina laanda eleko elanga nyo mɛna lemi Bɔna a Onto koonga luina lɔmɔɔ, kinaki phɔmɛnaki nyo. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />La banto bakondo kosimela nyo nte: ‹Lenda, olende ango›! Aɔ ‹Lenda, olende anɛ!› Kinaki nyo kokɛkɛlake nyo nchwa engo. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Aliko luina lemi Bɔna a Onto mbutolaki, mɛnamwaki wɛɛnte ibalibali yɛɛnamwaka e loola omɛnya wooni lalikuli. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Kinaki otamboka ba ingo lalikuli, kasana m'mɛni toakola ike, la nkilama la banto ba biina ba lɛlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Bolengo baiki kako o biina bɛ Nɔwa, ŋango nde bayala kako e utolaki lemi Bɔna a Onto. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Aliko bingo biina, banto ba memeisa ndɛ la nywa, nsɔnga la nsɔngwa, nende eleko engo Nɔwa aingeli e Safina. Pa mpela keandi nsila banto lalikuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Otango 6. 5-22; 7. 1-23.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Kakondo yala ŋango akɔ wɛɛnte baiki kako weeleko ɛ Lɔti. Banto ba memeisa ndɛ la nywa, nsomba la nsombya, mona biuma la mpika mbulu. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Kinaki luina longo lapasi Lɔti ɛ Sɔdɔmɔ, Kanamombe akwɛisa iya wɛɛnte mbula yaabwɛ mima e loola. Ingo iya ya sili banto lalikuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔ sɔmɛ Otango 18. 20-33; 19. 1-25.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Ŋango nde bayala kako luina longo lemi Bɔna a Onto mbutolaki.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />«Luina longo, ongo ayala eliko e lulu atakitelake lonkinɛ mbɔsa bikambwa bende otema. Lonkinɛ ŋango akɔ, ongo ayala weebeli ende atautolake lonkinɛ ɔɔsɛngɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Kanya nyo beobae waaja a Lɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Otango 19. 26.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Bonto lalikuli alanga nkakola luiko lande, akondo lolimeya. Kinaki bonto lalikuli alolimeya, akondo luikyaka. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Mbokosimela nyo: Luina longo, banto ba phee bakondo yala batalale kaama kamɔɔ, ɔmɔɔ akondo ɔsamaka la ɔnkinɛ akondo chikalaka». <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Bainto baphee bakondo yalaka bataphome kaama kamɔɔ; ɔmɔɔ akondo ɔsamaka la ɔnkinɛ akondo chikalaka. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />[Bampame baphee bakondo yalaka weebeli kaama kamɔɔ, ɔmɔɔ akondo ɔsamaka la ɔnkinɛ akondo chikalaka].<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Ango baeki* bande bawuumboli nte: «Bɔkɔta, besao bɛnɛ bekɛɛmaki ende»? Abauchisa nte: «Ale bojo ka kasaŋanaka Bieke».<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba waamoli la Bobwele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Lonkinɛ Yesu abaokeli baeki* bande bɔnɛ bomanu aliko abaɛnya nte kasana njala batalɔmbɛ Kanamombe kapha la mena. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Ango, alɔndi nte: «Ɔɔsɛngɛ ɔmɔɔ kaiki la waamoli ɔmɔɔ. Ɔnɛ waamoli ataika atakucha Kanamombe. Lonkinɛ aiki ataelolelela kila onto. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Woongo ɔsɛngɛ, kaiki lonkinɛ bobwele ɔmɔɔ. Ɔnɛ obwele aiki atachwela ongo waamoli kila wiina, la mboosimela nte: ‹Omamolele bɔlɔti bosao bami, bɔnɛ boyalaka lemi la bitamba bemi›.<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />«Kinaki, biina ike bieti la ongo waamoli koo nanga mbowaamolela. E kantunda, wiilɔndɛli nte: ‹Sɔlɔ lemi phalakucha Kanamombe la phalalawaka onto lalikuli. <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />Kinaki mɛna ŋango bomo maŋangya ɔnɛ bobwele, lakondo waamolela besao bende bɔlɔti. Aliko iya phankɛɛ ŋango, akando memeya limaŋangya too›».<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Aliko laingo, Bɔkɔta ɔlɔndi nte: «Oka nyo bɔlɔti ŋango ɔmbɔlɔnda ongo waamoli bobe. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Onde, Kanamombe landako phabaamolelaki bɔlɔti bango basɔni ndako, la bango bawookomelaka bocho la yaani? Onde, akondo lembela mbobaamola? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Mbokosimela nyo nte, akondo baamolelaka loango. Kinaki, eleko lemi Bɔna a Onto mbutolaki, lakondo tana banto ba lokani e wooni»?<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba Bafalisayɔ* la boso ngɛja Kɔdi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Laango Yesu aoki bomanu waango baikanyisaki njala baso sɔlɔ otamboka ba Kanamombe la njala bataelolela bankinɛ. Ango Yesu abaokeli bongo bomanu: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />«Luina lɔmɔɔ banto baphee bachwe e lulu la Kanamombe nɔmba Kanamombe. Ɔmɔɔ aiki Mufalisayɔ*, la onkinɛ aiki bongɛjisi a kɔdi. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Ongo Mufalisayɔ* aemali, la nɔmba Kanamombe o lisolo jande nte: ‹Haa Kanamombe ami, mbokosakoya, aliko lemi phalayalaka wɛɛnte banto bankinɛ. Bako bayalaka nde baiyi lonkinɛ balimbi, lonkinɛ baso loseka. Lonkinɛ mbokosakoya aliko lemi lapha wɛɛnte ɔnɛ bongɛjisi a kɔdi. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Mala iphee ɔmpɔsɔ, nkɛɛka malɔmbi ba nkila ndɛ. Lonkinɛ mpashaka mpato ya bikambwa lalikuli bi baaka lemi›.<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />«Kinaki bongɛjisi a kɔdi ndako aemali bɔɔ, koo mbɔsɔna nende nsakola baiso bande e loola. Kinaki, wiiki too ataphome bakasa e ntolo ende la nkangi, ɔ nɔmba ŋandi nte: ‹Haa Kanamombe ami, ɔmɛnɛlɛ ŋandi lemi boso njambi›»!<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Ango Yesu ɔlɔndi nte: «Mbokosimela nyo nte, ɔnɛ bongɛjisi a kɔdi autoli e lulu la Kanamombe ɔmbɔwɛɛna njala boso sɔlɔ otamboka lande. Kinaki, ongo Mufalisayo* ndako jɛ. Aliko kila ongo oiyuuleyaka akondo kicheyamaka. Kinaki ongo wiikicheyaka ndako, akondo uleyamaka».<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombochwela Bana baakɛnda Bochwako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mlk 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Luina lɔmɔɔ banto bawɛɛlisa Yesu Bana baakɛnda nte abaapheya bakasa. Kinaki Baeki bande aɛni bako bingo, baphangweli bango banto. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Kinaki Yesu abaɔyisa luusa ba weela bango bana. Asimeli lonkinɛ bango baeki* bande nte: «Sanjiya nyo bana baande ele lemi! Koakengake nyo, aliko ekeleka e Kanamombe* kelende ele bango bale wɛɛnte bako. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Mbokosimela nyo nte kila bonto lalikuli ole phaɛbɛisa ekeleka e Kanamombe wɛɛnte bɔna, phataingela koonga inchɛ weengo ekeleka*». <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus accueil les petits enfants" file="WA03880b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="18.17">Yesu ombochweela bochwako bana baakɛnda</figure><verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɔmɔɔmbɔla la Boso nombo ɔmɔɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mlk 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Waiyolo ɔmɔɔ a Bayuda, aumboli Yesu nte: «Weekisi bɔlɔti, nkɛɛ ŋaande nte m'mbaa luiko la tiiti»? <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Ango Yesu awuuchisa nte: «Aliko laanke omombelela wɛɛ bɔlɔti? Koo onto ole bɔlɔti ila Kanamombe nɛmɛlɛ! <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Mbɔ weeyaka bolengo bɔlɔndaka isaliya ya Kanamombe nte: ‹Ko kɛɛkɛ loseka, koyalake atajake, koyalake ataiye, koyalake atasuudiya belimbo. Lonkinɛ yalaka atakucha isɛɛ la nyɛŋɛɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Mpasa 20.12-16; Nkanya 5. 16-20.</char></note>›». <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Ongo onto aosimeli Yesu nte: «Ingo Isaliya* lalikuli landaikɛɛka mima oomponjo bami».<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu aoki bingo, aosimeli nte: «Oloko atapheke ekambwa ɛmɔɔ ɛnkɛɛ: Sombya bikambwa bɛɛ lalikuli bile wɛɛ la beko, la falanga lalikuli ya ba wɛɛ wiingo bikambwa phakela biola. Ɔkɛɛkɛ ŋango labɛ akondo yala la bokombe e loola. Pa aka la oningite».<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Kinaki, ongo onto aoki ndako ŋango, aoki nkangi ike, aliko wiiki boso nombo ike.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu aɛni nte ɔnɛ bonto ombooka nkangi ike, alɔndi nte: «Sɔlɔ kolende nkulu ike ele baso nombo mingela weekeleka e Kanamombe*! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Kolende kɔɔlu ike o Ngamiya mbeta e mpuku ɛ nsingɛ, kuliko boso nombo mingela weekeleka e Kanamombe*».<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Bango banto baoki ŋango, baumboli nte: «Iya ŋango, nani lonkinɛ, akakolamaka»? <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu aasimeli nte: «Ingo ile phayasane waanto, yasana ele Kanamombe».<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Ango Pɛtɛlɛ aosimeli Yesu nte: «Lenda! Iso tombochika bikambwa lalikuli biiki biso la beko la tombo kolingita»!<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu aasimeli nte: «Sɔlɔ mbokosimela nyo, bonto lalikuli achika lulu lande aɔ waajande aɔ aotwa lande aɔ baoti bande aɔ bana bande aliko la ekeleka e kanamombe*, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />akondo ba binkinɛ ike eleko eyala ndako oloko e wooni. La eleko yaanda akondoba luiko la tiiti».<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɔmbɔlɔnda lonkinɛ aliko la mbwa la ntondwa yande</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mlk 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Pa Yesu aɔsi lonkinɛ bakɛndi* bande joomu la baphee, aasimeli nte: «Oka nyo! Iso nkoanɛ tomboulela ɛ Yɛlusalɛma la engo ka kokyama lalikuli eandekami la baɛni* aliko lami Bɔna a Onto. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Aliko lemi lakondo phakema waakasa ba bale bapha Bayuda. Bako bakondo mbɔla, la lintola, la linchweela lɔsɔi, <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />bakondo mphoma bephapho, pa bakondo njaka. La biina isato pa lakondo tondwa».<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Kinaki bakɛndi* koo mbeya maana ba bengo bosao. Aliko biiki bitaisama kaɔ. La koo mbeya aliko laanke Yesu wiiki atalɔndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya bontongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mlk 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Eleko Yesu asukameli bɔsɛngɛ ba Yeliko, atani bontongo ɔmɔɔ aiki atayale mpamba la mboka la nɔmba nɔmba. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Ongo bontongo aoki ndako boloi baanto bataete aumboli nte: «Kole nke»? <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Banto bawuuchisa nte: «Yesu a Nasaleti ndako kataete». <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />La aoki ndako bingo, aokomi la nɔnda nte: «Yesu, Bɔna a Daudi, ɔmɛnɛlɛ ŋandi». <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Bango banto baiki otamboka la Yesu baophangweli la baosimeli akɔwɛ. Kinaki ndako aphaphi mbokoma nte: «Bɔna a Daudi, ɔmɛnɛlɛ ŋandi»!<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Ango Yesu aemali, aasimeli baweela ongo bontongo. Aiye ndako sukɛlɛ la Yesu, Yesu awuumboli nte: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Alanga nko keele nke»? Ndako nte: «Bɔkɔta, mbɔkɔlɔmba m'mɛni lonkinɛ». <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Ango Yesu aosimeli nte: «Ena lonkinɛ! Lokani labɛ lombokokakola»! <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />La kako nkango ongo bontongo aɛni lonkinɛ. Aolingiti Yesu o mboosakoya Kanamombe. Ango aɛni banto lalikuli bingo, la bako ŋango akɔ bakuchisa Kanamombe.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu la Sakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Eleko Yesu aiye ndako ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Yeliko, aiki atalange mbeta. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Woongo ɔsɛngɛ kaiki la bonto ɔmɔɔ aelelamaki Sakayo. Ɔnɛ Sakayo aiki waiyolo baangɛjisi ba kɔdi, lonkinɛ aiki boso nombo. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Aonaki mɛna Yesu iya ole nani. Kinaki aliko wiiki wuumbe, koo mbɔsɔna mbɔwɛɛna aliko la wiike baanto. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Aliko laingo, atangoli loango, auleli eliko ja bote nte aɛni Yesu, aliko ango kasani Yesu mbetela. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Laango Yesu aiye ndako ango kaama, alendi eliko la mboosimela Sakayo nte: «Sakayo, kitela loango, aliko lɛlɔ landalange ndala e lulu labɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sakayo ombuulela eliko nte aɛni Yesu |alt "Zachee est monté sur l'arbre pour qu'il voie Jesus"src = "WA03891b. Tifsize = "span"copy = "Graham Wade'' ref = "19.5''</char></note>».<figure style="fig" alt="Zaché est monté sur l'arbre pour qu' il voie Jésus " file="WA03891b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="19.5">Sakayo ombuulela eliko nte aɛni Yesu</figure><verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Sakayo akiteli loango, la aɛbɛisa Yesu la libɛla linɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Banto banɛ baɛni ŋango, baanjisa baniŋina la nɔndante: «Habaaa! Ombochwa ndala ele bonto oso njambi».<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Kinaki, Sakayo aɛmali otamboka ba Yesu la mboosimela nte: «Hɛɛ Bɔkɔta oka! Lemi lakondo ɔya beola eteni beesanga bemi. La iya langɛjisa bonto besanga ike mbeta, lakondo wuucheya mala inɛi». <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu ɔlɔndi nte: «Lɛlɔ nkakolama imbwiiya ɔ lɔnɛ lulu, o ŋaanɛ ɔnɛ ŋango akɔ olende a jooti ja Ibulaimu». <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Aliko lemi Bɔna a Onto laandi mona la nkakola banɛ balimeli.<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba bakambi basato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Banto baiki baloko bataoke besao be Yesu wiiki ndako atalɔndɛ. Ango asukameli ndako bɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛlusalɛma, banto bakanyaki nte ekeleka e Kanamombe* kemoona mbiya kako nkango weengo eleko. Ango Yesu abaɔyisa bɔnɛ bomanu nte: <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Kaiki la bonto ɔmɔɔ a bolunga ba bɔkɔta. Ɔnɛ onto akee lɔkɛndɔ nchwa o wooni ba bɔɔ nte akichame Bɔkɔta, la pa autole nomba o wooni bande. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Kinaki, otamboka la nchwa, aeleli banto joomu asamba bakambi bande. Aaphakeli lofalanga lɔmɔɔ lɔmɔɔ ja mbolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lufalanga limɔɔ luiki besanga bɛnɛ beɔsɔna nkambelama wiiteni miya ɛmɔɔ, la mbwasimela nte: Kamba nyo bolemo la bɛnɛ besanga la mbo biuleya nende eutola lemi.</char></note> aasimeli: Chulusa nyo layako nende ango autola lemi. <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Kinaki, banto ba wooni bande baiki bata o nine. Wiingo baotomeli banto bachu nɔnda nte phaalange aakonja.<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />«Koonga ŋango, okichisami njala bɔkɔta. La autoli e wooni bande. Aiye ndako, aeleli bango bakambi bande joomu. Aliko olangi aeye kila onto obae bekulukulu ŋaande». <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Bokambi otango aandi, alɔndi nte: «Bɔkɔta, bekulukulu be bae lemi o longo lofalanga kolonde inkinɛ joomu». <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />La ndako Bɔkɔta ande ɔlɔndi nte: «Olende mpame! Wɛɛ olende bokambi bɔlɔti! Aliko wiiki la lokani wiikambwa inchɛ, mbokokicha anɛ waiyolo wɛɛsɛngɛ joomu». <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Bokambi a iphee la ndako aandi, la nɔnda nte: Bɔkɔta, bekulukulu be bae lemi o longo lofalanga lɔmɔɔ la mpiisa wɛɛ, ilende inkinɛ itano. <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />La Bɔkɔta ande aosimeli nte: Lawɛɛ mbokokicha njala bɔkɔta a bɛsɛngɛ be tano.<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Pa bokambi onkinɛ aandi, alɔndi nte: «Haa Bɔkɔta, ɔsa lofalanga labɛ, la luisisa bɔlɔti wiimbala ya esenda. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Lakolawi ike, aliko wɛɛ oyalaka nde mpame a nkulu. Wɛɛ, ɔɔsaka bile bepha bɛɛ, lonkinɛ wuukaka bile wɛɛ koo mona. <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Bɔkɔta ande aosimeli nte: ‹Wɛɛ olende bokambi bobe! Lakondo kotumbya mbetela bingo bile ɛ ntina la lolemu labɛ. Weeyi nte lemi njalaka mpame a nkulu, la mbɔsaka bile bepha bemi, la mbukaka bile lemi koo mona. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Anɛ aliko laanke, koo nkicha besanga bemi o bokombe? Mbɔ ombutola yami, ntondo tana imbokokeyama›! <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Pa ongo Bɔkɔta asimeli bango baiki ango nte: ‹Ɔnɛ bokambi, kumula nyo ndako bengo besanga, ɔya nyo ongo obae bekulukulu mala joomu›. <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />La bako baosimeli nte: ‹Weekisi, mbɔ ongo ombosila njala la falanga joomu›! <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Ndako awuuchisa nte: ‹Mbokosimela nyo nte bonto ole la ekambwa, ko ongo ɔɔyamaka kɛnkinɛ. Kinaki, ongo ole apha la ekambwa, o kumolamaka koonga ingo inchɛ ile ndako la keko›. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Lonkinme ongo Bɔkɔta ɔlɔndi nte: ‹Bitamba bemi, bango baiki koo nangaka nte m'baakonja, obaela nyo anɛ, la oajake nyo anɛ lataɛni›».<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu omwingela e Yɛlusalɛma la bokuchu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Eleko Yesu asili ndako nɔnda bengo besao, amemeisa lɔkɛndɔ lande nchwa ɛ Yɛlusalɛma, ole otamboka la banto. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Aiye ndako sukɛlɛ la bɔsɛngɛ ba Betefage la Beteniya, boleka ba bɔɔkɔ ba Miseituni. Atomi baeki* bande baphee la mbwasimela nte: <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />«Chwaka nyo wɔɔsɛngɛ bole otamboka lanyo. Aiya nyo kako, akondotana nyo bɔnkɛta ba mpunda ɔmbɔlɛmama, lonkinɛ ataɛmbaka bonto lalikuli. Lɛmɔla nyo ndako la ombela nyo ndako anɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />La iya onto akuumbolake nyo aliko laanke ɔmbɔ ɔlɛmɔla nyo, ucheya nyo ndako nte: ‹Bɔkɔta ɔmbɔ ɔlɔmba›».<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Bango baeki batomami, bachwe. Batani ŋango baasimeli Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Aiki bako batalɛmɔla ongo bɔnkɛta ba mpunda, bokolo ande abaumboli nte: «Aliko laanke ɛmbɔlɛmɔla nyo ongo bɔnkɛta ba mpunda»? <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />La bako bawuuchisa nte: «Bɔkɔta kɔmbɔ ɔlɔmba».<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Laango baɔtɔlɛli Yesu ongo bɔnkɛta ba mpunda. Pa baanjisa bisenda bɛɔ aliko lande, pa bawuulisa Yesu aliko lande. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Yesu amemeisa ndako lɔkɛndɔ, banto bachwe bataanja bisenda bɛbɔ e mboka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuda baiki bataanja bisenda bɛɔ eleko eebeisaki bako baiyolo ɔ mbɔwɔɔya bokuchu.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Yesu asukameli ndako bɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛlusalɛma, o likilikili ja bɔɔkɔ ba Miseituni, baeki bande lalikuli baandi la libɛla la manja nkucha Kanamombe la joi linɛnɛ, aliko la bintɔmpɔ lalikuli bɛɛni bako. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Baiki batachu batalɔndɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">«Achwelame bochwako Bɔkɔta ataande e lokombo la Bɔkɔta!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Bii ke yale aliko la loola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">la Kanamombe akuchame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Sabuli 118.26.</char></note>»!<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Laango Bafalisayɔ bamɔɔ, bango baiki woongo boloi baanto basimeli Yesu nte: «Weekisi, simba baeki baɛ»! <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Kinaki Yesu abauchisa nte: «Mbokosimela nyo nte, banɛ bakɔwake, babwɛ ko balɔnda»!<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo lela aliko la bɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛlusalɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Eleko Yesu asukameli ongo bɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛlusalema, aɛni ndako aoleleli. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Alɔndi nte: «Iya otoeya lɛlɔ besao bɛɔsɔna mbela bii! Kinaki bembwisama wɛɛnɛ eleko, phaɔsɔna m'mɛna. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Aliko biina betaande otamboka labɛ bitamba bɛbɛ bekondokɔlɛnga nte bakojakanya. La eleko eyala bako bataphike bakula, o mbwikenga sukɛlɛ labɛ, ango bakondo ko phika beleka lalikuli. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Bakondo ko kelola kelola kaama kamɔɔ la banto baɛ. Phaachikaki libwɛ aliko la linkinɛ, aliko koo mbeya eleko Kanamombe aandi ndako nko kakola».<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwita basombisi o lulu la Kanamombe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mlk 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoa 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Pa, Yesu aingeli e lulu la Kanamombe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulu la Kanamombe: Anɛ iiki nde eteni e lulu la Kanamombe ɛnɛ eiki bako batasombe bikambwa benchwa mpasha mpato ele Kanamombe. Lonkinɛ bale bataika Bayuda bango nde baiki batakucha Kanamombe ango.</char></note>, aiye ndako ongo aanjisa mbita basombisi. Aasimeli nte: <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />«Komoandekama ɔ Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ nte: ‹Lulu lami lakondo yala lulu la malɔmbi›. Kinaki nyo, ombosilaka nyo mbɔlɔkɛɛ njala kaama ka baiyi mbisama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Isaya 56; Yɛlɛmiya 7.11. </char></note>»!<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Yesu aiki ataekya kila luina e lulu la Kanamombe. Kinaki, baiyolo ba Baeta atei*, la Baekisi* ba isaliya kaama kamɔɔ la bekongo be ɔsɛngɛ, baiki bataone bolengo ba mboojakya. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Kinaki koo mbɔsɔna, aliko banto lalikuli baiki batawooke la nsaki ike.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Nkulu ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mlk 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Luina lɔmɔɔ, Yesu aiki e lulu la Kanamombe*. Engo aiki ataekya banto Besako Belɔti. Kako nkango, baiyolo ba Baeta atei* la Baekisi ba Isaliya*, la Bekongo Beayuda bapaseli. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Bawuumboli Yesu nte: «Otosimele atakɛɛ besao bɛnɛ o luusa la nani? La nani akɔyisa nkulu ya mbwiikɛɛ»? <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu abauchisa nte: «Lami lakondo kuumbola nyo bosao bɔmɔɔ. Onsimele nyo: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Nkulu ya Yɔani mbatisa banto, yaimi ele Kanamombe aɔ waanto»?<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Ango bango baanjisa nsimelana nte: «Towuuchiyake nte yaimi nde ele Kanamombe, ndako akondo tuumbola nte: ‹Aliko laanke koo mbowiimeya nyo›? <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Lonkinɛ towuucheyake nte yaimi nde waanto, ango banto lalikuli bale anɛ bakondo tojaka la babwɛ. Aliko bako lalikuli baeya nte Yɔani wiikinde wɛɛni* a Kanamombe». <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Ango, bawuuchisa nte: «Ingo nkulu ya Yaoni, phataeye yaimi ende». <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu landako abauchisa nte: «Koonga lemi phalata kosimela nyo latakɛɛ binɛ o nkulu nke».<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba baoni babe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mlk 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Pa, Yesu abaokeli banto lonkinɛ bomanu bɔnɛ nte: «Bonto ɔmɔɔ achee ebeli ende e misabibu*. Aphaki o baoni bamɔɔ, nte bayale batawɔɔya eteni ɛmɔɔ ɛ lilɛ eleko eyala bako batauke. Pa achwe o wooni ba bɔɔ eleko etale. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Eleko e baukelo e koki, ɔnɛ onto atomi bokambi ande ele bango baoni, nte bawɔya yande eteni o lingo lilɛ ja uki bako. Kinaki, bango baoni baphomi, la mbowiita bakasa phololo. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Ongo boso ebeli atomi lonkinɛ, onkinɛ bokambi. La ndako baophomi, la mbootolatola, la mbowiita bakasa phololo. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Atomi lonkinɛ bokambi a asato. Ongo landako, bawootaisa, la mbowooka anja la ebeli. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Ango ɔmɛlɛ ebeli ayiumboli nte: ‹Lakɛɛ ŋaande anɛ? Lakondo toma anɛ bɔna ami bolangemi, kamɔti ndako bakondo wiimeya›. <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Kinaki eleko ɛ wɛɛni bango baoni, balɔnjani asamba bako nte: ‹Mbɔ ɔnɛ kole mpɛnɛ a ɛnɛ ebeli! Toojake aliko tuichikalele la keko›. <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Pa, bawooki anja la engo ebeli, la baojaki».</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Laango Yesu aumboli bango banto nte: «Anɛ bango baoni, ɔmɛlɛ ebeli akɛɛ la bako ŋaande? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Akondo iya la mbwajaka la mbɔya bankinɛ baoni engo ebeli». Aoki banto bengo besao, balɔndi nte: «Besao wɛɛnte bɛnɛ betatuiyelake koonga inchɛ»!<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Kinaki Yesu aalendi, la mbwasimela nte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">«Lɔnɛ Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ lole la maana nke?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‹Libwɛ linɛ jakilami laaphiki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">jako like libwɛ ja bɔnsɛsɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Sabuli 118.22.</char></note>›!<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Laango bonto lalikuli akwaa aliko la lingo libwɛ, okelwaki bitenibiteni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:18">la ongo akwɛɛla jako jakondo ɔsɔpasɔpa». <verse eid="LUK 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Baekisi ba isaliya* la baiyolo ba Baeta atei* baeyi nte Yesu apasisha bongo bomanu aliko la bakɔ. Ko baonaki bako mbookemela kako nkango, ila too balawaki nde banto. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Bango baiyolo baanjisa mbowoona Yesu. Batomi banto banɛ baikee njala balɔti otamboka ba Kanamombe, aliko bawuumbole besao be mbo waambela lilonga. Bakee ŋango aliko baoni mboophaka waakasa ba baiyolo ba wooni.<verse eid="LUK 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngɛla kodi ele Kaisaliya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mlk 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Bango banto baosimeli nte: «Weekisi, iso taeya nte ɔlɔndaka la mbekya besao be sɔlɔ. Lonkinɛ taeya nte phasɔnaka banto, kinaki weekyaka banto mboka ɛ sɔlɔ e nangya Kanamombe. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Anɛ, otosimele iya Isaliya yaso yataluusiya, ngɛla kɔdi ele kaisaliya* aɔ jɛ»!<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Kinaki, Yesu aeyi lilonga jaɔ, aasimeli nte: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Ɔmɛnya nyo lofalanga lɔmɔɔ». Pa, abaumboli nte: «Ɔlɔnɛ lofalanga, kole iima ɛ nani la lokombo la nani»? Bawuuchisa nte: «Iima la lokombo bilende be Kaisaliya*». <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Laango Yesu aasimeli nte: «Laango yala nyo ataɔya nyo Kaisaliya* bile bende la Kanamombe bile bende». <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Bango banto bapheki bosao ba mbookemelela kakɔ otamboka baanto. Kinaki basebalali ike la mbucheya yande, la bakɔwi.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basandukayo ba muumbola Yesu aliko la ntondwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mlk 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Pa ŋango, Basandukayɔ* bamɔɔ baiyeli Yesu. Bako ko bakilaka nte babwe batondwaki. Baosimeli nte: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />«Weekisi, Musa atoandekeli otema ba isaliya yaso nte, iya bonto abwake ko mbota la nchika obwele ande koo bana, kasana aotwa lande aɔsi ongo bobwele, aliko awootele bana. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Laango, kaiki la baotwa lande esambaele ba likundu limɔɔ. Weembe asɔngi pa abwe koo nchika bɔna. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Ongo a aphee apɛni ongo obwele, kinaki la ndako ŋango akɔ abwe koo mbota la ongo obwele. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Pa ongo a asato la ndako ŋango akɔ. Bako lalikuli esambaele, babwe koontika nende bɔna ɔmɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />E kantunda ongo obwele la ndako abwe. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Anɛ, luina lɔnɛ latondolamaki babwe, ongo obwele akondo yala waaja anani? Aliko bako lalikuli esambaele baɔsɔngi».<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu abauchisa nte: «Wɔɔnɛ wooni bampame basɔngaka la bainto ba sɔngwaka. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Kinaki, bango baɛna Kanamombe nte bako basana ntondolama, nte baingele weekeleka eanda phaasɔngaki aɔ nsɔngwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Phaabwaki lonkinɛ. Bakondo yalaka anɛ wɛɛnte biphongo. Bako ko bana ba Kanamombe, aliko Kanamombe ombo atondola. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Musa aɛnyisa phololo nte babwe batondwaki. Ingo aɔmbɔlaki aliko lande ele Lɔɔsi lande latalɔndɛ aliko boliko bɔnɛ batowaki. Ango ataelela Bɔkɔta nte: ‹Kanamombe ka Ibulaimu, Kanamombe ka Isaka, la Kanamombe ka Yakɔbɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Mpasa 3.2-6.</char></note>›». <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Yesu ɔlɔndi lonkinɛ nte: «Kanamombe oyalaka nde Kanamombe ka baso luiko, kinaki phayalaka Kanamombe kaabwe. Aliko bako lalikuli balende o luiko kande».<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Baekisi ba Isaliya* balɔndi nte: «Weekisi, ɔmbɔ lɔnda bɔlɔti»! <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Laango, koo nkekela mbowuumbula lonkinɛ besao bɛnkinɛ.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito la Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mlk 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu abaumboli banto nte: Aliko laanke ɛtalɔndɛ banto nte Kilisito olende bɔna a Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Daudi nɛmɛlɛ atalɔndɛ o libuku ja Sabuli nte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">Bɔkɔta Kanamombe osimeli Bɔkɔta ami nte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">«Yala e loome lami,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />nende ekicha lemi bitamba bɛbɛ entina ya baina babɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Sabuli 110.1.</char></note>».<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />«Anɛ, iya Daudi aeleli Kilisito* nte olende Bɔkɔta ande, namuna nke ɔnɛ Kilisito* aɔsɔna njala lonkinɛ bɔna a Daudi»?<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombolaka banto lilako nte bayeke la Baekisi ba Isaliya*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Eleko iiki banto lalikuli batalange Yesu, aasimeli baeki bande: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Ayeka nyo la Baekisi ba isaliya. Aliko, bako balangaka nkenda bambɔlɔta bisenda bitalebitale. Lonkinɛ balangaka mbɛbɛyama la okuchu kaama kaanto ike. Lonkinɛ balangaka njala wiijee be otamboka Waasaŋanelo, la kaama ka libɛla. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Baɔsaka o baanya bikambwa lalikuli bile la bebwele. Lonkinɛ balɔmbaka Kanamombe eleko etale, nte baenamwe balɔti otamboka baanto. Wiingo, bako batumbyamaki ike ndeka bankinɛ».<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Mpato e Obwele Boola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mlk 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Aiki Yesu e lulu la Kanamombe alɛngisa baiso waanto lalikuli, aɛni bolengo bapashaki baso nombo mpato* weephaka. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Aɛni lonkinɛ wainto bobwele boola atapasha tofalanga tophee weengo ephaka. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Ango Yesu alɔndi nte: «Mbokosimela nyo sɔlɔ, ɔnɛ wainto bobwele boola ndako kombopasha mpato* ike ndeka banto lalikuli. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Aliko, bankinɛ lalikuli bambopasha mpato ele koofaida kaɔ. Kinaki, ɔnɛ wainto boola, ndako ombopasha lalikuli biiki ndako la beko o mbika».<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɔmbɔlɔnda aliko la nphutama ya lulu ya Kanamombe la Yɛlusalɛma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mlk 13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Banto bamɔɔ baiki bata ɔmbɔla aliko la lulu la Kanamombe la Yelusalema. Baiki batalɔndɛ nte lombophikama bɔlɔti la babwɛ balɔti, la bikambwa binkinɛ bɛ nangya bɛnɛ bapashaki banto mpato ele Kanamombe. Kinaki Yeu ɔlɔndi nte: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Binɛ lalikuli bitaɛni nyo, kakondo yala luina lɔnɛ koonga libwɛ limɔɔ phajachikalaki aliko la linkinɛ, ekambwa lalikuli kekondo phanjolama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulu la Kanamombe la Yɛlusalɛma |alt = ''Le Temple de Jerusalem'' src'' LB00250B. Tif'' size''span'' = copy = Horace Knowles'' ref = ''21.6'' </char></note>».<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Besao beanda luina la kantunda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mlk 13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Laango bango banto bawuumboli Yesu nte: «Weekisi, besao bɛnɛ betapasela eleko nke? La imbali nke ya ɛnya nte beona mpasela»?<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu abauchisa: «Ayeka nyo, ko limbamake nyo! Aliko banto ike bakonoanda o lokombo lami. Bakondo yala batalɔndɛ nte bako ko Kilisito*. La n'nɔnda nte eleko kembo sukama. Kinaki koalingitake nyo! <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Eleko eyala nyo banto batalɔndɛ aliko la lisɛ la aliko la bolupho, kolawake nyo. Aliko kasana bingo lalikuli biiye obi. Kinaki eleko engo kantunda kakondo yala kataiye jɛ».<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Pa Yesu aasimeli nte: «Banto bakondo jakana la banto bankinɛ. La Bɔkɔta akondo jakana la Bɔkɔta bonkinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Lɔsɔkɔ lɔnɛnɛ lakondo yala e wooni lalikuli. Kakondo yala botala la eeta o kaama ike. La e loola kakondo pasela imbali ya nsebalala la nsisa banto.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />«Kinaki otamboka la bingo lalikuli mpasela, bakondo akemela la mbwatumbya. Bakondo atɔla nsamba o Basaŋanelo, la mbobaoka ɔ munyɔlɔlɔ. Lonkinɛ bakondo atɔla otamboka ba bɛkɔta la baiyolo ba beoni aliko la lokombo lami. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />O longo lokombo, ko layala nyo atalɔndɛ binɛ bitaeye nyo aliko lami. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Anɛ, esana nyo mbeya nkɛɛnɛ: Koyalake nyo ataitumbya otamboka ba eleko nte asamba nyo nke. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Aliko lemi Lɛɛmɛlɛ ka kɔɔya nyo besao be limanya bɛnɛ beyala nyo atalɔndɛ, nende eleko eyala bitamba benyo phɛɔsɔna n' kojakanya nyo aɔ mbucha. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Koonga baoti banyo, la belunga benyo, la biseka benyo, la bako bakondo kopasha nyo otamboka la baiyolo. La bamɔɔ banyo bakondo amolela ntumbyama ya mbwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Banto lalikuli bakondo konina nyo aliko lami. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Kinaki, koonga ŋaanɛ, koo nende libo limɔɔ ja bɛtɛ benyo bɛɔsɔna nimela. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Yalaka nyo la lokani, aliko weengo mboka kɛ ɔsɔna nyo n'kakola luiko lanyo».<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɔmbɔlɔnda besako be mpanjolama ya Yɛlusalɛma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mlk 13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Yesu alɔndi lonkinɛ nte: «Eleko ɛɛna nyo bɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛlusalɛma bombɔlɛŋama la Bakɔlɔbɔi, ango aeya nyo nte eleko kembwiya ɛnɛ bɔsɛngɛ bɔnɛ bakondo phanjolama. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Laango, bango bayala e Yudeya balawa ɛ bɛɔkɔ. La bayala ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛlusalɛma bapase otema, la bayala wiileme batautolake lonkinɛ ɔɔsɛngɛ.<verse eid="LUK 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />«Aliko, bengo biina bekondo yala biina bɛnɛ be tumbya Kanamombe banto, aliko lalikuli beandekami ɔ Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ bikokyame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Hosɛya 9.7.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Longo luina lakondo yala ŋandi o bainto bayala laakundu, la banɛ bayala batalɔmya! Aliko o wooni kakondo yala tosoya ike, la Kanamombe akondoɛnya n'kangi yande waanɛ banto. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Banto bamɔɔ bakondo jakema la bempanga, la bankinɛ bakondo tɔlama o beoni bɛnkinɛ lalikuli. La bɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛslusalɛma bakondo nyɛkama la banto bankinɛ, mbiya eleko e bako mpasa».<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɔna a Onto akonoanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mlk 13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Yesu amemeisa nɔnda nte: «Imbali yakondoɛnamwa e yaani, la ŋɔndɔ, la tɔɔtɔ. La ɔnɛ o wooni banto bakondo yala o libweelo la bakondo kemelama la wɔɔma, aliko la lɔphɛphɔ la bolupho ba ɛtɛmbɔ e wango. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Banto bakondoyala batatene nkai aliko la wɔɔma, o n'konga besao bɛnɛ beiya e wooni. Aliko lalikuli bile la nkulu e wooni bekondo tɛkyama. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Pa, bakondoɛna ŋango baanda lemi Bɔna a Onto asamba loonge la nkulu la bokuchu bɔnɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Eleko eanja bengo besao mɛnamwa, emala nyo la minola bɛtɛ. Aliko eleko e n'kakolama yanyo kembwiya».<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekeleka e Kanamombe kembo sukama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mlk 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Ɔɔkɔngɔ laango, Yesu aokeli banto bɔnɛ bomanu nte: Lenda nyo bɔnɛ bote ba mutini la bete bɛnkinɛ lalikuli. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Eleko ɛɛnaka nyo ntiti yataanja ntɔngɔla, weeyaka nyo nte eleko e mbula kembo sukama. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Ŋango akɔ, wɛɛnake nyo besao bɛnɛ bemwanja mbiya, eya nyo nte ekeleka e Kanamombe* kembosukama. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Sɔlɔ, mbokosimela nyo nte, bengo besao bekondo koka la banto lalikuli bɛ bɛnɛ biina batabu jɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Loola la wooni bekondo eta, kinaki besao bemi pheetaete koonga inchɛ.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkonga mbutola ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Yesu alɔndi lonkinɛ nte: «Ayeka nyo! Basolo banyo batayalelake too ndɛɛ la nywa, la maŋanga aliko la luiko lanyo. Iya jɛ, longo luina la mbutola ya Kilisito* lakondo kuiyela nyo o mbitwa, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />bolengo bo phambwaka lilonga. Aliko longo luina, lakondoiyela banto lalikuli ba wooni o mbitwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Ayeka nyo, la yala nyo atalɔmbɛ Kanamombe eleko lalikuli. Ɔkeeke nyo ŋaanɛ obaa nyo nkulu ya mpengwa bengo besao lalikuli biiyaki, la memala otamboka lami lemi Bɔna a Onto».<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Eleko engo, Yesu wiiki ataseke e lulu la Kanamombe ataekya banto. Kinaki la ocho wiiki atachu ndala ɔ bɔɔkɔ ba Miseituni. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />La mpendu banto baiki batachu e lulu la Kanamombe aliko bawooke.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Yuungu ya njaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:1-5">Mat 25.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoa 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Wiina ba libɛla ba bitumbula koo bosunga, eelelamaki Pasaka*, iiki kembo sukama. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Bɛkɔta be Baeta atei* la baekisi ba isaliya baonaki mboka e njakya Yesu. Kinaki balawi banto.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda omwimeya mphaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mlk 14.10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Laango, Bosombo aingeleli Yuda aelelamaki Esikaliyɔte. Ongo Yuda aiki ɔmɔɔ a bango bakendi joomu laaphee ba Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Ɔnɛ Yuda achwe, mɔmbɔla la baiyolo ba baeta atei, kaama kamɔɔ la baiyolo ba bachungi ba lulu la Kanamombe*, nte aokane la bako aliko la bolengo baɔsɔna ndako mbwaphakela Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />La bako baisekiisa baokani la ndako la mboolakela nte bakondo wɔɔya bakuti. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuda aimiisa, la aanjisa mona eleko ɛlɔti e ndako mphaka Yesu ele banto phaaeye.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombolambya lilɛ ja Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mlk 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoa 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Laango, luina la bitumbula koo bosunga laiye. Longo luina ko, kasani nchinja bɔnkɛta baɔkɔkɔ ɔ libɛla ja Pasaka*. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Laango Yesu aatomi Pɛtɛlɛ la Yɔani, aasimeli nte: «Chwaka nyo lɔkɔ lɔngɔsɔlɛ lilɛ ja Pasaka*». <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />La bako bawuumboli: «Alanga tolambe lingo lilɛ ende»? <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />La ndako nte: «Oka nyo: Eleko eiya nyo ɔɔsɛngɛ, akondo saŋana nyo la mpame ɔmɔɔ ataɛmbɛ mboka e iloko. Lingita nyo ndako nende otema ba lulu laingela ndako. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />La akondosimela nyo ɔmɛlɛ longo lulu nte: ‹Weekisi omuumbula nte ende ele kiumba ketaleela ndako lilɛ ja Pasaka* kaama kamɔɔ la baeki* bande›. <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />La ndako akondo kɔɛnya nyo kiumba kɛ Gɔlɔfya kɛlɔngɔsɔlami bɔlɔti. Engo ke lamba nyo lilɛ ja Pasaka». <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Laango, bango baeki bachwe, batani bikambwa lalikuli solo ŋango aasimeli Yesu. Balɔngɔsɔli lilɛ ja Pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilɛ ja nkanya Bɔkɔta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mlk 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Bk 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Eleko ekoki kako, Yesu ayali ndɛ lilɛ la bakɛndi* bande. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Aasimeli nte: «Nangi ike ndɛ linɛ lilɛ ja Pasaka kaama kamɔɔ lanyo, otamboka la ntumbyama yami. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Aliko, mbokosimela nyo nte, phandɛɛki lonkinɛ lilɛ ja Pasaka* koonga inchɛ nende luina lolɛɛki lemi lingo ja nkoka weekeleka e Kanamombe*».<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Pa akemeli ephophele ɛ difai, la nsakoya Kanamombe, la nɔnda nte: «Pɔkɛla nyo ɛnɛ ephophele, phaka nyo asamba nyo. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Aliko, mbokosimela nyo, phanywaaki lonkinɛ difai koongo inchɛ, nende ango aiyaki ekeleka e Kanamombe».<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Pa Yesu aɔsi kitumbula, pa nsakoya Kanamombe, akekeloli la mbɔya baeki bande. Alɔndi nte: «Binɛ ko bionge bɛmi bimbophakema aliko la nyo. Yala nyo atakɛɛ ŋaanɛ o linkanya».<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Okee ŋango akɔ oephophele pa ndɛ, Yesu okemeli ephophele la nɔnda nte: «Enɛ ephophele kelende lilaka ja kasende ja Kanamombe mbetela bekila bemi bɛnɛ bembosuwa aliko lanyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />«Kinaki, ɛna nyo! Bonto ɔnɛ amphaka katale lemi lande kaama kamɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Sɔlɔ, lemi Bɔna a Onto lakondo ibweela lami ningitana la ŋango balɔndi Kanamombe. Kinaki ŋandi ele ongo amphaka». <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Laango baeki baanjisa mumbolana nte nani asamba bako aɔsɔna nkɛɛ bongo bosao. <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus mange la nourriture avec ses Apôtres" file="WA03910" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="22.23">Yesu ɔmbɔlɛ lilɛ ja Pasaka kaama kamɔɔ la bakɛndi bande </figure><verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nani ole waiyolo asamba baeki ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Pa asamba baeki ba Yesu kapaseli toamo nte nani ole waiyolo aliko la onkinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu aasimeli nte: Asamba banto bale phaeye Kanamombe baiyolo baɔ baakonjaka nde onkulu. La baso nomba aliko la bako baiyelelaki ''Balɔti''. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Kinaki nyo koyalake nyo atakɛɛ ŋango. Bonto ole waiyolo ndeka onkinɛ, asana njala wɛɛnte ndako kole mpɔu. La ataemalela bankinɛ, asana njala wɛɛnte bokambi abɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Anɛ, nani ole waiyolo ndeka wiina lande asamba banɛ baphee? Ko ongo atayale atale aɔ ongo ataopakolela? Mbɔ ongo atayale atale! Kinaki koonga ŋaanɛ lemi nende asamba nyo wɛɛnte atakokambela nyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Nyo okinyisa nyo njala lami asamba mayalibu bami. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Wiinɛ mbɔkɔya nyo ekeleka wɛɛnte ŋango bompiisa isɛmi. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Wiingo, akondɔlɛ nyo la nywa kaama kamɔɔ lami weekeleka e Kanamombe. Lonkinɛ nyo nde bayala wiijee be ekeleka, o ntumbya bikanga joomu la biphee be Isilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɔmbɔlɔnda nte Pɛtɛlɛ akondo otata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoa 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yesu aosimeli Simo Pɛtɛlɛ nte: «Simo, Simo! Oka! Bosombo ɔmbɔɔyama luusa la mbwaphophola wɛɛnte bophopholaka bako ngano, aliko aakekele. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Kinaki lemi nkɔlɔmbɛli aliko lokani labɛ kami lotalimelake. La eleko e mbutolela wɛɛ, ila baotwa labɛ nkulu ya lisolo».<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Landako Pɛtɛlɛ awuuchisa nte: «Bɔkɔta, lemi nende tayali o nchwa labɛ e munyɔlɔlɔ, koonga mbwa kaama kamɔɔ labɛ».<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu la ndako nte: «Pɛtɛlɛ, mbokosimela nte, lɛlɔ otamboka la nkɔkɔ mbeka, akondo yala ombosila lintata mala isato nte phambeye».<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbwilɔngɔsɔla wiikambwa lalikuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Pa, Yesu abaumboli baeki bande nte: «Eleko ekotomi nyo lemi koo bakuti, aɔ mɔfukɔ aɔ tomposo, kole la ekambwa epheki nyo»? La bako nte: «Jɛ»!<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Ango Yesu aasimeli nte: «Kinaki anɛ, ɔnɛ ole la lofalanga alɔɔsi, ole la mɔfukɔ aɛmbɛ. La ole apha la lokula, asombya esenda ende aliko alosombe. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Aliko mbokosimela nyo, kasana bɛnɛ besao bembiyele, bile njalaka bitaandekama ɔ Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ nte: ‹Aajemi kaama kamɔɔ la bakumoli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Isaya 63.12</char></note>›. Aliko besao be linenda lemi, bilende sukɛlɛ la mbiya e kantunda».<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Baeki bande baosimeli nte: «Bɔkɔta, anɛ tolende la bempanga bephee». La ndako nte: «Bengo besao besilele ango»!<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɔmbɔlɔmba ɛ bɔɔkɔ ba Miseituni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mlk 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu apasi ango kaama, auleli ɛ bɔɔkɔ ba Miseituni wɛɛnte ŋango baiki nsao ende. Baeki bande baolingiti. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Aiye ndako ango kaama, aasimeli baeki bande nte: «Lɔmba nyo, Kanamombe, aliko otakoake nyo asamba mayalibu».<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Pa, aaŋani bɔɔ inchɛ la bako, ootale ba onto mboka libwɛ. Akɔmi balwe aanjisa nɔmba Kanamombe nte: <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />«Phapha, olangake ɛnɛ ephophele e ntumbyama, ɔkɛtɔlɛ bɔɔ lami! Koonga ŋaanɛ, kotayalake wɛɛnte ŋango balanga lami, kinaki belanga wɛɛ ko biyale».<verse eid="LUK 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />[Pa ephongo ɛmɔɔ aimeli e loola aopaseli aliko awɔɔya nkulu. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yesu wiiki o ŋandi ike, amemeisa nɔmba Kanamombe la lonkendo ike. Bianga biiki betaopase biiki bike wɛɛnte bampɔpɔ baekila, biiki betakwa anyɔi].<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Asili ndako nɔmba, aemali la mbutola kaama kachiki ndako baeki* bande. Aatani bambo lala, aliko la ŋandi. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Aasimeli nte: «Aliko laanke embolala nyo? Emwa nyo ɔlɔmbɛ nyo, Kanamombe koandake nyo mingela o mayalibu».<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo kemelama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoa 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesu wiiki oloko atalɔndɛ, kapaseli boloi baanto. Yuda, ɔmɔɔ asamba bakɛndi joomu laaphee ba Yesu kaiki otamboka baɔ. Asukami sukɛlɛ la Yesu nte awɔɔmbɛ bakango. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Kinaki Yesu awuumboli nte: «Yuda! Olimomba bakango komomphaka wɛɛ lemi Bɔna a Kanamombe»?<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Baeki ba Yesu baɛni bingo bioni nkɛɛma, ba wuumboli nte: «Bɔkɔta, taɔsɔna mbwatɛmɔla temɔla la nkula»? <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Ɔmɔɔ abɔ kako nkango ateni bokambi awaiyolo a baeta atei litoi ja loome. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Kinaki Yesu alɔndi nte: «Sanjiya nyo ŋango»! Akooli litoi ja ongo onto, la awiikisa.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Pa Yesu aasimeli baiyolo ba baeta atei, la baiyolo baachungi ba lulu la Kanamombe, la bekongo Beayuda baandi mbookemela nte: «Aliko laanke emombiyela nyo lemi la bempanga, la bephapho wɛɛnte lemi nende wiiyi»? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Mbiki lanyo biina lalikuli e lulu la Kanamombe la koo linkemela nyo. Kinaki, ɛnɛ ko eleko enyo, lonkinɛ ko eleko e nkulu ya wiilima.<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɛtɛlɛ ombo tata Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26.57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mlk 14.53-54</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoa 18.12-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Pa banto baokemeli Yesu. Baɔtɔli e lulu la baiyolo la baeta atei. Pɛtɛlɛ aiki ataolingita ɔbɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Iya yaiki yatatoolama atiya ba kiwanja ke baiyolo ba baeta atei*. Pɛtɛlɛ ayali ataoke iya kaama kamɔɔ la bako. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Wainto ɔmɔɔ aɛni Pɛtɛlɛ atayale sukɛlɛ la iya, aɔnyɛkɛli baiso la nɔnda nte: «Ɔnɛ onto la ndako wiiki kaama kamɔɔ la Yesu». <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Kinaki Pɛtɛlɛ atati la nɔnda nte: «Wɛɛ ɔnɛ wainto! Lemi phala eye ongo onto»!<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Pa eleko inchɛ, bonto onkinɛ aɛni Pɛtɛlɛ, aɔsimeli nte: «Labɛ olende ɔmɔɔ abɔ»! Kinaki Pɛtɛlɛ awuuchisa nte: «Jɛ, lemi lapha ɔmɔɔ abɔ»!<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Pa saa ɛmɔɔ mbeta, bonto onkinɛ aandi membeleya Pɛtɛlɛ nte: «Sɔlɔ ɔnɛ onto wiiki too kaama kamɔɔ la Yesu, aliko la ndako ŋango akɔ olende bonto a Galilaya». <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Kinaki Pɛtɛlɛ awuuchisa nte: «Ee Bɔkɔta, phalaeye ataone nɔnda nke»! Kwiiki Pɛtɛlɛ oloko atalɔndɛ, kako nkango nkɔkɔ keeki. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />La ndako Bɔkɔta atulwe la nenda Pɛtɛlɛ. Ango Pɛtɛlɛ okanyisa bingo beosimeli Bɔkɔta nte: «Lɛlɔ otamboka la nkɔkɔ mbeka, akondo yala ombosila lintata mala isato nte phambeye». <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Ango Pɛtɛlɛ kako nkango apasi ango la manja ndela la nkangi.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo elolelama la mphomama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mlk 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Bango banto baiki batachunge Yesu, bawɛɛlɔlɛli la mboophoma. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />La baoliphi baiso, la bawuumboli: «Nani atakophome? Eya, tɔɛni»! <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Baanjisa mboosimela besao benkinɛ ike be mbootola.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo samba otamboka ba mbalasa Beayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoa 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Aiki kako mpendu, mbalasa Yaayuda la baiyolo ba baeta atei kaama kamɔɔ la baekisi ba Isaliya basaŋani. Baɛlisa Yesu otamboka ba mbalasa* ɛbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Bawuumboli nte: Wɛɛ ko Kilisito? Otosimele! La ndako nte: «Nkosimelake nyo, phaimeya nyo. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />La nkuumbolake nyo bosao, phambucheya nyo. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Kinaki, manja anɛ, lemi Bɔna a Onto mbochwa njala boleka ba loome la Kanamombe ɔmɛlɛ nkulu».<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Aliko la inɛ bako lalikuli bawuumboli nte: «Ko nɔnda wɛɛ ko Bɔna a Kanamombe»? Yesu abauchisa nte: «Nyo amɛlɛ bambo lɔnda sɔlɔ nte lemi ko Bɔna a Kanamombe». <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Pa, bako balɔndi nte: «Phataeye usuula bɔnkinɛ aliko la ɔnɛ onto, aliko tombo iyookela iso amɛlɛ bingo bimbo lɔnda ndako».<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ombosamba ele Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">27.11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoa 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Pa, bako lalikuli, baiki o boloi ba mbalasa e Bayuda* bataemala, la batɔli Yesu otamboka la Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Baanjisa mboositaka la nɔnda nte: «Totani ɔnɛ onto ataangola banto ba ekanga eso nte bataamolana la baiyolo nte batangɛlake kɔdi ele kaisaliya*. Lonkinɛ ole ataiyɛmbɛ nte ndako ko Kilisito* Bɔkɔta».<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilato aumboli Yesu nte: «Wɛɛ kole Bɔkɔta Baayuda»? La ndako nte: «Wɛɛ kɔmbɔlɔnda»! <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Ango Pilato aasimeli baiyolo ba Baeta atei* la boloi baanto nte: «Lemi phalaɛni bomongo bɔmɔɔ yataɛnya nte ɔnɛ onto asambisame».<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Kinaki bango banto ba kekemeisa nɔnda nte: «Besao bɛnɛ betaekya ɔnɛ onto, ataangola banto bɛtɛ nte baamolane la baiyolo ba wooni lalikuli ba Yudeya. Aanjisa Galilaya, ndako nkɔɔnɛ ombo luiyeya nende anɛ».<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɔmbɔtɔlama ele Elɔde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilato aoki ndako bingo, aumboli banto nte: «Onde, ɔnɛ bonto olende boso Galilaya»? <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Bawuuchisa nte: «Sɔlɔ, olende boso Galilaya». Ɛlɔdɛ kuiki atakonja wooni ba Galilaya. Weengo biina wiiki nde ɛ Yɛlusalɛma. Ango ko Pilato aotomeli Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Elɔde aisɛkiisa ike ɔ mɛna Yesu. Mima biina ike aiki atalange mbɔwɛɛna, aliko aiki ataoke banto batalɔndɛ aliko lande. Lonkinɛ olangi mɛna Yesu atakɛɛ bintɔmpɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Aumboli Yesu besao ike, kinaki Yesu koo, mbowuucheya bosao lalikuli. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Ango, waiyolo ba Baeta atei* la baekisi ba isaliya* baiki ango, baiki batalɔndɛ la mpɛɛ ike. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Elɔde la bakɔlɔbɔi bande, bawɔɔli Yesu la mbo weelolela. Baɔlɔchisa esenda ɛlɔti, pa bawuuchisa ele Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Otamboka, Elɔde la Pilato baiki nde bitamba. Kinaki mima longo luina batulwe bake biseka.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato omboluusiya bamto ba jake Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mlk 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yoa 18.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Laango, Pilato asaŋanyisa boiyolo ba Baeta atei la bekongo Beayuda kaama kamɔɔ la banto. <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />Aasimeli nte: «Omombela nyo ɔnɛ onto atalɔndɛ nyo nte ataphengola banto la mamolana la baiyolo. Anɛ, mbowuumbola aliko la bengo besao otamboka lanyo. Kinaki lemi phalaɛni bomongo koonga bɔmɔɔ bɔnɛ basana ndako atumbyame. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Koonga Ɛlɔdɛ landako koo mbooba la bobe lalikuli, aliko laingo ko mbochika ndako ambucheye lande. Ɔnɛ onto koo bomongo nende bɔmɔɔ bɔnɛ basana nte ajakeme. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />O ŋaanɛ lakondo luusiya aphomame bephapho, pa lakondo osanjiya». <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />[Kila libɛla ja Pasaka, Pilato aiki atalɛmɔlɛla banto bɔlɛmami ɔmɔɔ mima ɛ munyɔlɔlɔ].<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Kinaki, banto lalikuli baokomi mala ɛmɔɔ la ndɔnda nte: «Jakya ɔnɛ onto la ɔtɔlɛmɔlɛlɛ Balaba»! <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Ɔnɛ Balaba wiiki ɔ munyɔlɔlɔ aliko okiisa bolupho ɔɔsɛngɛ la mamoyana la baiyolo Baalɔma. Lonkinɛ ajaki onto.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato wiiki o mona nte asanjiya Yesu. Ango aɔmbɔli lonkinɛ banto. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Kinaki bako baphomi lonkinɛ tooloolo la joi linɛnɛ nte: «Ookicha waalemba! Ookicha waalemba»! <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato alɔndi lonkinɛ mala e isato nte: «Ɔmbɔkɛɛ bobe nkee? Lemi phalaɛni bobe lalikuli bɔmbɔ kɛɛ ndako nte ajakeme. Wiingo, lakondo ophomya bephapho, pa lakondo osanjiya».<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Kinaki banto baphaphi mphoma tooloolo nte Yesu atumbyame. Mbokoma yaɔ iiki ike ndeka. La baoyi baɔ baleki. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Laango, Pilato akɛɛli bango banto ŋango balangi bako. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Pa aalɛmɔli ongo Balaba, la ndako ko bonto aamolanaki la Bɛkɔta Bealɔma la njaka onto. Ango Pilato abaɔyisa boloi baanto Yesu baokeele ŋango balangi bako.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo kichama waalemba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Bakɔlɔbɔi baɔtɔli Yesu kaama ka mbootumbya, basaŋani la bonto ɔmɔɔ aelelamaki Simo aimaki weebeli. La ɔnɛ Simo aiki boso Kulɛnɛ. Baokemeli, la mbɔwɛɛmbya balemba ba Yesu o nkulu. Achwe atalingita Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Boloi baanto baolingiti Yesu. Asamba bako kaiki bainto baiki batalelela Yesu la mbwi okaoka ike. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu aatulweli, la mbwasimela nte: «E nyo banyɛŋɛmi ba Yɛlusalɛma! Ko ndelelake nyo lemi, kinaki lela nyo aliko lanyo amɛlɛ la aliko la bana banyo». <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Aliko, biina betaande bɛnɛ banto balɔndaki nte: Alombele bainto bale bikomba, bapheki bana la batalɔmyaka! <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Weengo biina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">banto bakonoanja nsimela bɛɔkɔ nte: Ɔtɔkɔɛlɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">La bekondi nte: <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Ɔsɛya 10.8</char></note>Otokunja nyo! <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Aliko, iya bambo nkeela bɛ ŋaanɛ, lemi ole weete bote baojojo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:31">anɛ bakɛɛ ŋaande nyo bale wɛɛnte bete be moma?<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Kaiki ŋango akɔ baphoka baphee banɛ baɛmami nte ba tumbyame kaama kamɔɔ la Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Baiye kaama kaelelamaki: «Ɛpɔkɔsɔ ɛɔtɛ». Ango ko bakɔlɔbɔi batumbisa Yesu waalemba kaama kamɔɔ la bango banto baphee babe: ɔmɔti boleka ba loome ba Yesu la onkinɛ boleka ba loali. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Pa Yesu alɔndi: «Phapha, waatikele aliko phaaeye bitakɛɛ bako»!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Pa, bango bakɔlɔbɔi baphakani esende e Yesu o nkɛɛ esiko. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Banto baiki bataemala ango batalende. La Bɛkɔta Beayuda baweeloleli la balɔndi nte: «Akakoli bankinɛ: Anɛ aikakole nɛmɛlɛ, iya ndako kole Kilisito*, bosɔnami a Kanamombe»! <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Bakɔlɔbɔi la bako baanjisa mbooweelolela Yesu ŋango akɔ. Baochweli aliko baɔnywɛshɛ difai ja lokange. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />La baosimeli nte: «Iya sɔlɔ wɛɛ ko Bɔkɔta Baayuda, wiikakole wɛɛmɛlɛ»!<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />La eliko la bɔtɛ ba Yesu kaiki la lɔbaɔ lɔnɛ laandeki bako aliko la lako nte: «Ɔnɛ ko Bɔkɔta Baayuda».<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Ɔmɔɔ a bango baphoka baphee bauleyami waalemba, aanjisa ntola Yesu la nɔnda: «Kapha wɛɛ kole Kilisito anɛ, wiikakole wɛɛmɛlɛ, la otokakole la iso ŋango akɔ»! <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Kinaki ongo onkinɛ aophangweli wiina lande la mboosimela: «Wɛɛ phalawa Kanamombe koonga ŋaanɛ bombo tumbyama wɛɛ ya libweelo kaama kamɔɔ la ɔnɛ onto? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Kaso iso tasana tɔnɛ toakola, aliko inɛ ko ngɛlama ya ingo bɛkɛɛki iso. Kinaki ɔnɛ onto ndako koo nkɛɛ koonga bobe bɔmɔɔ».<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Ɔkɔngɔ la ongo liphoka nsimela wiina lande bingo, asimeli Yesu nte: «Ɛɛ Yesu! Onkanya weeleko eanda wɛɛ wɛɛnte Bɔkɔta». <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu aosimeli: «Sɔlɔ mbokosimela, lɛlɔ ɛnɛ akondo yala kaama kamɔɔ lami e Paladisɔ*».<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombobwa waalemba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44-45" />Eleko eiki kako kembosukamela saa isamalo e yaani; yaani yatiki mpasha ekowa, wiilima baliphi wooni lalikuli nende saa libwa. La esenda eliphamaki otema ba lulu la Kanamombe keati biati biphee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.44-45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Engo esenda kiiki kembo phaka kaama kaɛlɔ la kaama kaɛlɔ ka kaɛlɔ ya lulu ya Kanamombe. Baiylo ba baeta atei bako atoo ko baiki batatande engo esenda o nchwa nsaŋana la Kanamombe. Anɛ, Kanamombe aati engo esenda ɔmɛnya nte kila onto aɔsɔna anɛ mboosukamela. Ɔsɔmɛ Mpasa 26.31-33; Baebalaniya 10.19-22.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 23:44-45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu aokomi la jooi linɛnɛ nte: «Phapha, mbokicha lisolo jami waakasa babɛ». Pa nsila nɔnda ŋango a kɔphɔli lisolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Sabuli 31. 6.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Ango, waiyolo baakɔlɔbɔi Baalɔma aɛni ndako bingo lalikuli bɛkɛɛmaki, akuchisa Kanamombe nte: «Sɔlɔ ɔnɛ wiiki nde bonto a sɔlɔ».<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Banto lalikuli baandi mɛna bengo besao bepaseli, bautoli kaɔ bataiphome o ntolo la ŋandi. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Biseka lalikuli be Yesu, la bango bainto baotindeyaki mima e Galilaya, baemali bɔɔ ɔ nenda bingo bitakɛɛma.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo kunjama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Kaiki la bonto ɔmɔɔ aelelamaki Yɔsɛfu, a ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Alimateya e wooni ba Yudeya. Ongo Yɔsɛfu wiiki bonto bɔlɔti lonkinɛ boso sɔlɔ. Wiiki atakonge ekeleka e Kanamombe kiiye. Lonkinɛ wiiki ɔmɔɔ a mbalasa nɛnɛ Yaayuda. Kinaki ndako koo mbokona la baina lande o yuungu ya njaka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Laango, ongo Yɔsɛfu achwe ele Pilato nɔmba bionge be Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Pa aikichisa ingo bionge mima waalemba, alɛngisa sanda njɛlɔ, o beko, la aikichisa e jombo ja chimama ɔ libwɛ. O lingo libwɛ kaiki kotakunjamaka koonga bonto ɔmɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Longo luina, laiki luina laitano, la Sabato* yaiki yata anje.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Bango bainto batindeyaki Yesu mima e Galilaya balingitaki Yɔsɛfu. Balendaki jombo la mɛna ŋango bionge bende Yesu be kunjami otema. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Pa, bautoli e lulu nɔngɔsɔla bauta ba limbala ba ndisa bionge be Yesu. Wiina ba Sabato*, ba umoisa ŋango balɔndami Isaliya.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Ntondwa ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoa 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Aiye kako luina la yiinga mpendu kɛmɛlɛ, bango bainto baɛmwɛli o baombo, bale la bauta ba limbala banɛ balɔngɔsɔli bako. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Batani libwɛ jakichami ɔ lɔkukɛ ja jombo limbo sɛmɛyama e mpamba. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Baingeli e jombo, kinaki koo ntana bionge be Bɔkɔta Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Bengo besao beasebalali ike aiki bako baloko bata sebalala, kako nkango banto baphee balɔtaki bisenda biɛlɔ pɛɛ, baemali sukɛlɛ la bako. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Ango aliko la wɔɔma, bango bainto balendi anyɔi. Kinaki bango banto baasimeli nte: «Aliko laanke etaone nyo bonto ɔnɛ ole e luiko asamba babwe? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Apha lonkinɛ anɛ, ombosila tondwa! Kanya nyo besao bekosimeli nyo ndako eleko iiki ndako oloko Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Mbɔ alɔndi nte: ‹Kasana lemi Bɔna a Onto mpakeme waakaasa baanto babe. Bakondo ntumbya waalemba, kinaki luina la isato pa mbwa yami, lakondo tondwa›».<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Bango bainto ango bakanyisa besao bengo Yesu aasimelaki. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Baimi e jombo, bachwe nsimela bakɛndi joomu la ɔmɔɔ ba Yesu la bankinɛ banto bengo besako. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Bango bainto basimelaki bakɛndi bengo besako ko banɛ: Maliya aɔsɛngɛ ba Magadala, Yɔana la Maliya nyɛngɛnde la Yakɔbɔ, la bainto bankinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Kinaki Baeki bakanyisa nte bengo besako be bango bainto bile koo sikisiki, la koo mboobiimeya.<verse eid="LUK 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Kinaki Pɛtɛlɛ ndako aemali la nchwa loango e jombo. Aiye ndako engo, ainami, aɛni nsanda ntoo ɛnɛ ɛlɛngisa ako kako bionge be Yesu. Pa, autoli kande atasebalala ike aliko la besao bɛnɛ bembo kɛɛma.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo pasela baeki baphee e mboka e Emau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mlk 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Luina lako longo, baphee ba baeki ba Yesu, baiki batachu ɔɔsɛngɛ ɔmɔɔ baelelamaki Emau. Bongo bɔsɛngɛ baphikami o bilomɛtɛlɛ ilango joomu la ɛmɔɔ la ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛlusalɛma. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Baiki batachu bata ɔmbɔla aliko la bengo besao lalikuli bɛkɛɛmi. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Aiki bako baloko bata ɔmbɔla la mumbolana, Yesu nɛmɛlɛ aapaseli, la nsambela la bako mboka. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Bawɛɛni, kinaki baiso baɔ baliphami bataweeyake.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu abaumboli: «Olenyo atachu ataɔmbɔla nyo aliko laanke»? La bako baemali bii, bale la ŋandi. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Ɔmɔɔ abɔ aelelami Kɛlɛɔpa, awuuchisa nte: «Wɛɛmɛlɛ opholi ɛ Yɛlusalɛma kole phataeye binɛ beetami ɔnɛ wɛɛnɛ biina bephee»? <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />La ndako abauchisa nte: «Ko besao nkee»? La bako bawuuchisa: «Tataɔmbɔla aliko la besao beobae Yesu a Nasalɛti! Ɔnɛ Yesu wiiki nde wɛɛni ɔ nɛnɛ. Lonkinɛ wɛɛnyisa nkulu yande ɔ nɔnda la nkɛɛ bintɔmpɔ otamboka ba Kanamombe la otamboka baanto.<verse eid="LUK 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />«Baiyolo ba Baeta atei baso la bɛkongo bɛso, baophaki aliko atumbyame mbwa. Pa baotumbisa waalemna. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Iso tuiki la tandakicha lokani nte ndako ka kakola Isilaeli. Kinaki, lɛlɔ ko luina la isato bengo besao bɛkɛɛmi. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Lonkinɛ, bainto bamɔɔ ba boloi ba kaso ba mbotosebalala. Banɛ bainto ba emweli mpendu e jombo, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />kinaki koo ntana bionge bende. Bautoli ba baɛlisa besako nte biphongo baapaseli la mbwasimela nte Yesu olende e luiko. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Pa bankinɛ bamɔɔ baso bachwe e jombo, batani besao wɛɛnte ŋango bɔlɔndi bango bainto. La bako ŋango akɔ koo mɛna bionge bende».<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Ango Yesu aasimeli bango baeki nte: «Nyo banto bale bapha la limanya, basolo banyo balende bolito o mimeya loango besao lalikuli bɛnɛ bɛlɔndi baɛɛni. <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Mbɔ kosani Kilisito* atumbyame ŋaanɛ otamboka ba mingela o bokuchu bande»! <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Pa aasimeli besao bɛnɛ beandekami aliko lande ɔ Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ. Aanjisa o mabuku ba Musa nende o mabuku ba Baɛɛni lalikuli.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Asukameli bako ɔɔsɛngɛ bachwelaki bako kako, Yesu akee wɛɛnte ɔnɛ aeta. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Kinaki baɔsɛi nte: Philiye komemeyake lonkinɛ la lɔkɛndɔ aliko wiina bawoona mbila. Aingeli e lulu la njala la bako. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Eleko eyali ndako ɔ ndɛ la bako, Yesu aɔsi kitumbula asakoisa Kanamombe, akekeloli, aaphakeli. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Ango kako nkango baiso baɔ baliphowe, baweeyi; kinaki Yesu alimeli o baiso baɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Baanjisa nsimelana nte: «Sɔlɔ! Basolo baso baiki la libɛla eleko ɛnɛ iiki ndako atatosimela aiki la Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ engo e mboka».<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Kako nkango bango baeki* baphee baemali la mbutola ɛ Yɛlusalɛma. Batani bango bakɛndi* joomu la ɔmɔɔ la banto bankinɛ ba boloi baɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Bango basaŋani basimeli bango baeki* baphee nte: «Sɔlɔ Bɔkɔta ombo tondwa! Koonga Simo ɔ wɛɛni»!<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />La bango baeki* baphee baasimeli baina labɔ bingo beapaseli e mboka, bolengo nke baeyi bako Yesu eleko akeloli ndako kitumbula.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo apasela Baeki* bande</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoa 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bsb 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Eleko bango baeki* baphee baiki baloko bataɔmbɔla kako nkango, Yesu apaseli asamba bako. Aasimeli nte: «Yala nyo la bii»!<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Laango, baeki lalikuli babaemi la wɔɔma ike, aliko bakanyisa nte ba mɔɛna boyombi. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Kinaki Yesu abaumboli nte: «Aliko laanke embosowa nyo? Aliko laanke ole nyo la mashaka waasolo banyo? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Lenda nyo baambo bami la bekolo bemi, kolende lemi lɛɛmɛlɛ sɔlɔ. Ɔmbabate nyo, la wɛɛni nyo. Aliko boyombi phayalaka la benu aɔ baumba. Kinaki lemi ɔmwɛna nyo nende la beko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu ɔlɔndi bingo aliko baeki baɛni besose be misumwali waakasa la bekolo bende. Olangi nte baimeya sɔlɔ nte olende ndako too. </char></note>». <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Pa Yesu nɔnda bingo, abaɛnyisa baambo la bekolo bende.<verse eid="LUK 24:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Bango baeki* baiki bata imeya jɛ, aliko la libɛla la nsebalala yaɔ. Wiingo Yesu abaumboli nte: «Olende nyo la limɔɔ lilɛ anɛ»?<verse eid="LUK 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bawɔyisa eteni e nsee e ntumba. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Akɛɔsi, la alee, bako lalikuli bata wɛɛni. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Pa aasimeli, eleko iiki lemi kaama kamɔɔ lanyo lakosimeli nyo nte: Besao beandekami aliko lami wiisaliya ya Musa la omabuku ba baɛni la olibuku ja Sabuli kasana bekokyame lalikuli.<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Ango Yesu, aalipholi limanya jaɔ, nte baeye Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Lonkinɛ aasimeli nte: «Komoandekama nte kasana Kilisito* atumbyame, la biina besato ɔkɔngɔ ya mbwa yande atondwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ 53; Hɔsɛya 6.2.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />La o lokombo lande, nde ke simela bako banto lalikuli nte batulwa la mpasa o njambi yaɔ, aliko batikelame. La bingo bianjele ɛ Yɛlusalɛma. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Nyo ko basuula wɛɛnɛ besao. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />La lemi lakondo kotomela nyo ɔnɛ akolakeli nyo isɛmi. Kinaki nyo yala nyo obi ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛlusalɛma nende eleko eba nyo nkulu mima e loola<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Bisima be Baeki 1. 4-5.</char></note>».<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombuulela e loola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mlk 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bsb 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Pa Yesu apasi la baeki* bande ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛlusalɛma la mbwatɔla sukɛlɛ la ɔsɛngɛ ba Betaniya. Aiye bako ango, asakoli bakasa bande eliko, la aachweli bochwako. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Eleko iiki ndako oloko ataachwela bochwako, aachiki, la aɔsami e loola. <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus va au ciel" file="WA303935b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="24.51">Yesu ombochwa e loola</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />La bako ŋango akɔ baɔkuchisa. Pa bautoli ɛ Yɛlusalɛma la libɛla ike. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Biina lalikuli, baiki bale otema ba lulu ba Kanamombe bataokucha, Kanamombe.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>